 Force",["quest"]=98407,["y"]=0.6}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:37",["text"]="Deputy Feldon",["detail"]="East along the road to the gryphon master; Deputy Feldon stands beside her."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Oslow's Toolbox",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=32,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:38:1",["quest"]=125,["y"]=0.5466,["x"]=0.3643,["item"]=1309,["from"]="Sunken Chest",["title"]="The Lost Tools",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Oslow's Toolbox; underwater"},{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Spotted Sunfish",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:40:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="6,3,5,1,4;3,5,1,4,6;6,1,4,3,5;6;3,5;1,4;1,4,6,7;6;3,5,2",["title"]="Selling Fish",["y"]=0.5564,["x"]=0.3567,["item"]=1467,["lvl"]=19,["quest"]=127,["count"]=10,["spread"]=true,["t"]="collect"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:step:40",["text"]="Sunken Chest",["detail"]="Back toward town, swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed beside a sunken boat. Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore around it: any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish.\nCareful: Lake Threshers, level 25 elites, swim in the lake: keep your distance from them while you dive for the chest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Hilary's Necklace",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=154357,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:39:1",["quest"]=3741,["y"]=0.545,["x"]=0.3281,["item"]=10958,["from"]="Glinting Mud",["title"]="Hilary's Necklace",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Hilary's Necklace; underwater"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:39",["text"]="Hilary's Necklace",["detail"]="Then west under the bridge: a Glinting Mud mound on the lake bed beside town holds the necklace. Only one mound shows at a time, anywhere from under the dock to past the bridge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8962,["npcName"]="Hilary",["x"]=0.2415,["title"]="Hilary's Necklace",["quest"]=3741,["y"]=0.5363},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=341,["npcName"]="Foreman Oslow",["x"]=0.2705,["title"]="The Lost Tools",["quest"]=125,["y"]=0.4864},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Its pikes and rivets come from the gnolls north of the lake, on the loop after Westfall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=341,["y"]=0.4864,["x"]=0.2705,["title"]="The Everstill Bridge",["minLevel"]=15,["pre"]={125},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=89,["npcName"]="Foreman Oslow"},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=381,["npcName"]="Dockmaster Baren",["x"]=0.2263,["title"]="Selling Fish",["quest"]=127,["y"]=0.4738},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=342,["npcName"]="Martie Jainrose",["x"]=0.1677,["title"]="Visit the Herbalist",["quest"]=130,["y"]=0.4633},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=342,["y"]=0.4633,["x"]=0.1677,["title"]="Delivering Daffodils",["minLevel"]=12,["pre"]={130},["qlvl"]=15,["quest"]=131,["npcName"]="Martie Jainrose"},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Darcy, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=379,["npcName"]="Darcy",["x"]=0.21530000000000002,["title"]="Delivering Daffodils",["quest"]=131,["y"]=0.44299999999999995},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Chef Breanna, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=343,["npcName"]="Chef Breanna",["x"]=0.1759,["title"]="Redridge Goulash",["quest"]=92,["y"]=0.4384}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:40",["text"]="Lakeshire",["detail"]="Through town east to west: Hilary and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, then Martie Jainrose's garden at the west end; Darcy and Chef Breanna are in the inn."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:41:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=381,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=20}},["npcName"]="Dockmaster Baren",["x"]=0.2263,["title"]="Murloc Poachers",["minLevel"]=20,["y"]=0.4738,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=150,["note"]="Dockmaster Baren, on the docks"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:41",["text"]="Dockmaster Baren",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=20}},["detail"]="From level 20 Dockmaster Baren gives Murloc Poachers: take it now if he offers it (otherwise on the last Lakeshire stop). Its murlocs are for your next Redridge visit, at about 24."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["x"]=0.42100000000000004,["y"]=0.659,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:42:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Goldshire",["area"]=87}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:42",["text"]="Goldshire",["detail"]="West out of Redridge by Three Corners and along the road through Elwynn to Goldshire."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:43:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=514,["npcName"]="Smith Argus",["x"]=0.4171,["title"]="The Price of Shoes",["quest"]=118,["y"]=0.6554000000000001},{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:43:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=514,["y"]=0.6554000000000001,["x"]=0.4171,["title"]="Return to Verner",["minLevel"]=13,["pre"]={118},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=119,["npcName"]="Smith Argus"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:43",["text"]="Smith Argus",["detail"]="Smith Argus works at the Goldshire smithy."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="General Marcus Jonathan, outside the main gate",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:44:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=466,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["npcName"]="General Marcus Jonathan",["x"]=0.6917,["title"]="Messenger to Stormwind",["quest"]=120,["y"]=0.8271999999999999},{["map"]=1453,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:44:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=466,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["y"]=0.8271999999999999,["x"]=0.6917,["title"]="Messenger to Stormwind",["minLevel"]=14,["pre"]={120},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=121,["npcName"]="General Marcus Jonathan"},{["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:44:3",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Lakeshire",["t"]="fly",["node"]=5,["area"]=69}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:44",["text"]="Stormwind's gate",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["detail"]="No Defias Brotherhood from Wiley (it starts with Gryan Stoutmantle's letter in Westfall): skip Westfall. North along the road from Goldshire to Stormwind: General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate. Then the gryphons in the Trade District, back to Lakeshire."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1436,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:45:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["y"]=0.19399999999999998,["x"]=0.599,["text"]="Sentinel Hill",["area"]=108}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:45",["text"]="Westfall",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=65}},["detail"]="West through Westbrook into Westfall."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1436,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:46:1",["t"]="turnin",["np