04-redridge-mountains:33",["text"]="Alther's Mill",["detail"]="Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around Alther's Mill, north-east of the lake; their Tarantula Eggs lie on the ground among them: click six."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Battleworn Axe",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:34:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.705,["x"]=0.71,["title"]="Blackrock Menace",["lvl"]=21,["item"]=3014,["count"]=10,["quest"]=20,["fromNpcsAt"]="2,1,3;2,3,4;3,2;3,2;1,2;2;1;3,2,4,1;3,2;3,2;1,2;1,2,4;1,4;1,6,4;4,6,5;5,4,6;5,4,6"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:34",["text"]="Blackrock camps",["detail"]="South-east from the mill, west of Galardell Valley's gnolls, to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep. Renegades, Grunts and Outrunners fill them; keep east of the keep, whose orcs are elite. Weapon racks and swords lie about the camps; meat haunches, grain sacks and water barrels hold the supplies."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:39",["text"]="Incinerator Gar'im",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Gar'im keeps to the cave at the camps' south end with his imp and two orcs. Elite: group up if you can; solo, pull the orcs at the mouth first and interrupt his fire cast."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Shadowhide Pendant",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:36:1",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,6,7,2;2,1,7,4,6,8;2,7;2,1,6,8;4,5,3,7;4,5;6,3,2,7;6,4,7,5;3,6,2,1,9,7;6,7,2,1,3;4;6,2,1,7",["title"]="Solomon's Law",["y"]=0.5927,["x"]=0.7770999999999999,["item"]=1075,["lvl"]=26,["note"]="Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll",["count"]=10,["quest"]=91,["t"]="collect"},{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Fangore's Paw",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=703,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:36:2",["y"]=0.37060000000000004,["x"]=0.7509,["count"]=1,["from"]="Lieutenant Fangore",["quest"]=180,["item"]=3632,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="WANTED: Lieutenant Fangore"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:36",["text"]="Galardell Valley",["detail"]="North up the valley's east side. Shadowhide gnolls fill it; Lieutenant Fangore (26) and his two guards stand at its north end: clear the gnolls around him first and fight at full health. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the west until the watch tower: its orcs are elite."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:37:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.4683,["x"]=0.794,["title"]="A Watchful Eye",["objName"]="Old Lion Statue",["quest"]=94,["object"]=31},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:37:2",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=22,["y"]=0.4683,["x"]=0.794,["title"]="Looking Further",["objName"]="Old Lion Statue",["pre"]={94},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=248,["object"]=31}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:37",["text"]="A Watchful Eye",["detail"]="The Old Lion Statue stands at the valley's east edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:38:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.4984,["x"]=0.5816,["title"]="Looking Further",["objName"]="An Empty Jar",["quest"]=248,["object"]=76}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:38",["text"]="Looking Further",["detail"]="West to the intact watch tower beside Stonewatch Keep: climb it and leave the Glyph in the empty jar at the top."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:43",["text"]="Stonewatch Keep",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The keep stands beside the tower. Gath'Ilzogg (elite) waits in the keep's top room with two guards and a dragon; Blackrock Shadowcasters (elite) and Sentries stand on its west side, so pull one at a time on the way in, and hug the right wall as you enter his room so you don't pull him at once. Elite: group up if you can."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Yowler's Paw",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=518,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:40:1",["y"]=0.21600000000000003,["x"]=0.22699999999999998,["count"]=1,["from"]="Yowler",["quest"]=126,["item"]=3614,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Howling in the Hills"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:40",["text"]="Yowler",["detail"]="From the keep head back west along the lake's north shore and north up the Redridge Canyons. Just south of Render's Valley, Yowler, a level 25 gnoll, walks among the Redridge Alphas and Mystics."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Blackrock Champion, below ground",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:41:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=435,["y"]=0.1725,["x"]=0.2351,["title"]="Blackrock Bounty",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Blackrock Champion",["quest"]=128,["count"]=15}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:41",["text"]="Render's Valley",["detail"]="From the keep head back west along the lake's north shore and north up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley; Lakeshire's hand-ins wait for Keeshan's escort, which ends there. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Corporal Keeshan, below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:42:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=349,["npcName"]="Corporal Keeshan",["x"]=0.233,["escort"]=true,["minLevel"]=19,["y"]=0.1255,["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=219,["title"]="Missing In Action"},{["title"]="Missing In Action",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:42:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=219,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Corporal Keeshan back to Redridge"}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:42",["text"]="Corporal Keeshan",["detail"]="Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:44",["text"]="Magistrate Solomon: Gath'Ilzogg",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:44",["text"]="Magistrate Solomon: Incinerator Gar'im",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=900,["npcName"]="Bailiff Conacher",["x"]=0.2463,["title"]="Solomon's Law",["quest"]=91,["y"]=0.4426},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=344,["npcName"]="Magistrate Solomon",["x"]=0.249,["title"]="WANTED: Lieutenant Fangore",["quest"]=180,["y"]=0.4445},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Verner Osgood, by the road on the way to the bridge",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=415,["npcName"]="Verner Osgood",["x"]=0.2588,["title"]="Howling in the Hills",["quest"]=126,["y"]=0.4727},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=382,["npcName"]="Marshal Marris",["x"]=0.2841,["title"]="Missing In Action",["quest"]=219,["y"]=0.48969999999999997},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=382,["npcName"]="Marshal Marris",["x"]=0.2841,["title"]="Blackrock Menace",["quest"]=20,["y"]=0.48969999999999997},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=341,["npcName"]="Foreman Oslow",["x"]=0.2705,["title"]="Alther's Mill",["quest"]=98386,["y"]=0.4864},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Guard Howe, by the gryphons south of the bridge",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=903,["npcName"]="Guard Howe",["x"]=0.2645,["title"]="Blackrock Bounty",["quest"]=128,["y"]=0.5785},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:45:9",["text"]="Next: the gryphon to Darkshire for Duskwood's second loop (05-duskwood).",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:45",["text"]="Back to Lakeshire",["detail"]="Into Lakeshire from the north with Keeshan: Bailiff Conacher and Magistrate Solomon in the town hall, Marshal Marris and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, then over the bridge to Guard Howe and the gryphons."}},["max"]=27,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=24,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Duskwood & Redridge Mountains (solo 24-27)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Redridge Mountains",["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/alliance/05-duskwood"} end},
