"detail"]="Back west along the road from Shael'dryn, Astranaar is on the way to Ilkrud Magthrull: Pelturas Whitemoon is inside the building beyond the inn."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3664,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:25:1",["y"]=0.6069,["x"]=0.2528,["count"]=1,["from"]="Ilkrud Magthrull",["quest"]=973,["item"]=5533,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="The Tower of Althalaxx"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:25",["text"]="Ilkrud Magthrull",["detail"]="From Astranaar head south-west to the Ruins of Ordil'Aran south of the shrine: Ilkrud Magthrull and his voidwalkers hold them. Pull his guards first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:26:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3846,["npcName"]="Talen",["x"]=0.1479,["title"]="The Ancient Statuette",["minLevel"]=19,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1007,["y"]=0.3129},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Ancient Statuette",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=17783,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:26:2",["quest"]=1007,["y"]=0.20600000000000002,["x"]=0.142,["item"]=5424,["from"]="Ancient Statuette",["title"]="The Ancient Statuette",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Ancient Statuette, in the ruins on the shore"},{["itemName"]="Wrathtail Head",["item"]=5490,["quest"]=1008,["fromId"]=3711,["map"]=1440,["fromNpcsAt"]="5,1;1,5;5,1;5,1;3;3,4;4,3;3,4;1,5;4,3;3,4;6,2;2,6,4;2,6;;5;1,5;1,5;4,2;2,6;6,2",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:22:3",["fromAlso"]="Wrathtail Razortail",["note"]="Wrathtail Head: any Wrathtail naga on the strand",["title"]="The Zoram Strand",["y"]=0.2051,["x"]=0.1413,["count"]=20,["from"]="Wrathtail Myrmidon",["spread"]=true,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3712}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:22",["text"]="The Zoram Strand",["detail"]="Follow the coast north to the Zoram Strand. Talen camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:27",["text"]="Talen",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3846,["npcName"]="Talen",["x"]=0.1479,["title"]="The Ancient Statuette",["quest"]=1007,["y"]=0.3129},{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:27:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3846,["y"]=0.3129,["x"]=0.1479,["title"]="Ruuzel",["minLevel"]=20,["pre"]={1007},["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=1009,["npcName"]="Talen"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ring of Zoram",["item"]=5445,["quest"]=1009,["map"]=1440,["fromId"]=3943,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:28:1",["fromAlso"]="Lady Vespia",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Ruuzel",["y"]=0.2473,["x"]=0.1363,["count"]=1,["from"]="Ruuzel",["lvl"]=22,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=10559}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:28",["text"]="Ruuzel",["detail"]="Ruuzel walks the northern tip of the Zoram Strand with Wrathtail guards."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:25",["text"]="Blackfathom Deeps",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Blackfathom Deeps is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 22 to 30, and a full run takes about an hour. The way in is the sunken ruins at the north end of the strand: go down the stairs into the pit, swim through the tunnels under the wall, past the blue crystals, to the portal.\nInside: the naga and the satyrs drop the Corrupted Brain Stems for Gershala. Argent Guard Thaelrid, by a campfire in an underwater side room off Ghamoo-ra's room, has a quest for Darnassus, which this route leaves to the Dungeons page."},{["id"