15",["text"]="The Bluegill hovels",["detail"]="Follow the coast north out of Menethil into Bluegill Marsh. Three containers in the murloc hovels, south to north: the Damaged Crate, then the Sealed Barrel, then the Half-buried Barrel at the north end."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Cursed Marine; careful: Nightveiled Rotheap, a level 31 elite, roams this coast",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:16:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1158,["y"]=0.3095,["x"]=0.1352,["title"]="The Cursed Crew",["lvl"]=28,["target"]="Cursed Marine",["quest"]=289,["count"]=5},{["map"]=1437,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:16:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1157,["y"]=0.3075,["x"]=0.1384,["title"]="The Cursed Crew",["lvl"]=27,["target"]="Cursed Sailor",["quest"]=289,["count"]=13},{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Snellig's Snuffbox",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1159,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:16:3",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.3018,["x"]=0.1379,["title"]="The Cursed Crew",["from"]="First Mate Snellig",["item"]=3619,["note"]="Snellig's Snuffbox: First Mate Snellig",["quest"]=289,["count"]=1},{["itemName"]="Giant Crocolisk Skin",["item"]=3348,["quest"]=471,["map"]=1437,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2089,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:16:4",["y"]=0.2922,["x"]=0.1525,["title"]="Apprentice's Duties",["from"]="Giant Wetlands Crocolisk",["count"]=6,["lvl"]=26,["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:16",["text"]="The Lost Fleet: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Follow the coast north to the wrecked ship. Cursed Sailors walk the beach, Cursed Marines the deck; First Mate Snellig stands on the beach by the bow. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks lurk on the coast just north of it.\nCareful: Fen Creepers hide in stealth where the river splits close to the ghost ship, and they can join a fight."},{["goal