rom the Ashes doesn't need him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1244,["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Fire Taboo",["quest"]=277,["y"]=0.40399999999999997},{["map"]=1437,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:27:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1244,["y"]=0.40399999999999997,["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Blisters on the Land",["minLevel"]=20,["pre"]={277},["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=275,["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:27",["text"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["detail"]="Follow the road east to the Green Belt; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands by the river. Fire Taboo's flint came with you from your last Wetlands visit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Razormaw Incisors: from the raptors by the Dragonmaw Gates, on the Wetlands loop of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:28:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=270637,["npcName"]="Howin Kindfeather",["x"]=0.4936,["title"]="Razormaw Needling",["minLevel"]=21,["qlvl"]=29,["quest"]=98245,["y"]=0.4213},{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Trying Times: the Razormaw eggs, on the same loop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:28:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=270637,["npcName"]="Howin Kindfeather",["x"]=0.4936,["title"]="Trying Times",["minLevel"]=21,["qlvl"]=29,["quest"]=98246,["y"]=0.4213}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:28",["text"]="Howin Kindfeather",["detail"]="Howin Kindfeather camps among the Fenrunners, just west of Rethiel the Greenwarden."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Einar Stonegrip: for James Halloran in Menethil",["endNpcs"]={2094},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:30:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2093,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="Einar Stonegrip",["x"]=0.49920000000000003,["