Its entrance lies just south of the road west, east of Whelgar's dig.\nInside: the Thicket raptors and Shadetooth drop the hides for Halloran, a Highland Horror the root core for Rethiel the Greenwarden. Saltspine, Shadetooth and the Relic Guardian are the bosses; the Relic Guardian drops a Titan Relic, which starts a quest for Prospector Whelgar."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:35",["text"]="Prospector Whelgar",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Titan Relic from your Excavation Site: Wetlands run: Prospector Whelgar is below ground in his dig, west of the entrance on the way back west."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="On the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:32:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2104,["npcName"]="Captain Stoutfist",["x"]=0.0986,["title"]="War Banners",["quest"]=464,["y"]=0.5749},{["map"]=1437,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:32:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2104,["npcName"]="Captain Stoutfist",["x"]=0.0986,["title"]="From the Ashes",["quest"]=98221,["y"]=0.5749},{["map"]=1437,["preAll"]={464,98221},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:36:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2104,["title"]="Nek'rosh's Gambit",["y"]=0.5749,["x"]=0.0986,["minLevel"]=23,["npcName"]="Captain Stoutfist",["pre"]={98221},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=465,["note"]="For the Dragonmaw catapult, on the Wetlands loop of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills"},{["map"]=1437,["note"]="James Halloran, by the docks, on the way to the boat",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:32:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2094,["npcName"]="James Halloran",["x"]=0.0855,["title"]="Daily Delivery",["quest"]=469,["y"]=0.5574}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:36",["text"]="Captain Stoutfist",["detail"]="Hearth back to Menethil Harbor if you bound at the Deepwater Tavern, or walk west along the road: Captain Stoutfist stands on the top floor of Menethil Keep, James Halloran by the docks on the way to the boat."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["x"]=0.086,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:37:1",["text"]="Bluegill Raider",["y"]=0.69,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=28}}},{["map"]=1437,["note"]="grind on Bluegill Raider",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:37:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=28}},["npcName"]="Bluegill Raider",["x"]=0.0864,["lvl"]=29,["y"]=0.69,["level"]=28,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=1418}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:37",["text"]="Level 28",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=28}},["detail"]="Still below level 28? That happens when you start this guide here without the Wetlands and Ashenvale quests of the guides before it: top up on the Bluegill Raiders along the coast just south of Menethil before the boat, so Ashenvale's level 28-32 quests aren't too hard."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:38",["text"]="James Halloran",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Your Excavation Site hides: James Halloran, by the docks."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["x"]=0.045,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:33:1",["text"]="Boat to Auberdine",["y"]=0.5670000000000001,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:33",["text"]="Boat to Auberdine",["detail"]="The boat to Auberdine leaves from the far end of Menethil's western pier."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["note"]="Nord'el, from Sylessa Duskwhisper in Menethil Harbor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:34: