,["note"]="Fiora Longears, inside the inn in the north of town",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:9:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4456,["npcName"]="Fiora Longears",["x"]=0.6646,["title"]="Fiora Longears",["quest"]=1132,["y"]=0.4515},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:9:5",["text"]="Fiora Longears's next errand goes to Astranaar, off this route: leave it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Fiora Longears: the wyverns are in Thousand Needles, later in this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:9:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4456,["npcName"]="Fiora Longears",["x"]=0.6646,["title"]="Highperch Venom",["minLevel"]=25,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1135,["y"]=0.4515}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:9",["text"]="Theramore",["detail"]="The flight master stands by the gate of Foothold Citadel; Clerk Lendry and Commander Samaul are inside the citadel."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:10:1",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=35,["y"]=0.47600000000000003,["x"]=0.297,["title"]="Suspicious Hoofprints",["objName"]="Hoofprints",["pre"]={1282,1302},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=1284,["object"]=21015},{["map"]=1445,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:10:2",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=35,["y"]=0.48619999999999997,["x"]=0.2963,["title"]="The Black Shield",["objName"]="Black Shield",["pre"]={1302,1282},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=1253,["object"]=20992}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:10",["text"]="The Shady Rest Inn",["detail"]="Follow the road west out of Theramore to the burned inn on the road toward the Barrens: the black shield lies in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:11",["text"]="Into Barrens",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.495,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:11:1",["text"]="Into Barrens",["y"]=0.784,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6244,["npcName"]="Takar the Seer",["x"]=0.49310000000000004,["title"]="Devourer of Souls",["quest"]=1716,["y"]=0.5710000000000001},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:12:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6244,["y"]=0.5710000000000001,["x"]=0.49310000000000004,["title"]="Heartswood",["minLevel"]=20,["pre"]={1716},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1738,["npcName"]="Takar the Seer"},{["map"]=1413,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:12:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6244,["title"]="What Is Love?",["y"]=0.5710000000000001,["x"]=0.49310000000000004,["minLevel"]=20,["npcName"]="Takar the Seer",["pre"]={1716},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=65602,["note"]="What Is Love?: the incubus, beside the succubus; the Wooden Figurine is near the Heartswood"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:12",["text"]="Takar the Seer",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Highperch Venom Sac",["item"]=5809,["quest"]=1135,["map"]=1441,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=4107,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:13:1",["count"]=10,["y"]=0.375,["x"]=0.1265,["title"]="Highperch Venom",["lvl"]=29,["fromAlso"]="Highperch Consort",["from"]="Highperch Wyvern",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=4109}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:13",["text"]="Highperch",["detail"]="Down the Great Lift into Thousand Needles, then west to the wyverns' cliffs at Highperch. Every wyvern there can drop a venom sac. Careful: wait on the platform until the lift is level with it before you step on, and stay on it until it stops; the drop beside it kills."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["x"]=0.46299999999999997,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:14:1",["text"]="The canyons east of Highperch",["y"]=0.409,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:14",["text"]="Thousand Needles",["detail"]="East through the canyons. Freewind Post, a Horde camp with guards, sits on the mesa here: keep to the canyon floor and give the foot of its lifts a wide berth."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:15",["text"]="Thousand Needles",["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["x"]=0.778,["y"]=0.773,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:15:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Mirage Raceway",["area"]=2240}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["note"]="For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:16:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4452,["npcName"]="Kravel Koalbeard",["x"]=0.7779,["title"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["minLevel"]=28,["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=5762,["y"]=0.7726999999999999},{["map"]=1441,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:16:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4452,["npcName"]="Kravel Koalbeard",["x"]=0.7779,["title"]="Rocket Car Parts",["minLevel"]=28,["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=1110,["y"]=0.7726999999999999},{["map"]=1441,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:16:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4454,["npcName"]="Fizzle Brassbolts",["x"]=0.7806000000000001,["title"]="Salt Flat Venom",["minLevel"]=28,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1104,["y"]=0.7713},{["map"]=1441,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale:16:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4453,["npcName"]="Wizzle Brassbolts",["x"]=0.7814,["tit