ass training",["detail"]="Your level 34 ranks: the class trainers stand around the Trade District, Old Town, the Cathedral and the Mage Quarter; Sheldras Moontree, the druid trainer, stands north-west of the Mage Quarter. Shamans train in Ironforge, later in 30-40."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:33",["text"]="Boat to Auberdine",["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["x"]=0.2271,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:33:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Boat to Auberdine",["y"]=0.5669}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=33,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Stonetalon Peak"}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["x"]=0.364,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:goal:27:1",["text"]="Auberdine flight master",["y"]=0.456,["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=33,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Stonetalon Peak"}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=33,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Stonetalon Peak"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:goal:27:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Stonetalon Peak",["t"]="fly",["node"]=33,["area"]=467}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:step:27",["text"]="Fly to Stonetalon Peak",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"}},["detail"]="You know the Stonetalon Peak flight: it lands closer to Desolace than Astranaar does. From the peak, follow the road south through the mountains to the Charred Vale."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["x"]=0.364,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale:goal:28:1",["text"]="Auberdine flight master",["y"]=0.456,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=33,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Stonetalon Peak"}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=33,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Stoneta