orn-vale:19",["text"]="Elwynn Forest",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:20:1",["t"]="train",["npc"]=4732,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Randal Hunter",["x"]=0.8432,["y"]=0.6487},{["map"]=1429,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:20:2",["t"]="vendor",["npc"]=384,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Katie Hunter",["x"]=0.8415,["y"]=0.6548999999999999,["note"]="Katie Hunter: other colours, 20g"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:20",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["detail"]="At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Randal Hunter teaches Humans at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, beside Katie Hunter's horses. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:1",["text"]="Riding and Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:2",["text"]="Skyboat to Zephras Isle: the north side of Dalaran, about every five minutes.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather, the stablemaster and riding trainer at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, who also sells the Galestriders: the skyboat to the isle leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists the Galestriders."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:36:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=16227,["npcName"]="Bragok",["x"]=0.6308,["location"]="Ratchet",["y"]=0.3716,["node"]=80,["area"]=392},{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.634,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:24:1",["text"]="Boat to Booty Bay",["y"]=0.385,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:23",["text"]="Boat to Booty Bay",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome","NightElf","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Head north-west into the Barrens and up the coast to Ratchet: the boat to Booty Bay leaves from its dock, and Ratchet's gryphon master stands just above it."},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:24:1",["text"]="Level 40 with 100 gold later on? Randal Hunter teaches riding at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has the trip.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:24:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=16227,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Bragok",["x"]=0.6308,["location"]="Ratchet",["y"]=0.3716,["node"]=80,["area"]=392},{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.634,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:24:3",