"\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan",["quest"]=610,["item"]=4027,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:45",["text"]="Bloodsail camp",["detail"]="Leave town by the tunnel and follow the coast north; the letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan walks.\nCareful: the Bloodsail Mages and Warlocks here are level 40-43 and cast from range: pull one at a time and fight with your back to the open beach."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46",["text"]="Booty Bay",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2490,["npcName"]="First Mate Crazz",["x"]=0.281,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["quest"]=597,["y"]=0.7622},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2490,["y"]=0.7622,["x"]=0.281,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["minLevel"]=37,["pre"]={597},["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=599,["npcName"]="First Mate Crazz"},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2493,["y"]=0.759,["x"]=0.2859,["title"]="Keep An Eye Out",["minLevel"]=37,["pre"]={597},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=576,["npcName"]="Dizzy One-Eye"},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2487,["npcName"]="Fleet Master Seahorn",["x"]=0.2717,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["quest"]=599,["y"]=0.7701},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="keep it: the Wild Shore camp's charts and Swashbucklers (41-43) wait for the level-48 Booty Bay stop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2487,["y"]=0.7701,["x"]=0.2717,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["minLevel"]=37,["pre"]={599},["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=604,["npcName"]="Fleet Master Seahorn"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Deeg, on the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2488,["y"]=0.7735,["x"]=0.2692,["title"]="Up to Snuff",["minLevel"]=37,["pre"]={597},["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=587,["npcName"]="Deeg"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Catelyn the Blade, upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2542,["npcName"]="Catelyn the Blade",["x"]=0.2728,["title"]="\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan",["quest"]=610,["y"]=0.7753},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Gazban swims off the north-west coast, on the northern loop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:46:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2542,["y"]=0.7753,["x"]=0.2728,["title"]="The Curse of the Tides",["minLevel"]=32,["pre"]={610},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=611,["npcName"]="Catelyn the Blade"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Snuff",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:30:1",["fromNpcsAt"]="2,1,3;2;2;1,2;1;5;4,5;4,5",["y"]=0.705,["x"]=0.28,["title"]="Up to Snuff",["lvl"]=41,["item"]=3910,["count"]=15,["quest"]=587,["t"]="collect"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Dizzy's Eye",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:30:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.705,["x"]=0.28,["title"]="Keep An Eye Out",["lvl"]=41,["item"]=3897,["quest"]=576,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:30",["text"]="Bloodsail pirates: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries Dizzy One-Eye's eye: take them from the Raiders and Mages (39-41) at the Bloodsail camp on the beach just north of town, where you found the letter. Leave the Wild Shore camp south of town (Warlocks and Swashbucklers 41-43) for the level-48 visit."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:31",["text"]="Booty Bay",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Deeg, on the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:48:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2488,["npcName"]="Deeg",["x"]=0.2692,["title"]="Up to Snuff",["quest"]=587,["y"]=0.7735},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:31:2",["text"]="Fin Fizracket's Stranglethorn Fever (Mokk the Savage) waits for the level-48 Booty Bay stop: leave it for now.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:31:3",["text"]="Seahorn's Bloodsail Buccaneers: keep it for the level-48 Booty Bay stop, with the Wild Shore camp.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:48:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2493,["npcName"]="Dizzy One-Eye",["x"]=0.2859,["title"]="Keep An Eye Out",["quest"]=576,["y"]=0.759}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:32:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2501,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={606}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=606}},["npcName"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley",["x"]=0.2778,["title"]="Scaring Shaky",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=606,["y"]=0.7706999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:32",["text"]="Booty Bay",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={606}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=606}},["detail"]="You missed this on the route's earlier visit here: it comes first now. It is quick and opens the quests after it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Mistvale Giblets",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1557,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:33:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.6793,["x"]=0.3115,["title"]="Scaring Shaky",["lvl"]=41,["item"]=3919,["from"]="Elder Mistvale Gorilla",["quest"]=606,["count"]=5}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:33",["text"]="Gorilla hills",["detail"]="Head inland to the Mistvale gorilla hills. Elder Mistvale Gorillas drop the giblets."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:52:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2502,["npcName"]="\"Shaky\" Phillipe",["x"]=0.26899999999999996,["title"]="Scaring Shaky",["quest"]=606,["y"]=0.7359},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:52:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2502,["y"]=0.7359,["x"]=0.26899999999999996,["title"]="Return to MacKinley",["minLevel"]=30,["pre"]={606},["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=607,["npcName"]="\"Shaky\" Phillipe"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="for Stoley in Tanaris: keep it; on the top floor",["endNpcs"]={7881},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:34:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2501,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley",["x"]=0.2778,["qlvl"]=45,["minLevel"]=40,["y"]=0.7706999999999999,["title"]="Stoley's Debt",["quest"]=2872,["xp"]=390},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:52:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2501,["npcName"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley",["x"]=0.2778,["title"]="Return to MacKinley",["quest"]=607,["y"]=0.7706999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley: keep it, for the level-48 Booty Bay stop, with Zanzil's village",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:52:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2501,["y"]=0.7706999999999999,["x"]=0.2778,["title"]="Voodoo Dues",["minLevel"]=30,["pre"]={607},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=609,["npcName"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:34",["text"]="Booty Bay",["detail"]="Head back down to town; Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:59",["text"]="Cortello's scroll",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Optional: Cortello's scroll lies inside one of the three Bloodsail ships anchored off the coast just south of Booty Bay, on a middle or lower deck, and is not always on the same ship. Their crews are 42-45 pirates: clear your way from the edge, one at a time, and leave the captains (45-48), whom the route comes back for at 48."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:56:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=687,["y"]=0.431,["x"]=0.321,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["lvl"]=41,["target"]="Jungle Stalker",["quest"]=196,["count"]=10}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:56",["text"]="Jungle Stalkers",["detail"]="The Jungle Stalkers roam the slopes west of the mine."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:37:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=684,["y"]=0.325,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["target"]="Shadowmaw Panther",["count"]=10,["quest"]=192,["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:37",["text"]="Zul'Mamwe's Mystics and the Shadowmaw Panthers",["detail"]="East from the stalkers' slopes to the ruins of Zul'Mamwe: the Skullsplitter Mystics (39-40) in its northern half carry Brother Nimetz's fetishes. Careful: the Witch Doctors, Berserkers and Headhunters (41-44) hold the ruins' southern half: stay north. Then north-west toward the coast: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) prowl the jungle west of the ruins, often stealthed."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Blue Pearl",["item"]=4611,["quest"]=705,["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2744,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:38:1",["y"]=0.267,["x"]=0.28,["title"]="Pearl Diving",["from"]="Giant Clam",["count"]=9,["note"]="Blue Pearl; underwater",["fromKind"]="object",["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Stone of the Tides",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2624,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:57:2",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["x"]=0.24969999999999998,["title"]="The Curse of the Tides",["lvl"]=40,["item"]=4034,["from"]="Gazban",["quest"]=611,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:38",["text"]="The north-west coast",["detail"]="Go on north-west to the bay on the north-west coast. The Giant Clams lie on its floor and hold the pearls; Gazban swims among them and drops the Stone of the Tides."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Paw of Sin'Dall",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=729,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:39:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.1739,["x"]=0.3221,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["lvl"]=37,["item"]=3879,["from"]="Sin'Dall",["quest"]=188,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:39",["text"]="Sin'Dall",["detail"]="North-east from the bay toward Nesingwary's camp: Sin'Dall, the great tiger (37), lairs on the hilltop just south-west of the camp."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:40",["text"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:58:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=715,["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["quest"]=196,["y"]=0.1081},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin, beside him",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:40:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=718,["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["quest"]=192,["y"]=0.10550000000000001},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Ajeck Rouack, beside them",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:40:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=717,["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["quest"]=188,["y"]=0.10619999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:63",["text"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:66",["text"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Arbor Tarantula Specimen",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=217588,["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={93176}}},["y"]=0.16699999999999998,["x"]=0.431,["item"]=213566,["lvl"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:43:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["from"]="Arbor Tarantula"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:43",["text"]="Arbor Tarantula",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={93176}}},["detail"]="An Arbor Tarantula crawls in the jungle south-east of Nesingwary's camp, on the way to the Rebel Camp: catch one with the tool from Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:61:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=770,["npcName"]="Corporal Kaleb",["x"]=0.3774,["title"]="Return to Corporal Kaleb",["quest"]=622,["y"]=0.033}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:61",["text"]="Rebel Camp",["detail"]="Head north-east past Nesingwary's camp and follow the road north to the camp at the top of the vale."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:67",["text"]="Brother Nimetz",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Wendel Mathers, in his cage, if you didn't take it on the 30-40 loop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:46:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=218230,["npcName"]="Wendel Mathers",["x"]=0.44299999999999995,["title"]="The Cook in the Cage",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=97047,["y"]=0.079},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Compound Cage Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:46:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.06570000000000001,["x"]=0.4677,["title"]="The Cook in the Cage",["lvl"]=36,["item"]=216616,["count"]=1,["quest"]=97047,["note"]="Compound Cage Key, from the Subchiefs (or the Elites)"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Kurzen Fighter's Uniform",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=424002,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:46:3",["quest"]=97047,["y"]=0.08,["x"]=0.5,["item"]=216617,["from"]="Kurzen Supply Crate",["title"]="The Cook in the Cage",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Kurzen Fighter's Uniform, in the supply crate"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Wendel Mathers, back at his cage on the way out",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:46:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=218230,["npcName"]="Wendel Mathers",["x"]=0.44299999999999995,["title"]="The Cook in the Cage",["quest"]=97047,["y"]=0.079},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="For Captain Aransas in Booty Bay, at the end of the jungle loop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:46:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=218230,["y"]=0.079,["x"]=0.44270000000000004,["title"]="Returning to Port",["minLevel"]=30,["pre"]={97047},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=97048,["npcName"]="Wendel Mathers"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:46",["text"]="Kurzen's Compound",["detail"]="East from the Rebel Camp to Kurzen's Compound: Wendel Mathers is caged at its western edge. The Kurzen Subchiefs (35-36) and Elites (36-37) carry his cage key; the fighter's uniform lies in a supply crate in the compound's eastern part.\nCareful: Colonel Kurzen, an elite of 39-40, stands at the compound's north end beside three of the Subchiefs: take the key from the Subchiefs and Elites further south and leave him be."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:68",["text"]="Panther Mastery",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Bhag'thera is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Skullsplitter Tusk",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:48:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.36200000000000004,["x"]=0.45399999999999996,["title"]="Skullsplitter Tusks",["item"]=1524,["note"]="Skullsplitter Tusk, from the trolls of the ruins",["count"]=18,["quest"]=209,["fromNpcsAt"]=";;1;2"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Singing Blue Crystal",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:65:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.41409999999999997,["x"]=0.4238,["title"]="Venture Company Mining",["lvl"]=42,["item"]=3917,["quest"]=600,["count"]=10}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:48",["text"]="Ruins of Zul'Mamwe: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do.\nFollow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals.\nCareful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:69",["text"]="Raptor Mastery",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Tethis is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:70",["text"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:71",["text"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:77",["text"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:53",["text"]="Big Game Hunter",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. King Bangalash is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nCareful: Tigers and stealthed shadowmaw panthers roam close to him. Clear them before you pull him. When he is pulled, King Bangalash calls for help from creatures within 20 yd."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:54",["text"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:73:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2496,["npcName"]="Baron Revilgaz",["x"]=0.2723,["title"]="The Curse of the Tides",["quest"]=611,["y"]=0.7687},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Kebok, upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:73:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=737,["npcName"]="Kebok",["x"]=0.27,["title"]="Skullsplitter Tusks",["quest"]=209,["y"]=0.7713},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:73:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2498,["npcName"]="Crank Fizzlebub",["x"]=0.2712,["title"]="Venture Company Mining",["quest"]=600,["y"]=0.7720999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Krazek: for Tran'rek in Tanaris, keep it",["endNpcs"]={7876},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:55:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=773,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="Krazek",["x"]=0.2695,["qlvl"]=45,["minLevel"]=40,["y"]=0.7720999999999999,["title"]="Tran'rek",["quest"]=2864,["xp"]=390},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:55:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=218229,["npcName"]="Captain Aransas",[