berstill: other colours, 20g"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:108",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf"}},["detail"]="At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Ultham Ironhorn teaches Dwarves at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan, beside Veron Amberstill's rams. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:109:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["y"]=0.48100000000000004,["x"]=0.49200000000000005,["text"]="Steelgrill's Depot",["area"]=189}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:109",["text"]="Dun Morogh",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:110:1",["t"]="train",["npc"]=7954,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Binjy Featherwhistle",["x"]=0.4915,["y"]=0.4813},{["map"]=1426,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:110:2",["t"]="vendor",["npc"]=7955,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Milli Featherwhistle",["x"]=0.4913,["y"]=0.47950000000000004,["note"]="Milli Featherwhistle: other colours, 20g"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:110",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Gnomes at Steelgrill's Depot, just east of Kharanos, beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."}},["max"]=41,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=39,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Stranglethorn Vale, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows (solo 39-41)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Stranglethorn Vale",["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades"} end},
{id="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades",faction="Alliance",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=2548,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["y"]=0.479,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:1:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Ironforge flight master",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Dun Morogh",["area"]=1}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:1",["text"]="Ironforge flight master",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Dun Morogh",["area"]=1}},["detail"]="The Stranglethorn guide leaves Dwarves and Gnomes at their riding trainer in Dun Morogh: ride back west into Ironforge, where the flight to Lakeshire leaves from the gryphon master."},{["goals"]={{["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="zone",["name"]="Riverglades",["area"]=16591}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:2:1",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Lakeshire",["t"]="fly",["node"]=5,["area"]=69},{["map"]=1433,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:2:2",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="zone",["name"]="Riverglades",["area"]=16591}},["y"]=0.08900000000000001,["x"]=0.44799999999999995,["text"]="Blackrock Pass",["area"]=2417},{["map"]=2548,["x"]=0.16,["y"]=0.685,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:2:3",["t"]="goto",["text"]="The western Riverglades",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="zone",["name"]="Riverglades",["area"]=16591}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:2",["text"]="Into the Riverglades",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="zone",["name"]="Riverglades",["area"]=16591}},["detail"]="Fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire in Redridge, then follow the road north out of town and up through Blackrock Pass: it comes down into the western Riverglades by the Bristle Hills."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="The Lost Scout",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:3:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=260026,["npcName"]="Scout Bolain",["x"]=0.2366,["title"]="The Lost Scout",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=95147,["y"]=0.6781999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:3",["text"]="Scout Bolain",["detail"]="Scout Bolain waits beside the road east of the pass."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259353,["npcName"]="Cedric Dalton",["x"]=0.3957,["title"]="The Lost Scout",["quest"]=95147,["y"]=0.7467},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Gnoll Infestation",["endNpcs"]={259353},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259353,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="Cedric Dalton",["x"]=0.3957,["title"]="Gnoll Infestation",["minLevel"]=36,["xp"]=2850,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94678,["y"]=0.7467},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Southern Watch Gnoll Report: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:4:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259353,["y"]=0.7467,["x"]=0.3957,["title"]="Southern Watch Gnoll Report",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={95147},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=95148,["npcName"]="Cedric Dalton"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:4",["text"]="Southern Watch",["detail"]="Follow the road east to Southern Watch, the Alliance outpost above the river. The gnolls you passed on the way in are Captain Dalton's job: you go back for them after the lumber camp."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:5",["text"]="Snargl's Snout",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Snargl is an elite gnoll (level 40) who roams the south-western camps of the Bristle Hills: grouping up is advised."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Unsavory Plant Food",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:6:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256438,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner",["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="Unsavory Plant Food",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94842,["y"]=0.6292},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Stolen Saws",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256438,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner",["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="Stolen Saws",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94931,["y"]=0.6292}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:6",["text"]="Turner's Logging Camp",["detail"]="North up the road to the lumber camp. Halligan Turner runs it; his third job, the saplings, comes once his plant food is in."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:7:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=255770,["y"]=0.6,["x"]=0.34299999999999997,["title"]="Gnoll Infestation",["lvl"]=37,["target"]="Redridge Mystic",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94678,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:7:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=255772,["y"]=0.6009,["x"]=0.3432,["title"]="Gnoll Infestation",["lvl"]=37,["target"]="Redridge Trapper",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94678,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:7:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=255769,["y"]=0.6124,["x"]=0.3361,["title"]="Gnoll Infestation",["lvl"]=38,["target"]="Redridge Brute",["count"]=6,["quest"]=94678,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Saw Blade",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=624265,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:7:4",["y"]=0.64,["x"]=0.22,["count"]=8,["from"]="Stolen Tools",["quest"]=94931,["item"]=266897,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Stolen Saws"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:7",["text"]="The Bristle Hills",["detail"]="West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp on the slopes all the way from the hills west of the lumber camp to the pass you came in by. The stolen saw blades lie only in the western camps, near the pass.\nCareful: Snargl, an elite gnoll (level 40), roams the south-western camps: pull the gnolls away from him."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:8",["text"]="Snargl",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259353,["npcName"]="Cedric Dalton",["x"]=0.3957,["title"]="Gnoll Infestation",["quest"]=94678,["y"]=0.7467}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:9",["text"]="Southern Watch",["detail"]="Back east along the road to Southern Watch."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:10",["text"]="Cedric Dalton",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94679}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Clear 'em Out",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:11:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=262399,["npcName"]="Gelinda Coppergleam",["x"]=0.302,["title"]="Clear 'em Out",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=95792,["y"]=0.6920000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:11",["text"]="Gelinda Coppergleam",["detail"]="South-west past Southern Watch: Gelinda Coppergleam, a prospector, has camped by the Cinderscale dragonkin's hollow."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=262473,["y"]=0.722,["x"]=0.3,["title"]="Clear 'em Out",["lvl"]=40,["target"]="Cinderscale Whelp",["quest"]=95792,["count"]=8},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=262477,["y"]=0.731,["x"]=0.29600000000000004,["title"]="Clear 'em Out",["lvl"]=42,["target"]="Cinderscale Warrior",["quest"]=95792,["count"]=4}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:12",["text"]="The Cinderscale hollow",["detail"]="The whelps nest all over the hollow; the warriors (level 41-42) guard its back, by the Cubic Draconia. Scaldaron, a rare elite drake, can be up here too: leave him be unless you have a group."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:13",["text"]="Gelinda Coppergleam",["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=262399,["npcName"]="Gelinda Coppergleam",["x"]=0.302,["title"]="Clear 'em Out",["quest"]=95792,["y"]=0.6920000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Eleanor Holmsby: Eyes for the Watchman",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:14:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259050,["npcName"]="Eleanor Holmsby",["x"]=0.4343,["title"]="Eyes for the Watchman",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=94999,["y"]=0.8243}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:14",["text"]="Holmsby farm",["detail"]="Back past Southern Watch and south to the Holmsbys' farm by the river."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Freshwater Fiends",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:15:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258317,["npcName"]="Benjy Wheeler",["x"]=0.5489,["title"]="Freshwater Fiends",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94614,["y"]=0.73}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:15",["text"]="Benjy Wheeler",["detail"]="North-east across the fields to Wheeler's Grange: Benjy Wheeler wants the Mudfin murlocs on the river thinned out, the same murlocs whose heads Halligan Turner needs, so one pass along the river does both."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Curly: If a Tree Falls, and No One Hears...",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258935,["npcName"]="Curly",["x"]=0.461,["title"]="If a Tree Falls, and No One Hears...",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=39,["quest"]=94857,["y"]=0.71},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=258574,["y"]=0.7381,["x"]=0.4836,["title"]="Freshwater Fiends",["lvl"]=38,["target"]="Mudfin Warrior",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94614,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=258573,["y"]=0.7606,["x"]=0.48710000000000003,["title"]="Freshwater Fiends",["lvl"]=37,["target"]="Mudfin Oracle",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94614,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Mudfin Murloc Head",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.7606,["x"]=0.48710000000000003,["title"]="Unsavory Plant Food",["lvl"]=38,["item"]=267266,["quest"]=94842,["spread"]=true,["count"]=8},{["itemName"]="Jumbo Crawfish Shell",["item"]=266157,["quest"]=94842,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=258588,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:5",["y"]=0.7452,["x"]=0.5135000000000001,["title"]="Unsavory Plant Food",["lvl"]=40,["count"]=4,["from"]="Jumbo Crawfish",["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Fresh Manure",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=626594,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:16:6",["y"]=0.792,["x"]=0.462,["count"]=4,["from"]="Fresh Manure",["quest"]=94842,["item"]=266156,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Unsavory Plant Food"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:16",["text"]="Meadowsbrook and the river",["detail"]="Back south-west along the river: kill the Mudfin Warriors and Oracles on the banks for Benjy Wheeler (they drop Halligan Turner's heads) and the Jumbo Crawfish in the shallows for the shells. Curly, one of Halligan Turner's lumberjacks, is stuck on the bank just north-west of the murlocs; Robbie Holmsby's hat lies on the riverbank among them; the fresh manure is in the fields of Meadowsbrook, between the river and the farm. Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), prowls the river: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:17",["text"]="Robbie Holmsby",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259051,["npcName"]="Watcher Fredericks",["x"]=0.364,["title"]="Eyes for the Watchman",["quest"]=94999,["y"]=0.758}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:18",["text"]="Watcher Fredericks",["detail"]="Watcher Fredericks keeps the west end of Southern Watch."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256438,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner",["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="Stolen Saws",["quest"]=94931,["y"]=0.6292},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:19:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256438,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner",["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="Unsavory Plant Food",["quest"]=94842,["y"]=0.6292},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="From Seed to Sprout",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:19:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256438,["y"]=0.6292,["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="From Seed to Sprout",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94842},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94843,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:19",["text"]="Turner's Logging Camp",["detail"]="North up the road to the lumber camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Tree 