te Huntin'",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94615},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94617,["npcName"]="Benjy Wheeler"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:28:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258317,["y"]=0.73,["x"]=0.5489,["title"]="Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94615},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94618,["npcName"]="Benjy Wheeler"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Sootfur's Pelt",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=258522,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:29:1",["quest"]=94617,["y"]=0.85,["x"]=0.546,["item"]=265738,["from"]="Sootfur",["title"]="Coyote Huntin'",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["lvl"]=38}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:29",["text"]="The coyote den",["detail"]="The coyotes den in the hills south of the farm: Sootfur, the big dark one, sits at the back of it; the Plains Coyotes around it drop the pelts."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:30:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259254,["npcName"]="Lost Horse",["x"]=0.537,["title"]="Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds",["quest"]=94618,["y"]=0.6629999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Rescue Roundup",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:30:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259254,["escort"]=true,["npcName"]="Lost Horse",["x"]=0.537,["minLevel"]=36,["title"]="Rescue Roundup",["pre"]={94618},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94992,["y"]=0.6629999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="walk it back to Wheeler's Grange",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:30:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort the lost horse to Wheeler's Grange."}},["y"]=0.73,["x"]=0.5489999999999999,["title"]="Rescue Roundup",["quest"]=94992,["escort"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:30",["text"]="The lost horse",["detail"]="One of Benjy's horses ran north up the river, past the farm. Give it the feed, then lead it home."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:31",["text"]="Benjy Wheeler",["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:31:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258317,["npcName"]="Benjy Wheeler",["x"]=0.5489,["title"]="Rescue Roundup",["quest"]=94992,["y"]=0.73},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:31:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258317,["npcName"]="Benjy Wheeler",["x"]=0.5489,["title"]="Coyote Huntin'",["quest"]=94617,["y"]=0.73}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:32",["text"]="Foreman's Crate",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="North up the track towards Terral's Watch: the foreman's crate lies by the road."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Hunting the Hunters",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:33:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="Hunting the Hunters",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=39,["quest"]=94924,["y"]=0.6396999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="A Fur Trade",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:33:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="A Fur Trade",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=39,["quest"