 on your way north."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Fuzzle: Biting the Hand",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259158,["npcName"]="Fuzzle",["x"]=0.47200000000000003,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94961,["y"]=0.512},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Apprentice Claire: Abominable Magics",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256831,["npcName"]="Apprentice Claire",["x"]=0.47600000000000003,["title"]="Abominable Magics",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=95642,["y"]=0.47200000000000003},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256831,["npcName"]="Apprentice Claire",["x"]=0.47600000000000003,["title"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=95643,["y"]=0.47200000000000003},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Farmer Elbrim: What We Lost",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258697,["npcName"]="Farmer Elbrim",["x"]=0.528,["title"]="What We Lost",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94829,["y"]=0.424}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:40",["text"]="Sunnyglade",["detail"]="North from Farholde Keep, past Terral's Watch and across the river, to Sunnyglade, the farm town the Twilight cult holds; keep clear of Rog'mar, the Horde's fort east of the town. Fuzzle the kobold hides in the middle of the town, Apprentice Claire at its eastern edge, and Farmer Elbrim waits at his farm on the north-eastern edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="fill the Crystal Catalyst at the ritual circles",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=25,["text"]="Twilight Ritual Circle"}},["y"]=0.5,["x"]=0.478,["title"]="Abominable Magics",["startItemName"]="Crystal Catalyst",["startItem"]=269990,["quest"]=95642,["item"]=269990},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=261711,["y"]=0.506,["x"]=0.47700000000000004,["title"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["lvl"]=39,["target"]="Empowered Brute",["quest"]=95643,["count"]=5},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=262169,["y"]=0.5,["x"]=0.473,["title"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["lvl"]=41,["target"]="Twilight Ritualist",["quest"]=95643,["count"]=5},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=256952,["y"]=0.5291,["x"]=0.4569,["title"]="Saving Sunnyglade",["lvl"]=40,["target"]="Twilight Raider",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94877,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=254560,["y"]=0.5282,["x"]=0.4536,["title"]="Saving Sunnyglade",["lvl"]=40,["target"]="Twilight Shadowmancer",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94877,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:6",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=256798,["y"]=0.5302,["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Saving Sunnyglade",["lvl"]=38,["target"]="Twilight Neophyte",["count"]=8,["quest"]=94877,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Twilight Finger Bone",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:7",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5302,["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["lvl"]=40,["item"]=267073,["quest"]=94961,["spread"]=true,["count"]=20},{["itemName"]="Twilight Charm",["item"]=266425,["quest"]=94881,["map"]=2548,["fromId"]=254560,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:8",["t"]="collect",["fromAlso"]="Twilight Neophyte",["title"]="Curious Trinkets",["y"]=0.5302,["x"]=0.4534,["count"]=25,["lvl"]=40,["from"]="Twilight Shadowmancer",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=256798},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Loose Soil, west of Elbrim's farm: each grave takes one of the Farmers' Mementos the Twilight Raiders drop, so loot five first",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:9",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.446,["x"]=0.48200000000000004,["title"]="What We Lost",["objName"]="Loose Soil",["quest"]=94829,["object"]=621813},{["itemName"]="Field Marshal's Log",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:41:10",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Field Marshal's Log",["item"]=266427,["optional"]=true,["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94885,["note"]="Field Marshal's Log: only if a cultist dropped the log"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:41",["text"]="The Twilight cult",["detail"]="The cultists fill the streets and fields of Sunnyglade. Start at the ritual circles in the middle (fill Claire's catalyst there), work west through the burnt houses to the edge of town, then back north-east to the loose soil west of Elbrim's farm: bury the Farmers' Mementos the Twilight Raiders drop there. The charms, pages and finger bones drop from the cultists.\nKeep the Mageweave Cloth they drop: Brother Lowley in Farholde Keep asks for twenty when you are back there. Now and then a cultist drops the Field Marshal's Log: right-click it to start the quest.\nCareful: Chogg'Zac, an elite ogre (level 41), walks the western streets of Sunnyglade, around 44-47,47-52. Pull the cultists out towards you and let him pass; players died here more than anywhere else in the zone.\nGhostmaw, the river's elite (level 42), can wander up from the south-western fields: let him pass."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:42",["text"]="Apprentice Claire",["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:42:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256831,["npcName"]="Apprentice Claire",["x"]=0.47600000000000003,["title"]="Abominable Magics",["quest"]=95642,["y"]=0.47200000000000003},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:42:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256831,["npcName"]="Apprentice Claire",["x"]=0.47600000000000003,["title"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["quest"]=95643,["y"]=0.47200000000000003}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:43",["text"]="Cut Off the Heads",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Chogg'Zac, the two-headed ogre, is an elite (level 41) at the western edge of Sunnyglade: grouping up is advised. Claire then has the filled catalyst for Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:44:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259158,["npcName"]="Fuzzle",["x"]=0.47,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["quest"]=94961,["y"]=0.5},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Biting the Hand",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:44:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259158,["y"]=0.5,["x"]=0.47,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94961},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94963,["npcName"]="Fuzzle"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="lead Fuzzle out of Sunnyglade to his treasure, west of the town",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:44:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Help Fuzzle escape Sunnyglade."}},["y"]=0.47700000000000004,["x"]=0.41600000000000004,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["quest"]=94963},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:44:4",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.47700000000000004,["x"]=0.41600000000000004,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["objName"]="Fuzzle's Treasure",["quest"]=94963,["object"]=625582}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:44",["text"]="Fuzzle",["detail"]="Fuzzle wants out of Sunnyglade: lead him west to his treasure at the edge of town and keep the cultists off him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:45:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258697,["npcName"]="Farmer Elbrim",["x"]=0.528,["title"]="What We Lost",["quest"]=94829,["y"]=0.424}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:45",["text"]="Farmer Elbrim",["detail"]="Back east through the town to Elbrim's farm: the doll and the locket are in the burnt farmhouse beside it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:46:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=256749,["y"]=0.37,["x"]=0.608,["title"]="Preventative Measures",["lvl"]=39,["target"]="Rog'mar Trainee",["quest"]=95064,["count"]=12}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:46",["text"]="The Rog'mar training grounds",["detail"]="North-east of Elbrim's farm, the Horde drills its trainees in the fields north of Rog'mar. Stay north of the fort: its guards are far above your level. The supply crates lie around the drill grounds. Three elites work this ground: Blademaster Kaijo (42) walks among the trainees, Krek the Noxious (42) lurks at the north end, and Komuk (45), a Horde elite, patrols the hills to the east; give each of them room.\nCareful: Rog'mar Grunts (55) guard the fort's north wall, around 59,39 to 61,41. Leave the crates and trainees by the wall and take the ones further north, around 57-61,34-37."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:47",["text"]="Blademaster Kaijo",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Blademaster Kaijo, the elite, walks the training grounds."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Gaseous Gold",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:48:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263367,["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Gaseous Gold",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=96063,["y"]=0.486}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:48",["text"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout's workshop",["detail"]="South-east, round Rog'mar's east side, to Sleebo Fizzlespout's workshop on the hill. Komuk and the Bolder'ok ogres walk the road east of the fort: let them pass before you cross it."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Intact Tallstrider Beak",["fromFaction"]="A",["item"]=271778,["quest"]=95984,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=263348,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:49:1",["y"]=0.507,["x"]=0.6755,["title"]="Song of the Strider",["lvl"]=38,["count"]=1,["from"]="Roving Tallstrider",["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Marsh Gas Vial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=649232,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:49:2",["y"]=0.547,["x"]=0.636,["count"]=8,["from"]="Marsh Gas Vial",["quest"]=96063,["item"]=272004,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Gaseous Gold"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:49",["text"]="The tallstriders and the marsh",["detail"]="The Roving Tallstriders graze the meadows south-west of the workshop; further south-west the marsh bubbles with gas: fill the vials at the vents."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:50:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="Song of the Strider",["quest"]=95984,["y"]=0.6396999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:50:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="Preventative Measures",["quest"]=95064,["y"]=0.6396999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:50",["text"]="Terral's Watch",["detail"]="Watcher Cornelius's tower stands just south-west of the marsh."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:51:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257591,["npcName"]="Ashe Amberhall",["x"]=0.6675,["title"]="Curious Trinkets",["quest"]=94881,["y"]=0.8109999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="A Small Favor: for later in this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:51:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257591,["y"]=0.8109999999999999,["x"]=0.6675,["title"]="A Small Favor",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94881},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=94907,["npcName"]="Ashe Amberhall"},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:51:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257558,["npcName"]="Demar Brant",["x"]=0.6667000000000001,["title"]="Saving Sunnyglade",["quest"]=94877,["y"]=0.8101},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Out in the Field: for Watcher Cornelius at Terral's Watch, keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:51:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257558,["y"]=0.8101,["x"]=0.6667000000000001,["title"]="Out in the Field",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94877},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=95329,["npcName"]="Demar Brant"},{["map"]=2548,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:51:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263613,["title"]="Wound Dressings",["y"]=0.7897,["x"]=0.6555,["minLevel"]=36,["npcName"]="Brother Lowley",["pre"]={94877},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=96081,["note"]="Brother Lowley: twenty Mageweave Cloth, from Sunnyglade's cultists and the pirates; hand it in when you are back"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:51",["text"]="Farholde Keep",["detail"]="South across the plains to Farholde Keep: Ashe Amberhall and Demar Brant stand together in the keep at the east end, Ashe Amberhall first, her news is what Brant's next orders wait on. With Sunnyglade saved, Tessa Dawnbright by the orchard and Brother Lowley by the barracks have work for you too."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:52",["text"]="Tessa Dawnbright",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Tessa Dawnbright stands west of the inn, by the orchard: the apples hang on the trees around it."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:53",["text"]="Coyote pelts",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Plains Coyotes roam west and south-west of the keep, towards Wheeler's Grange."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:54",["text"]="Tessa Dawnbright",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:55",["text"]="King of the Wild Plains",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Ombassa, an elite lion (level 41), prowls the plains north of Terral's Watch, on your way back north: grouping up is advised."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:56",["text"]="Ombassa",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:57:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=263367,["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Gaseous Gold",["quest"]=96063,["y"]=0.486},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:57:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263367,["y"]=0.486,["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={96063},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=96067,["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="the stress test: beat G45-B4G beside the workshop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:57:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Fight G45-B4G in a stress test of Sleebo's engine."}},["y"]=0.486,["x"]=0.682,["title"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["quest"]=96067},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:57:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=263367,["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["quest"]=96067,["y"]=0.486}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:57",["text"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["detail"]="North-east to Sleebo Fizzlespout's workshop. Sleebo Fizzlespout's stress test is a fight with his G45-B4G beside the workshop: hand the quest in once it's beaten."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255897,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark",["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="A Few Furs for Friz",["quest"]=94928,["y"]=0.529},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Smuggler's Paradise",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=255897,["y"]=0.529,["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Smuggler's Paradise",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={94928,93976},["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=95288,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Frazzlespark's Crate: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=255897,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark",["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Frazzlespark's Crate",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=95059,["y"]=0.529},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Fresh Chum",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:4",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=260487,["npcName"]="Gritta Chumwater",["x"]=0.7848,["item"]=271657,["y"]=0.5379,["note"]="Fresh Chum, from Gritta Chumwater"},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Goblin Degreaser",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:5",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=260565,["npcName"]="Kor'gar",["x"]=0.7864,["item"]=271653,["y"]=0.5297999999999999,["note"]="Goblin Degreaser, from Kor'gar"},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Expired Poison",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:6",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=260560,["npcName"]="Krikshank",["x"]=0.7827,["item"]=271654,["y"]=0.5281,["note"]="Expired Poison, from Krikshank"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Fimbo Greasemitz: A Taste of the Sea",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259962,["npcName"]="Fimbo Greasemitz",["x"]=0.7902,["title"]="A Taste of the Sea",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=95121,["y"]=0.542},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="The WANTED! poster by the inn: Trapclaw",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:8",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.539,["x"]=0.785,["title"]="WANTED: Trapclaw",["objName"]="WANTED!",["object"]=628948,["minLevel"]=36,["quest"]=95254,["qlvl"]=42},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz: Saltwater Savages",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Saltwater Savages",["minLevel"]=36,["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=95118,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Unfriendly Competition",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:58:10",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Unfriendly Competition",["minLevel"]=38,["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=95119,["y"]=0.5271}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:58",["text"]="Powderfuse Port",["detail"]="East down the road to Powderfuse Port, the goblins' harbour. Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall at the west end of the docks; Gray Dawnbright, Innkeeper Zizplink and Fimbo Greasemitz are at the inn, and Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz works the north pier. Zizplink's drink needs three things the port's traders sell: the chum from Gritta Chumwater, the degreaser and the old poison from Kor'gar and Krikshank, by Friz Frazzlespark's stall."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:59",["text"]="WANTED: Old Rot-Chum",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42) on the south shore: grouping up is advised."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Painted Hide: Terrors From the Deep",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:60:1",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.6189,["x"]=0.7234999999999999,["title"]="Terrors From the Deep",["objName"]="Painted Hide",["object"]=629761,["quest"]=95260,["qlvl"]=42},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Saltwater Murloc Eye",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:60:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.615,["x"]=0.7240000000000001,["title"]="A Taste of the Sea",["lvl"]=41,["item"]=268344,["quest"]=95121,["spread"]=true,["count"]=12},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:60:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=256801,["y"]=0.615,["x"]=0.7240000000000001,["title"]="Saltwater Savages",["target"]="Murloc Warrior",["count"]=8,["quest"]=95118,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:60:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=255898,["y"]=0.616,["x"]=0.727,["title"]="Saltwater Savages",["target"]="Murloc Oracle",["count"]=8,["quest"]=95118,["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:60",["text"]="The murlocs, south-west",["detail"]="South-west along the shore from the port: the saltwater murlocs camp on the beaches. On the way, a painted hide is stretched beside the path: it starts Terrors From the Deep for Argo Brinewhistle at the docks."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:61",["text"]="Old Rot-Chum",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:62:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Saltwater Savages",["quest"]=95118,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:62:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=260231,["npcName"]="Argo Brinewhistle",["x"]=0.7995,["title"]="Terrors From the Deep",["quest"]=95260,["y"]=0.5249},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="It Takes Guts: the beasts' entrails come as you go; the mushrooms are for later",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:62:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=260231,["y"]=0.5249,["x"]=0.7995,["title"]="It Takes Guts",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95260},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=95261,["npcName"]="Argo Brinewhistle"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:62",["text"]="Back through the port",["detail"]="Back north along the shore: hand in the murlocs and the hide on the docks on your way to the crawlers."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Sand Crawler Meat",["item"]=268345,["quest"]=95121,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=255901,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:63:1",["count"]=6,["y"]=0.5279,["x"]=0.7859999999999999,["title"]="A Taste of the Sea",["from"]="Sand Crawler",["fromAlso"]="Shore Crawler",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=256807},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Trapclaw's Pincer",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=260235,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:63:2",["quest"]=95254,["y"]=0.49079999999999996,["x"]=0.7933,["item"]=268586,["from"]="Trapclaw",["title"]="WANTED: Trapclaw",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["lvl"]=42}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:63",["text"]="The crawlers and Trapclaw",["detail"]="North along the beach from the docks: the crawlers drop the meat for Fimbo Greasemitz and the spittle for Zizplink, and their entrails count for Argo Brinewhistle. Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the docks. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams this coast from the docks up to the pirates' camp: if you see him, keep well away."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:64:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257901,["y"]=0.4537,["x"]=0.8172,["title"]="Unfriendly Competition",["lvl"]=42,["target"]="Eastsea Buccaneer",["count"]=10,["quest"]=95119,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:64:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257910,["y"]=0.47,["x"]=0.8069,["title"]="Unfriendly Competition",["lvl"]=43,["target"]="Eastsea Musketeer",["count"]=10,["quest"]=95119,["spread"]=true},{["itemName"]="Smuggled Goods",["item"]=268796,["quest"]=95288,["map"]=2548,["fromId"]=257901,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:64:3",["t"]="collect",["fromAlso"]="Eastsea Musketeer",["title"]="Smuggler's Paradise",["y"]=0.47,["x"]=0.8069,["count"]=8,["lvl"]=43,["from"]="Eastsea Buccaneer",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=257910}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:64",["text"]="The Eastsea pirates",["detail"]="North-east along the coast to the pirates' camp on the cliffs. The buccaneers and musketeers carry the smuggled goods. Gul'gash walks the camp too: keep an eye out for him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Unfriendly Competition",["quest"]=95119,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Unchecked Expansion: for later in this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["y"]=0.5271,["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95119},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=95122,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!: for later in this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["y"]=0.5271,["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95119},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=95123,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259962,["npcName"]="Fimbo Greasemitz",["x"]=0.7902,["title"]="WANTED: Trapclaw",["quest"]=95254,["y"]=0.542},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259962,["npcName"]="Fimbo Greasemitz",["x"]=0.7902,["title"]="A Taste of the Sea",["quest"]=95121,["y"]=0.542},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255897,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark",["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Smuggler's Paradise",["quest"]=95288,["y"]=0.529},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Smuggler's Special: for Captain Bentcoin at the pirates' camp",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:65:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=255897,["y"]=0.529,["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Smuggler's Special",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95288},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=95293,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:65",["text"]="Powderfuse Port",["detail"]="Back to the port, from the north pier west through the docks."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:66",["text"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95120}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:67",["text"]="Beast Entrails as you go",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Most beasts in the Riverglades drop Beast Entrails for Argo Brinewhistle: the shore crawlers on this coast and the boars on the ridge west of the pirates.\nCareful: Old Rot-Chum (elite, 42), Komuk (a Horde elite, 45) and Ghostmaw (elite, 42) range over the zone's wilds: take your beasts away from them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["x"]=0.825,["y"]=0.425,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:68:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Eastsea Buccaneer",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.4,["k"]="level",["n"]=44}}},{["map"]=2548,["frac"]=0.4,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:68:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.4,["k"]="level",["n"]=44}},["npcName"]="Eastsea Buccaneer",["x"]=0.8162,["note"]="grind on Eastsea Buccaneer",["lvl"]=42,["y"]=0.415,["level"]=44,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=257901}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:68",["text"]="Level 44.4 on the Eastsea pirates",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.4,["k"]="level",["n"]=44}},["detail"]="Before the second wave: its raiders and bombardiers (43-45) and the pirates' ships after them are a level over you below 44.4. Top up on the first camp's buccaneers and musketeers (41-43) at its south-west end, away from the port. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs: if you see him, keep well away."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257915,["y"]=0.424,["x"]=0.8345999999999999,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["lvl"]=45,["target"]="Eastsea Raider",["count"]=8,["quest"]=95122,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257916,["y"]=0.33799999999999997,["x"]=0.7909999999999999,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["lvl"]=44,["target"]="Eastsea Bombardier",["quest"]=95122,["count"]=8},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Eastsea Powder Keg",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=629451,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:3",["y"]=0.33,["x"]=0.7979999999999999,["count"]=5,["from"]="Eastsea Powder Keg",["quest"]=95123,["item"]=268346,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:69",["text"]="The pirates' second wave",["detail"]="North along the coast from the port: the Eastsea raiders and bombardiers have dug in on the slopes west of the buccaneers' camp, among their powder kegs. They stand close together: pull them one at a time. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs and the beach below: if you see him, keep well away."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:70:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=260390,["npcName"]="Captain Bentcoin",["x"]=0.912,["title"]="Smuggler's Special",["quest"]=95293,["y"]=0.397},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:70:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=260391,["y"]=0.39799999999999996,["x"]=0.912,["title"]="Smuggler's Bargain",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95293},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=95294,["npcName"]="Captain Haynes"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:70",["text"]="Captain Bentcoin",["detail"]="East along the cliffs to the far end of the pirates' camp: Captain Bentcoin waits by the water, Captain Haynes beside him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["quest"]=95122,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!",["quest"]=95123,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["y"]=0.5271,["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={95123},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=95165,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255897,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark",["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Smuggler's Bargain",["quest"]=95294,["y"]=0.529}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:71",["text"]="Powderfuse Port",["detail"]="Back to the port."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.395,["x"]=0.909,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["note"]="Remote Explosive Charge, the southern ship"},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.29600000000000004,["x"]=0.9059999999999999,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["note"]="the middle ship"},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.258,["x"]=0.883,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["note"]="the northern ship"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:72",["text"]="The pirates' ships",["detail"]="Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north; Admiral Lamora (level 45) stands by the middle one, with her loot chest beside her. Keep an eye out for Gul'gash on the way."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Rotflesh Mushroom",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=630588,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:73:1",["y"]=0.26,["x"]=0.7559999999999999,["count"]=8,["from"]="Rotflesh Mushroom",["quest"]=95261,["item"]=268664,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="It Takes Guts"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:73",["text"]="Rotflesh Mushrooms",["detail"]="West from the northern ship, up the ridge: the Rotflesh Mushrooms grow among the rocks, close to the Twilight ogres' camp. The Mature Paletusks on the ridge give entrails too."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:74:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259057,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="In Need of Relief",["quest"]=96125,["y"]=0.127},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="An Ogre's Captive",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:74:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259057,["y"]=0.127,["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={96125},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=96126,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:74",["text"]="Bolder'ok",["detail"]="North-west to Bolder'ok, the ogres' town. Its ogres side with the Horde and attack you on sight, and Clugfist on his hill in the middle is an elite (level 50): keep to the town's north-eastern edge, where Dunston Willis hides."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Gronok's Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=263749,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:75:1",["quest"]=96126,["y"]=0.1402,["x"]=0.6779000000000001,["item"]=272190,["lvl"]=44,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["from"]="Gronok the Butcher",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromFaction"]="H"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:75",["text"]="Gronok's Key",["detail"]="Gronok the Butcher (level 44) carries the key: he paces the lanes south of Dunston Willis's hut.\nThe Bloodmaster's Ring lies just west of the lanes: its fighters (elites, 41-45) only fight in a bout, so leave them be."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259057,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["quest"]=96126,["y"]=0.127},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Dunston Checks Out",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259057,["y"]=0.127,["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="Dunston Checks Out",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={96126},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=94927,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="help Dunston Willis break out of Bolder'ok",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Help Dunston break out of Bolder'ok"}},["y"]=0.126,["x"]=0.687,["title"]="Dunston Checks Out",["quest"]=94927}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:76",["text"]="Dunston Willis",["detail"]="Free him, then get him out: Dunston Willis fights his way out of Bolder'ok, and 