he west side",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="West through the keep: Tessa Dawnbright by the orchard, then the cathedral and Wheatley south of the inn if you have their errands."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:88:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=262031,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96083}}},["npcName"]="Sister Rowland",["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Clerical Quarantine",["quest"]=96083,["y"]=0.8308},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Something's in the Water: for later in this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:88:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=262031,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96083}}},["y"]=0.8308,["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Something's in the Water",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={96083},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=96084,["npcName"]="Sister Rowland"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:88",["text"]="Sister Rowland",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96083}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:89",["text"]="Wheatley",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95991}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Empty Phial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:90:1",["t"]="use",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96084}}},["y"]=0.562,["x"]=0.62,["title"]="Something's in the Water",["quest"]=96084,["item"]=281229}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:90",["text"]="Something's in the Water",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96084}}},["detail"]="North past Terral's Watch: fill Sister Rowland's phial in the marsh water north-east of the tower."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Watcher Cornelius: Dunston Checks Out",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:91:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="Dunston Checks Out",["quest"]=94927,["y"]=0.6396999999999999},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Out in the Field",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:91:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259352,["npcName"]="Watcher Cornelius",["x"]=0.5953,["title"]="Out in the Field",["quest"]=95329,["y"]=0.6396999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:91",["text"]="Terral's Watch",["detail"]="Watcher Cornelius's tower."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:92",["text"]="Watcher Cornelius",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95986}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:93:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256438,["npcName"]="Halligan Turner",["x"]=0.4118,["title"]="Love Thy Neighbor",["quest"]=95330,["y"]=0.6292}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:93",["text"]="Turner's Logging Camp",["detail"]="West across the river to Turner's Logging Camp: the Peasant Woodpiles around the camp give the wood bundles.\nCareful: Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), prowls the river by the camp: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:94",["text"]="Sergeant Riftan",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="North up the long valley towards Twilight's Shroud: Sergeant Riftan holds a small camp below the Twilight cult's fortress."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="kill a Twilight Thrall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:95:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Twilight Thrall captured"}},["y"]=0.478,["x"]=0.266,["title"]="A Small Favor",["startItemName"]="Amberhall's Soulstone",["startItem"]=268646,["quest"]=94907,["item"]=268646}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:95",["text"]="The Twilight camps",["detail"]="The cult's camps fill the valley north and west of Riftan. Free the captive Farholde Scouts as you find them, and kill a Twilight Thrall for Ashe Amberhall: her soulstone takes it. Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) patrol through the camps: watch where they walk before each pull. Overlord Kilgar and Executioner Morg (elites, 46) hold the fortress at the valley's head: pull the cultists away from them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="find Marshal Ryan and talk to him",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:96:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Marshal Ryan"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94887}}},["y"]=0.408,["x"]=0.262,["title"]="Saving Marshal Ryan",["startItemName"]="Field Marshal's Log",["startItem"]=267256,["quest"]=94887,["item"]=267256},{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:96:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257250,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94887}}},["npcName"]="Marshal Ryan",["x"]=0.262,["title"]="Saving Marshal Ryan",["quest"]=94887,["y"]=0.408},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Dying Wish: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:96:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257250,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94887}}},["y"]=0.408,["x"]=0.262,["title"]="Dying Wish",["minLevel"]=36,["pre"]={94887},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=94892,["npcName"]="Marshal Ryan"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:96",["text"]="Marshal Ryan",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94887}}},["detail"]="Marshal Ryan lies wounded among the camps at the valley's western edge.\nCareful: Overlord Kilgar and Executioner Morg (elites, 46) hold the fortress north of him: come at Ryan from the south."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:97",["text"]="The ogre mine",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="North of the camps the cult works ogre miners in a mine, driven by the Twilight Subjugators.\nCareful: Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) walk past the mine's mouth on their way through the camps. Wait for one to pass before you go in, and pull the miners and Subjugators back out to you."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:98",["text"]="Sergeant Riftan",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:99",["text"]="Bring Me His Head",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Overlord Kilgar is an elite (level 46) in the fortress at the head of the valley, with the Enforcers around him: grouping up is advised."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["x"]=0.63,["y"]=0.83,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:100:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Farholde Keep",["area"]=16724}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:100",["text"]="Back to Farholde Keep",["detail"]="Your hearthstone is bound at Farholde Keep's inn: use it, or ride back south to the keep."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:101:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257591,["npcName"]="Ashe Amberhall",["x"]=0.6675,["title"]="A Small Favor",["quest"]=94907,["y"]=0.8109999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:101",["text"]="Farholde Keep",["detail"]="From the inn: Bertrand Ironbrow on the way in, then Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall in the keep."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:102",["text"]="Ashe Amberhall",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94891}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:103:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257558,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94892}}},["npcName"]="Demar Brant",["x"]=0.6667000000000001,["title"]="Dying Wish",["quest"]=94892,["y"]=0.8101},{["itemName"]="Marshal Ryan's Crest",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:103:2",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94892}}},["title"]="Delivering Closure",["item"]=266428,["qlvl"]=47,["pre"]={94892},["minLevel"]=36,["quest"]=94893,["note"]="Delivering Closure: for Abigail Lawson in Stormwind"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:103",["text"]="Demar Brant",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94892}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:104",["text"]="The Twilight Threat",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=94891}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="