["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="From Theramore, ride north into the Barrens to Ratchet, or fly if you know its flight path. Strahad Farsan teaches in the house by the bank."}},["max"]=46,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=45,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Badlands & The Hinterlands (solo 45-46)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Badlands",["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/40-50/shendralas"} end},
