ida Grimtotem, an elite of level 43, stands at the camp's north-east edge, around 67,39: pull the Naturalists, Raiders and Shamans away from her."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:20",["text"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:20:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7957,["npcName"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Doling Justice",["quest"]=2970,["y"]=0.4561},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:20:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7957,["y"]=0.4561,["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Doling Justice",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={2970},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=2972,["npcName"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["title"]="The Woodpaw Gnolls",["objName"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["quest"]=4131,["object"]=164953},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:2",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=46,["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["title"]="The Writhing Deep",["objName"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["pre"]={4131},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4135,["object"]=164953},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Undelivered Parcel",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=164953,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["item"]=11463,["from"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:3",["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks"},{["itemName"]="Undelivered Parcel",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:4",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Thalanaar Delivery",["item"]=11463,["pre"]={4131},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4281,["qlvl"]=44},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Zukk'ash Pod, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:5",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6372,["x"]=0.7206999999999999,["title"]="The Writhing Deep",["objName"]="Zukk'ash Pod",["quest"]=4135,["object"]=164954},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:6",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=46,["y"]=0.6372,["x"]=0.7206999999999999,["title"]="Freed from the Hive",["objName"]="Zukk'ash Pod",["pre"]={4135},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4265,["object"]=164954},{["title"]="Freed from the Hive",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:7",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Free Raschal."}},["quest"]=4265}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21",["text"]="The Writhing Deep",["detail"]="Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="grind on Feral Scar Yeti at Feral Scar Vale, Feralas",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:23:1",["t"]="level",["npcName"]="Feral Scar Yeti",["x"]=0.5652,["lvl"]=44,["level"]=45,["y"]=0.565,["grind"]=5292}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:23",["text"]="Grind to 45",["detail"]="Ride west into Feral Scar Vale: its yetis are 43-45. The Rage Scar yetis in the hills to the north are 46-49: leave them."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ironfur Liver",["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris",["fromRank"]=4,["quest"]=1452,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=5352,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.473,["x"]=0.532,["count"]=3,["from"]="Old Grizzlegut",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:24:1",["item"]=6258,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:24",["text"]="Ironfur bears",["detail"]="Ride north out of Feral Scar Vale: the Ironfur Bears (41-42) at the foot of the High Wilderness drop Rhapsody's last liver.\nCareful: Ironfur Patriarchs (48-49) and the Rage Scar yetis (46-49) roam the hills further north: stay at their edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:24:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7880,["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="Freed from the Hive",["quest"]=4265,["y"]=0.45130000000000003},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:24:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7880,["y"]=0.45130000000000003,["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="A Hero's Welcome",["minLevel"]=40,["pre"]={4265},["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=4266,["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle"},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:24:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3936,["npcName"]="Shandris Feathermoon",["x"]=0.3028,["title"]="A Hero's Welcome",["quest"]=4266,["y"]=0.4617},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:24:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3936,["y"]=0.4617,["x"]=0.3028,["title"]="Rise of the Silithid",["minLevel"]=40,["pre"]={4266},["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=4267,["npcName"]="Shandris Feathermoon"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:24",["text"]="Feathermoon Stronghold",["detail"]="Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:26",["text"]="Feathermoon Stronghold",["goals"]={{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:25:1",["text"]="Shandris Feathermoon then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.303,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:27:1",["text"]="Feathermoon flight master",["y"]=0.433,["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:27:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Thalanaar",["t"]="fly",["node"]=31,["area"]=489}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:27",["text"]="Fly to Thalanaar",["soloWhen"]={{["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:28:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}},["y"]=0.45899999999999996,["x"]=0.895,["text"]="Thalanaar",["area"]=489}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:28",["text"]="Ride to Thalanaar",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}},["detail"]="No flight path to Thalanaar yet: take the boat back to the coast and ride east along the road to Thalanaar, on the Thousand Needles border."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Falfindel Waywarder walks around Thalanaar: look inside the circle on the map",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:31:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4048,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={4281}}},["npcName"]="Falfindel Waywarder",["x"]=0.8964,["title"]="Thalanaar Delivery",["quest"]=4281,["y"]=0.4657}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:31",["text"]="Thalanaar",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={4281}}},["detail"]="Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.895,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:30:1",["text"]="Thalanaar flight master",["y"]=0.45899999999999996,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}}},{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:30:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=4319,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}},["npcName"]="Thyssiana",["x"]=0.895,["location"]="Thalanaar",["y"]=0.4585,["node"]=31,["area"]=489}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:30",["text"]="Thalanaar flight master",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi",["name"]="Thalanaar"}}}},["max"]=47,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=45,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Feralas (solo 45-47)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Feralas",["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris"} end},
