 it, the Dunemaul Compound waits for the same landing",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:4:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11758,["npcName"]="Andi Lynn",["x"]=0.5282,["title"]="The Dunemaul Compound",["minLevel"]=44,["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=5863,["y"]=0.27399999999999997},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Curgle Cranklehop: his crate goes to Rut'theran Village, later",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:4:10",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7763,["npcName"]="Curgle Cranklehop",["x"]=0.5236,["title"]="Handle With Care",["minLevel"]=42,["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=3022,["y"]=0.2691}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:4",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["detail"]="Ride south-east off the Shimmering Flats into Tanaris. Gadgetzan is just inside the border."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:5",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="For your Zul'Farrak run, later in this guide: Tran'rek wants scarab shells, Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, by the water tower, his Divino-matic Rod back, and Trenton Lighthammer Troll Temper from the Sandfury trolls."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:5:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=15165,["npcName"]="Haughty Modiste",["x"]=0.6656,["title"]="Pirate Hats Ahoy!",["minLevel"]=40,["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=8365,["y"]=0.2227},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="The Wanted poster beside him",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:5:2",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.2229,["x"]=0.6681999999999999,["title"]="WANTED: Andre Firebeard",["objName"]="Wanted Poster",["object"]=142122,["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=2875,["qlvl"]=45},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="The same poster: Caliph Scorpidsting comes much later, after Gadgetzan",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:5:3",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.2229,["x"]=0.668199999999