{id="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands",faction="Alliance",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=1425,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["x"]=0.49,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:1:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.687,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2989}}}},{["map"]=1425,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:1:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Search the Altar of Zul"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2989}}},["y"]=0.687,["x"]=0.49,["title"]="The Altar of Zul",["quest"]=2989}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:1",["text"]="The Altar of Zul",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2989}}},["detail"]="Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the The Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.\nCareful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["itemName"]="Vilebranch Totem",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=4467,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:2:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.667,["x"]=0.45299999999999996,["title"]="Repurposed Totems",["lvl"]=47,["item"]=279225,["from"]="Vilebranch Soothsayer",["quest"]=86616,["count"]=12}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:2",["text"]="Vilebranch Soothsayers",["detail"]="The Vilebranch Soothsayers (46-47) walk the ground around the foot of the Altar of Zul: their totems are for Maret Firetend. Careful: Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper (50, elites) stand on the altar's south-east side: take the Soothsayers on its west side, away from them, and stay off the altar."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:2:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2655,["y"]=0.5537,["x"]=0.4886,["title"]="Skulk Rock Clean-up",["lvl"]=47,["target"]="Green Sludge",["count"]=10,["quest"]=2877,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1425,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:2:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2656,["y"]=0.5307999999999999,["x"]=0.4941,["title"]="Skulk Rock Clean-up",["lvl"]=48,["target"]="Jade Ooze",["count"]=10,["quest"]=2877,["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:2",["text"]="Skulk Rock",["detail"]="Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the The Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it.\nCareful: Panthers move around the area in stealth."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Wildkin Feather",["item"]=10819,["quest"]=3661,["map"]=1425,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=153239,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:4:1",["y"]=0.5006,["x"]=0.4681,["title"]="Favored of Elune?",["from"]="Wildkin Feather",["count"]=15,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="object",["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:4",["text"]="Wildkin feathers",["detail"]="Erelas Ambersky's Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the The Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam: pick them up as you ride between the altar and Skulk Rock."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["itemName"]="Lost Gryphon Egg",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=tr