er/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:36",["text"]="The Bloodsail captains",["detail"]="The three Bloodsail ships lie at anchor off the coast just south of Booty Bay: Captain Stillwater (45) and Captain Keelhaul (46) on the nearer decks, Fleet Master Firallon (48) on the flagship, each with a crew of 42-45 pirates. Swim out, clear each deck from the edge and pull one at a time."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:37",["text"]="Booty Bay",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Fleet Master Seahorn, top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:37:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2487,["npcName"]="Fleet Master Seahorn",["x"]=0.2717,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["quest"]=608,["y"]=0.7701}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Akiris Reed",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:23:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6441,["x"]=0.2821,["title"]="Akiris by the Bundle",["lvl"]=44,["item"]=4029,["quest"]=617,["count"]=10}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:23",["text"]="Naga Explorers",["detail"]="Leave town by the tunnel and ride north along the coast past the Bloodsail camp: the naga comb the beaches beyond it and drop the reeds."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Zanzil's Mixture",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:24:1",["t"]="collect",["item"]=4016,["y"]=0.5221,["x"]=0.3439,["title"]="Zanzil's Secret",["lvl"]=44,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="5,3,1,4,8,9;3,4;3,4,5,2,1,7,6;4,5,6;3,5;3,5",["quest"]=621,["count"]=12},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Chucky's Huge Ring",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2537,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:24:2",["y"]=0.5824,["x"]=0.4,["count"]=1,["from"]="Chucky \"Ten Thumbs\"",["quest"]=609,["item"]=3926,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Voodoo Dues"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Jon-Jon's Golden Spyglass",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2536,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:24:3",["y"]=0.5184000000000001,["x"]=0.3492,["count"]=1,["from"]="Jon-Jon the Crow",["quest"]=609,["item"]=3925,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Voodoo Dues"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:24",["text"]="Zanzil's village",["detail"]="Ride on north along the coast to Zanzil's village. Every Zanzil follower can drop the mixture; Chucky \"Ten Thumbs\" walks the south of the camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Maury's Clubbed Foot",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2535,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:25:1",["y"]=0.5127,["x"]=0.35259999999999997,["count"]=1,["from"]="Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins",["quest"]=609,["item"]=3924,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Voodoo Dues"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:25",["text"]="Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow",["detail"]="Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow stand together in the hills just north of Zanzil's village."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Gorilla Fang",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:26:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5797,["x"]=0.32420000000000004,["item"]=2799,["lvl"]=38,["count"]=10,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;1;6,7;5;5;3;3;3;3;3;4;1;2;6,1;1;1;5;5;5;5;5;3;3;3;3;3;3;3;4;4"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:26",["text"]="Gorilla hills",["detail"]="Ride back south-east to the Mistvale gorilla hills above Booty Bay. Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among the gorillas: take ten Gorilla Fangs from the Elder Mistvale Gorillas first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Witch Doctor Unbagwa, inside Spirit Den",["parent"]=348,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1449,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="has",["item"]=2799,["n"]=10}},["npcName"]="Witch Doctor Unbagwa",["x"]=0.3527,["title"]="Stranglethorn Fever",["minLevel"]=32,["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=349,["y"]=0.6041}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:27",["text"]="Unbagwa's ritual",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="has",["item"]=2799,["n"]=10}},["detail"]="Hand in the fangs and stay: three waves of gorillas come, Mokk the Savage last.\nCareful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then Mokk the Savage. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Heart of Mokk",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1514,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:28:1",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=349}},["y"]=0.6088,["x"]=0.3505,["count"]=1,["from"]="Mokk the Savage",["quest"]=348,["item"]=2797,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Stranglethorn Fever"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:28",["text"]="Unbagwa's ritual",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=349}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2494,["npcName"]="Privateer Bloads",["x"]=0.2676,["title"]="Akiris by the Bundle",["quest"]=617,["y"]=0.7637999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="for Privateer Groy in Theramore: keep it, the Un'Goro guide lands there",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2494,["y"]=0.7637999999999999,["x"]=0.2676,["title"]="Akiris by the Bundle",["minLevel"]=38,["pre"]={617},["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=623,["npcName"]="Privateer Bloads"},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2486,["npcName"]="Fin Fizracket",["x"]=0.2761,["title"]="Stranglethorn Fever",["quest"]=348,["y"]=0.7674},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:4",["text"]="Crank Fizzlebub's next Zanzil errand starts in Thousand Needles: skip it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Crank Fizzlebub, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2498,["npcName"]="Crank Fizzlebub",["x"]=0.2712,["title"]="Zanzil's Secret",["quest"]=621,["y"]=0.7720999999999999},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:6",["text"]="MacKinley's next task sends you after elite ogres: skip it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:29:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2501,["npcName"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley",["x"]=0.2778,["title"]="Voodoo Dues",["quest"]=609,["y"]=0.7706999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:29",["text"]="Booty Bay",["detail"]="Ride back down to town."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:38",["text"]="Monogrammed Sash",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. The Monogrammed Sash needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:39",["text"]="Captain Hecklebury Smotts",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:40",["text"]="Sprogger",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:41",["text"]="Sprogger",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:42",["text"]="Facing Negolash",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Negolash (level 52 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:43",["text"]="Captain Hecklebury Smotts",["superseded"]=true}},["max"]=48,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=47,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Hinterlands & Blasted Lands (solo 47-48)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="The Hinterlands",["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge"} end},
{id="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge",faction="Alliance",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=1427,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge",["steps"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:1",["text"]="To Ironforge",["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.1815,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:1:1",["text"]="Stonefire Tavern",["y"]=0.5145000000000001,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:2",["text"]="Fly to Thelsamar",["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:2:1",["text"]="Ironforge flight master",["y"]=0.479,["t"]="goto"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:2:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Thelsamar",["t"]="fly",["node"]=8,["area"]=144}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:2",["text"]="Into Searing Gorge",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["x"]=0.7659999999999999,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:2:1",["text"]="Into Searing Gorge",["y"]=0.5670000000000001,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:3",["text"]="Searing Gorge",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["x"]=0.6559999999999999,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:3:1",["text"]="The Grimesilt outhouse",["y"]=0.622,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:4:1",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.6217,["x"]=0.6559,["title"]="Caught!",["objName"]="Wooden Outhouse",["object"]=173265,["minLevel"]=43,["quest"]=4449,["qlvl"]=45}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:4",["text"]="The Grimesilt outhouse",["detail"]="From Thelsamar ride south into the Badlands, then west past the Horde town of Kargath (give it room) and up the trail into Searing Gorge: the Grimesilt Dig Site is just inside, in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 Silk Cloth and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:5",["text"]="The Grimesilt outhouse",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:5:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5839,["y"]=0.604,["x"]=0.639,["title"]="Caught!",["lvl"]=44,["target"]="Dark Iron Geologist",["quest"]=4449,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Silk Cloth",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:5:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.604,["x"]=0.639,["title"]="Caught!",["lvl"]=45,["item"]=4306,["quest"]=4449,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:5:3",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6217,["x"]=0.6559,["title"]="Caught!",["objName"]="Wooden Outhouse",["quest"]=4449,["object"]=173265},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:5:4",["text"]="The prisoner's next task, Ledger from Tanaris, sends you to the Swamp of Sorrows and Dustwallow Marsh: skip it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["x"]=0.633,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:6:1",["text"]="Dark Iron Geologist",["y"]=0.606,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.27,["k"]="level",["n"]=48}}},{["map"]=1427,["frac"]=0.27,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:6:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.27,["k"]="level",["n"]=48}},["npcName"]="Dark Iron Geologist",["x"]=0.6314,["note"]="grind on Dark Iron Geologist",["lvl"]=44,["y"]=0.6134000000000001,["level"]=48,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=5839}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:6",["text"]="Level 48.27",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.27,["k"]="level",["n"]=48}},["detail"]="If you skipped The Monogrammed Sash or Facing Negolash, grind here to level 48.27 to stay on the route's plan."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:7:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8284,["npcName"]="Dorius Stonetender",["x"]=0.6392,["escort"]=true,["minLevel"]=40,["y"]=0.6099,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3367,["title"]="Suntara Stones"},{["title"]="Suntara Stones",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:7:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=3367,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Dorius Escort"}}},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:7:3",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.1929,["x"]=0.7445,["title"]="Suntara Stones",["objName"]="Singed Letter",["quest"]=3367,["object"]=175704},{["map"]=1427,["note"]="For Curator Thorius in Ironforge, at the end of this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:7:4",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=48,["y"]=0.1929,["x"]=0.7445,["title"]="Suntara Stones",["objName"]="Singed Letter",["pre"]={3367},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=3368,["object"]=175704}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:7",["text"]="Dorius Stonetender",["detail"]="Dorius stands by the road beside the Grimesilt Dig Site. Escort him north-east to Dustfire Valley and keep him alive; when it is over, read the Singed Letter he leaves on the road."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=2941,["npcName"]="Lanie Reed",["x"]=0.37939999999999996,["location"]="Thorium Point",["y"]=0.3086,["node"]=74,["area"]=1446},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It",["minLevel"]=45,["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=7727,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Fiery Menace!",["minLevel"]=45,["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=7724,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Curse These Fat Fingers",["minLevel"]=45,["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=7723,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:6",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.2647,["x"]=0.3765,["title"]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition",["objName"]="Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found",["object"]=179827,["minLevel"]=45,["quest"]=7729,["qlvl"]=48},{["map"]=1427,["note"]="The Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found board",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:8:7",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.2647,["x"]=0.3765,["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["objName"]="Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found",["object"]=179827,["minLevel"]=45,["quest"]=7728,["qlvl"]=48}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:9",["text"]="Thorium Point",["detail"]="Ride west along the north of the Gorge to Thorium Point, the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:9",["text"]="Thorium Point",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:23",["text"]="Zamael Lunthistle",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Zamael Lunthistle stands inside the Twilight camp at Firewatch Ridge, west of Thorium Point, among Twilight Fire Guards, Idolaters and Geomancers (level 48-49 elites), with Highlord Mastrogonde (level 51, rare elite) beside him: Prayer to Elune needs a group of 4. Skip it if you are alone."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:24",["text"]="Prayer to Elune",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:26",["text"]="Zamael Lunthistle",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:14:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5858,["y"]=0.3734,["x"]=0.2712,["title"]="Fiery Menace!",["target"]="Searing Lava Spider",["count"]=20,["quest"]=7724,["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:14",["text"]="Searing Lava Spiders",["detail"]="The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools south of Zamael Lunthistle, on the way to Velarok Windblade."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:14:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Divine Retribution",["minLevel"]=40,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3441,["y"]=0.3899}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:14",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["detail"]="Velarok Windblade stands on the rim of the Cauldron, south of Thorium Point. Listen to his story."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:15",["text"]="Divine Retribution",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]