elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:18",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="The Flawless Flame",["quest"]=3442,["y"]=0.3899},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:18:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8479,["y"]=0.3899,["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["minLevel"]=40,["pre"]={3442},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3443,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:20:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5846,["y"]=0.39640000000000003,["x"]=0.3749,["title"]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition",["target"]="Dark Iron Taskmaster",["quest"]=7729,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:19:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5844,["y"]=0.3804,["x"]=0.3839,["title"]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition",["lvl"]=46,["target"]="Dark Iron Slaver",["count"]=15,["quest"]=7729,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Thorium Plated Dagger",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:20:3",["t"]="collect",["item"]=10551,["y"]=0.3804,["x"]=0.3839,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["lvl"]=48,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="5,1,6;6,1;6,1;5,6,1;5,1,4,6;7;7,1;7;5,6,1;5,1,6;1,6;9;2,3;3,8;7;5,1,6;5,1,6;1;5,6",["quest"]=3443,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Lookout's Spyglass",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=8566,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:goal:20:4",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.5192,["x"]=0.3371,["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["from"]="Dark Iron Lookout",["item"]=18960,["spread"]=true,["quest"]=7728,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Grimesilt Outhouse Key",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:19:5",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5192,["x"]=0.3371,["item"]=11818,["lvl"]=48,["count"]=1,["spread"]=true,["optional"]=true},{["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:19:6",["t"]="accept",["title"]="The Key to Freedom",["item"]=11818,["qlvl"]=47,["minLevel"]=43,["quest"]=4451,["itemName"]="Grimesilt Outhouse Key"},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Smithing Tuyere",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=5840,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:19:7",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.4965,["x"]=0.37689999999999996,["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["lvl"]=47,["item"]=18959,["from"]="Dark Iron Steamsmith",["quest"]=7728,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:20",["text"]="Dark Iron dwarves: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the Smithing Tuyere), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any Dark Iron may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:20",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:20:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["quest"]=3443,["y"]=0.3899}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:21",["text"]="Thorium Point",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14626,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Scrange",["x"]=0.3897,["title"]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition",["quest"]=7729,["y"]=0.2751},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:21:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14626,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Scrange",["x"]=0.3897,["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["quest"]=7728,["y"]=0.2751},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:21:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Curse These Fat Fingers",["quest"]=7723,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:21:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Fiery Menace!",["quest"]=7724,["y"]=0.2781}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:22:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=9318,["y"]=0.2826,["x"]=0.4338,["title"]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It",["lvl"]=49,["target"]="Incendosaur",["quest"]=7727,["count"]=20}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:step:23",["text"]="Searing Gorge: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. The Secret Plans lie on its upper ledge; Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools further in, so pull them to the edge. Stay clear of Overseer Maltorius and his elite guards deep inside."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge:27",["text"]="Searing Gorge: kill these as you meet them",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look