ilithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:9:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5474,["y"]=0.512,["x"]=0.39270000000000005,["title"]="The Dunemaul Compound",["lvl"]=48,["target"]="Dunemaul Brute",["count"]=10,["quest"]=5863,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:9:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5472,["y"]=0.5092,["x"]=0.3986,["title"]="The Dunemaul Compound",["lvl"]=47,["target"]="Dunemaul Enforcer",["count"]=10,["quest"]=5863,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Gor'marok the Ravager, below ground",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:9:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12046,["y"]=0.5781000000000001,["x"]=0.415,["title"]="The Dunemaul Compound",["target"]="Gor'marok the Ravager",["quest"]=5863,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:step:9",["text"]="Dunemaul Compound",["detail"]="Ride south to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Laden Dew Gland",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=5481,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:10:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.6472,["x"]=0.3124,["title"]="The Thirsty Goblin",["lvl"]=48,["item"]=8428,["from"]="Thistleshrub Dew Collector",["quest"]=2605,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1446,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:10:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5485,["y"]=0.6531999999999999,["x"]