 Infused Scale",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:16:3",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Microcrystal Contamination",["item"]=280459,["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=87494,["optional"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:step:16",["text"]="Fresh Threshadon Carcass",["detail"]="The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa Pathfinder.\nCareful: Venomhide Ravasaurs (50-51) hunt along the water there: pull them one at a time before you loot the carcass.\nAny ravasaur may drop a Crystal Infused Scale: right-click it, Torwa Pathfinder takes it."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:step:17",["text"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="The Fare of Lar'korwi",["quest"]=4290,["y"]=0.7595999999999999},{["map"]=1449,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:17:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Microcrystal Contamination",["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["quest"]=87494,["note"]="Microcrystal Contamination, if a ravasaur dropped the scale"},{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9619,["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="The Scent of Lar'korwi",["minLevel"]=48,["pre"]={4290},["qlvl"]=53,["quest"]=4291,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder"},{["map"]=1449,["note"]="The gorillas on Ironstone Plateau carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 56",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:10:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Path