["text"]="Morgan's Vigil",["detail"]="Morgan's Vigil sits in the south-east of the Steppes, at the top of the pass up from Redridge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["x"]=0.787,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:50:1",["text"]="Firegut Ogre",["y"]=0.447,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}}},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="grind on Firegut Ogre",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:50:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}},["npcName"]="Firegut Ogre",["x"]=0.7829999999999999,["lvl"]=51,["level"]=52,["y"]=0.4355,["grind"]=7033}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:50",["text"]="Level 52 at Dreadmaul Rock",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}},["detail"]="Top up first to level 52 on the Firegut Ogres (50-51) on the near side of Dreadmaul Rock, north of the Vigil: the Brutes on its east side are 52-53."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Firegut Ogre Mage, below ground",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7034,["y"]=0.4404,["x"]=0.7895,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=52,["target"]="Firegut Ogre Mage",["quest"]=3823,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1428,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7033,["y"]=0.4355,["x"]=0.7829999999999999,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=51,["target"]="Firegut Ogre",["quest"]=3823,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1428,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7035,["y"]=0.4302,["x"]=0.7915000000000001,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=53,["target"]="Firegut Brute",["quest"]=3823,["count"]=7}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:51",["text"]="Dreadmaul Rock",["detail"]="The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.\nCareful: Escaped Core Hounds (level 60) roam the Steppes, a few on the slopes west and south of Dreadmaul Rock: pull the ogres on the rock itself and look around before each pull."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:52",["text"]="Morgan's Vigil",["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:43:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9177,["npcName"]="Oralius",["x"]=0.8456,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["quest"]=3823,["y"]=0.6868000000000001},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:52:2",["text"]="Oralius' next tasks (Gor'tesh, and fifty Blackrock Medallions) send you among the Blackrock orcs of 55-58 at the foot of Blackrock Mountain: skip them.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:45:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10267,["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil",["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=4726,["y"]=0.24}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:53",["text"]="Flame Crest",["detail"]="Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Broodling Essence",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=175264,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:54:1",["y"]=0.3124,["x"]=0.6113000000000001,["count"]=8,["from"]="Broodling Essence",["quest"]=4726,["item"]=12283,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Broodling Essence"},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Draco-Incarcinatrix 900",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:54:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.28,["x"]=0.81,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["quest"]=4726,["item"]=12284}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:54",["text"]="Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.\nCareful: a Malfunctioning Reaver (level 56, rare) walks the slopes by the broodlings, and the Black Dragonspawn and Wyrmkin around them are elite: use the Incarcinatrix on a broodling at the edge and look around before each pull."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:64",["text"]="Ruins of Thaurissan",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered. Take the ones on the ruins' southern edge, nearest Flame Crest.\nCareful: the ruins' War Reavers and Thaurissan Firewalkers are 53-55, and Thauris Balgarr (57) holds the Dark Iron camp south-west of Flame Crest: take the relics at the edge of the ruins, pull one at a time, and keep away from the camp."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:56",["text"]="Flame Crest",["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:47:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10267,["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil",["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["quest"]=4726,["y"]=0.24},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:47:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10267,["y"]=0.24,["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Felnok Steelspring",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={4726},["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=4808,["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=3481}},["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["superseded"]=true,["text"]="Cyrus Therepentous",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:48",["detail"]="Open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight from Searing Gorge for its Black Dragonflight Molt, then tell Cyrus Therepentous you bring proof of your deeds: no drake to fight."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:65",["text"]="Cyrus Therepentous",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:68",["text"]="A Taste of Flame",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Frenzied Black Drake is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:78",["text"]="Cyrus Therepentous",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["x"]=0.8959999999999999,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:52:1",["text"]="Ember Worg",["y"]=0.512,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.08,["k"]="level",["n"]=52}}},{["map"]=1428,["frac"]=0.08,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:52:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.08,["k"]="level",["n"]=52}},["npcName"]="Ember Worg",["x"]=0.8934000000000001,["note"]="grind on Ember Worg",["lvl"]=52,["y"]=0.5065,["level"]=52,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=9690}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/01-bu