winterspring:step:9",["text"]="Frostfire Hot Springs: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need) and a Winterfall Ritual Totem (about one in thirty): right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:11",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Threat of the Winterfall",["quest"]=5082,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Winterfall Firewater",["quest"]=5083,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["note"]="The Deadwood cauldron in Felwood: keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9298,["y"]=0.45159999999999995,["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Falling to Corruption",["minLevel"]=52,["pre"]={5083},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=5084,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.314,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:12:1",["text"]="Winterfall Pathfinder",["y"]=0.36,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.05,["k"]="level",["n"]=55}}},{["map"]=1452,["frac"]=0.05,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:12:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.05,["k"]="level",["n"]=55}},["npcName"]="Winterfall Pathfinder",["x"]=0.3143,["note"]="grind on Winterfall Pathfinder",["lvl"]=54,["y"]=0.363,["level"]=55,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=7442}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:12",["text"]="Level 55.05",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["frac"]=0.05,["k"]="level",["n"]=55}},["detail"]="Top up here to level 55.05 before the hand-ins at Everlook: they take you to level 56. Grind the Winterfall furbolgs camped by Frostfire Hot Springs (Pathfinders, Totemics, Den Watchers): killing them raises your Timbermaw reputation, which the quests here and the walk through Timbermaw Hold need, one of them drops the Winterfall Ritual Totem, and they fill your bags with the thirty Runecloth Meilosh asks for."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.314,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:13:1",["text"]="Winterfall Pathfinder",["y"]=0.36,["t"]="goto"},{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:12:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.363,["x"]=0.3143,["item"]=20742,["lvl"]=54,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;2,1;1;2,1;1,2,4;1;3;6;6,5;5;4;4;1;2,4,1;1,2;1;4,5,6;6,5"},{["note"]="For Kernda in Timbermaw Hold: keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:13:3",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem",["item"]=20742,["qlvl"]=56,["minLevel"]=50,["quest"]=8471,["itemName"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:step:12",["text"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem",["detail"]="Any Winterfall furbolg can drop the totem, about one kill in thirty: if the top-up did not bring one, keep killing them here until it drops, then right-click it."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Moontouched Feather",["item"]=12383,["quest"]=978,["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=175407,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:13:1",["y"]=0.40840000000000004,["x"]=0.49479999999999996,["title"]="Moontouched Wildkin",["from"]="Moontouched Feather",["count"]=10,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="object",["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:step:13",["text"]="The Ruins of Kel'Theril",["detail"]="The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of Starfall Village. Pick up the four relic fragments lying in the ruins and the Moontouched Feathers on the ground where the wildkin roam."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Thick Yeti Fur",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:14:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4007,["x"]=0.5078,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["lvl"]=55,["item"]=12366,["quest"]=3783,["spread"]=true,["count"]=10},{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Uncracked Chillwind Horn",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:14:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3865,["x"]=0.5146999999999999,["title"]="Chillwind Horns",["lvl"]=59,["item"]=12444,["quest"]=4809,["spread"]=true,["count"]=8}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:step:14",["text"]="Ice Thistle Hills: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Ice Thistle yetis live in the hills south of Winterfall Village, Chillwind Chimaeras in the valley toward Everlook.\nCareful: the Ice Thistle Yetis are 55-56 and the Chimaeras 55-57: take the Rogue Ice Thistles (53-55) and the Fledgling Chillwinds (53-55) at the edge of the hills, and leave the Chillwind Ravagers (57-59) alone."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:14",["text"]="Everlook",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10468,["npcName"]="Felnok Steelspring",["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Chillwind Horns",["quest"]=4809,["y"]=0.3861},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:14:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10305,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker",["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["quest"]=3783,["y"]=0.3762},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:14:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10305,["y"]=0.3762,["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["minLevel"]=52,["pre"]={3783},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=977,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Pristine Yeti Horn",["item"]=12367,["quest"]=977,["map"]=1452,["fromId"]=7459,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:16:1",["fromAlso"]="Ice Thistle Patriarch",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["y"]=0.40590000000000004,["x"]=0.647,["count"]=2,["from"]="Ice Thistle Matriarch",["lvl"]=58,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=7460}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:step:16",["text"]="Pristine Yeti Horns",["detail"]="Back to the hills: only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs (56-57) and Patriarchs (57-58) carry the horns.\nCareful: take the Matriarchs at the edge of the hills, one at a time, and leave the Patriarchs: their horns drop from both."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:step:17",["text"]="Everlook",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10305,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker",["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["quest"]=977,["y"]=0.3762},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring:17:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10305,["y"]=0.3762,["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["minLevel"]=52,["pre"]={977},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=5163,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker"},{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Umi's Mechanical Yeti",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"