;5,4;17;17;17;17;16,19"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:3",["text"]="Sorrow Hill: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones while you wear the Argent Dawn Commission (equip it as a trinket first).\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.\nCareful: The Eye of Naxxramas (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10927,["npcName"]="Marlene Redpath",["x"]=0.4917,["title"]="Auntie Marlene",["quest"]=5152,["y"]=0.7857},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10927,["y"]=0.7857,["x"]=0.4917,["title"]="A Strange Historian",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={5152},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=5153,["npcName"]="Marlene Redpath"},{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Joseph's Wedding Ring",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=176145,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:5:3",["quest"]=5153,["y"]=0.7676000000000001,["x"]=0.49700000000000005,["item"]=12894,["from"]="Joseph Redpath's Monument",["title"]="A Strange Historian",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Joseph's Wedding Ring, at the monument"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:5",["text"]="Marlene Redpath",["detail"]="Marlene Redpath's farmhouse stands on the hill east of the camp; Joseph Redpath's monument is just north of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:5:1",["t"]