"Dinosaur Bone",["quest"]=3882,["item"]=11114,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Roll the Bones"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:122",["text"]="Bones and equipment",["detail"]="West across the south of the crater: Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from the Diemetradons. The expedition's Research Equipment lies in the south-west jungle."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["x"]=0.239,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:123:1",["text"]="Western Crystal Pylon",["y"]=0.5920000000000001,["t"]="goto"},{["map"]=1449,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:123:2",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.5919,["x"]=0.2386,["title"]="The Western Pylon",["objName"]="Western Crystal Pylon",["quest"]=4288,["object"]=164956}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:123",["text"]="Western Pylon",["detail"]="The pylon stands on the western cliffs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["note"]="Below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:123:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9999,["npcName"]="Ringo",["x"]=0.519,["title"]="Lost!",["quest"]=4492,["y"]=0.4985},{["map"]=1449,["y"]=0.4985,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:123:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9999,["minLevel"]=50,["npcName"]="Ringo",["x"]=0.519,["limit"]=1500,["qlvl"]=55,["pre"]={4492},["title"]="A Little Help From My Friends",["quest"]=4491,["escort"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:123",["text"]="Ringo",["detail"]="Ringo sits on the south-east slope of Fire Plume Ridge, in the middle of the crater."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["x"]=0.43700000000000006,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:124:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.083},{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:124:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge"}},["title"]="A Little Help From My Friends",["startItemName"]="Spraggle's Canteen",["startItem"]=11804,["item"]=11804,["quest"]=4491,["escort"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:124",["text"]="Escort Ringo",["detail"]="Lead Ringo north to Marshal's Refuge. When he faints, use Spraggle's Canteen on him to wake him."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:126",["text"]="Spraggle Frock",["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:125:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9997,["npcName"]="Spraggle Frock",["x"]=0.4362,["title"]="A Little Help From My Friends",["quest"]=4491,["y"]=0.085},{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:126:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9272,["npcName"]="Spark Nilminer",["x"]=0.435,["title"]="Roll the Bones",["quest"]=3882,["y"]=0.0742},{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:126:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9271,["npcName"]="Hol'anyee Marshal",["x"]=0.4389,["title"]="Alien Ecology",["quest"]=3883,["y"]=0.0724},{["map"]=1449,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:126:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9270,["npcName"]="Williden Marshal",["x"]=0.4395,["title"]="Expedition Salvation",["quest"]=3881,["y"]=0.07139999999999999},{["map"]=1449,["note"]="J.D. Collie, below 