he lumber mill and set the termite barrel down in the middle of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:97:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11610,["y"]=0.28059999999999996,["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={6004},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=6023,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:97",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["detail"]="Kirsta Deepshadow hides at the Northridge lumber camp's edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:98:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11613,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["y"]=0.361,["x"]=0.5783,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["target"]="Huntsman Radley",["quest"]=6023,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:98:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11611,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["y"]=0.23620000000000002,["x"]=0.5515,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["target"]="Cavalier Durgen",["quest"]=6023,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:98",["text"]="Radley and Durgen",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["detail"]="Huntsman Radley walks the Northridge camp east of Kirsta Deepshadow; Cavalier Durgen guards the tower at Hearthglen's southern approach.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:99:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11610,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6023,["y"]=0.28059999999999996},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:99:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11610,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["y"]=0.28059999999999996,["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={6023},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=6025,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:99",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["detail"]="Kirsta Deepshadow hides at the lumber camp's edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.45799999999999996,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:100:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.183,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6025}}}},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:100:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Overlook Hearthglen from a high vantage point"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6025}}},["y"]=0.183,["x"]=0.45799999999999996,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6025}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:100",["text"]="Hearthglen overlook",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6025}}},["detail"]="Climb the hill west of Hearthglen to look down on the town.\nCareful: Sentinels posted at the gate can detect stealthed players. Additional sentinels are found within the town, and an elite walks a patrol route nearby."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:101:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11610,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6025}}},["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6025,["y"]=0.28059999999999996}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:101",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6025}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Gahrron's Withering Cauldron Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=11078,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:102:1",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5225,5168}}},["y"]=0.5906,["x"]=0.6218,["count"]=1,["from"]="Cauldron Lord Soulwrath",["quest"]=5225,["item"]=13196,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Target: Gahrron's Withering"},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:102:2",["t"]="turnin",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5225,5168}}},["y"]=0.5847,["x"]=0.6254,["title"]="Target: Gahrron's Withering",["objName"]="Scourge Cauldron",["quest"]=5225,["object"]=176392},{["map"]=1422,["note"]="For High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, at the end of this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:102:3",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=58,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5225,5168}}},["y"]=0.5847,["x"]=0.6254,["title"]="Return to Chillwind Camp",["objName"]="Scourge Cauldron",["pre"]={5225},["minLevel"]=50,["quest"]=5226,["object"]=176392}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:102",["text"]="Gahrron's Withering",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5225,5168}}},["detail"]="Ride south-east to Gahrron's Withering: Cauldron Lord Soulwrath guards the cauldron, and Redpath's Shield lies east of the barn."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:86",["text"]="Tirion Fordring (optional)",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Tirion Fordring lives in a small hut on the border river, north-east of the lumber camp. Hand in Of Forgotten Memories if you finished it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["x"]=0.713,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:87:1",["text"]="The lake for Of Lost Honor",["y"]=0.34,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5845}}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:87",["text"]="Eastern Plaguelands",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5845}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:88",["text"]="Of Lost Honor",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["note"]="Caretaker Alen, by the graves south of the chapel: Egan is in Terrordale, keep it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:106:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11038,["npcName"]="Caretaker Alen",["x"]=0.6993,["title"]="The Restless Souls",["minLevel"]=55,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=5281,["y"]=0.5372}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:106",["text"]="Light's Hope Chapel",["detail"]="Ride south-east from the lake to the chapel."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:107:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=8529,["y"]=0.43079999999999996,["x"]=0.6662,["lvl"]=60,["target"]="Scourge Champion",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:107",["text"]="Scourge Champions",["detail"]="Scourge Champions (59) roam the Noxious Glade, north of Light's Hope Chapel. Pass Carlin Redpath's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants. Pull them one at a time."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:89",["text"]="Light's Hope Chapel",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["itemName"]="Hameya's Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=12248,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:109:1",["y"]=0.11109999999999999,["x"]=0.6196,["count"]=1,["from"]="Infiltrator Hameya",["quest"]=6024,["item"]=15767,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Hameya's Plea"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:109",["text"]="Infiltrator Hameya",["detail"]="Ride north to the Plaguewood's north-eastern edge.\nCareful: The trolls along the path to Zul'Mashar are level 57-59. They run away at low health and call for help, so they often bring adds with them."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:93",["text"]="Tirion Fordring",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:90:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11140,["npcName"]="Egan",["x"]=0.11359999999999999,["title"]="The Restless Souls",["quest"]=5281,["y"]=0.266}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:90",["text"]="Egan",["detail"]="Cross the river east of Tirion Fordring's hut into Terrordale: Egan stands by Augustus' ruined hut."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["frac"]=0.85,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:112:1",["t"]="level",["npcName"]="Terrordale Spirit",["x"]=0.1207,["lvl"]=60,["note"]="grind on Terrordale Spirit at Terrordale, Eastern Plaguelands",["level"]=59,["y"]=0.2422,["grind"]=14564}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:112",["text"]="Level 59.85",["detail"]="The Terrordale Spirits haunt the woods around Egan. Top up here to level 59.85 while you stand in Terrordale: the hand-ins still to come (the Undercroft, Caer Darrow, Chromie and Chillwind Camp) take you to level 60."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:113",["text"]="Marris Stead",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south to the Marris Stead, the farm north-west of Darrowshire. The three agents' remains are bone outlines on the ground: one by the road south of the farm, one on the hill east of the house, one on the mound in front of it. Coming close enough to see the Blightcaller in front of the house completes the scouting.\nCareful: Nathanos Blightcaller (level 62 elite) and his elite hounds stand in front of the house: take the remains on the mound from the side and do not pull him. You don't have to fight him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:114:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.7379000000000001,["x"]=0.23579999999999998,["title"]="Hameya's Plea",["objName"]="Mound of Dirt",["quest"]=6024,["object"]=177675}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:114",["text"]="Undercroft",["detail"]="Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised.\nCareful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.6579999999999999,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:92:1",["text"]="Artist Renfray",["y"]=0.754,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5846}}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:92",["text"]="Artist Renfray",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5846}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:116",["text"]="Chromie",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Chromie waits upstairs in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal, on the way back to Chillwind Camp."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:95",["text"]="Western Plaguelands",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.434,["y"]=0.848,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:95:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Chillwind Camp",["area"]=3197}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:96:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11616,["npcName"]="Nathaniel Dumah",["x"]=0.43420000000000003,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee",["quest"]=6389,["y"]=0.8482999999999999},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:96:3",["text"]="Flint's next task goes to Stormwind: you are level 60 now, skip it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:118:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11053,["npcName"]="High Priestess MacDonnell",["x"]=0.42969999999999997,["title"]="Return to Chillwind Camp",["quest"]=5226,["y"]=0.845},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:118:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10838,["title"]="Mission Accomplished!",["npcName"]="Commander Ashlam Valorfist",["x"]=0.42700000000000005,["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={5226},["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=5237,["y"]=0.8403}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:118",["text"]="Chillwind Camp",["detail"]="Ride back south-west to Chillwind Camp."}},["max"]=60,["min"]=58,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Silithus, Felwood, Winterspring & the Plaguelands (solo 58-60)",["faction"]="Alliance",["zoneName"]="Silithus",["category"]="Leveling",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["soloSpeedrun"]=true} end},
