eries, in the Mystic Ward."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Senator Barin Redstone, in the High Seat with King Magni",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:102:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1274,["npcName"]="Senator Barin Redstone",["x"]=0.39549999999999996,["title"]="The Reports",["quest"]=291,["y"]=0.5749}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:102",["text"]="High Seat",["detail"]="South through the Commons: Senator Barin Redstone stands in the High Seat with King Magni."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:103",["text"]="Buliwyf Stonehand",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Belia Thundergranite: Beast Training",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:104:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10090,["npcName"]="Belia Thundergranite",["x"]=0.7086,["title"]="Training the Beast",["y"]=0.8583,["quest"]=6086,["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}}},{["zone"]=1455,["locations"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.7089,["y"]=0.8361,["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["npc"]=5116,["npcName"]="Olmin Burningbeard"},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.7034,["y"]=0.9065000000000001,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["npc"]=5113,["npcName"]="Kelv Sternhammer"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:104:2",["t"]="train",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER"}},["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:104",["text"]="Military Ward",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER"}},["detail"]="East to the Military Ward: the warrior trainers and Buliwyf Stonehand in the Hall of Arms, the hunter trainers beside it."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwa