nd them in, then take his letter to his brother Nipsy at the Stormwind end."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="Nipsy, on the Stormwind platform",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:110:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13018,["npcName"]="Nipsy",["x"]=0.645,["title"]="Me Brother, Nipsy",["quest"]=6662,["y"]=0.075},{["map"]=1453,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:110:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5413,["npcName"]="Furen Longbeard",["x"]=0.6462,["title"]="Stormpike's Order",["quest"]=1338,["y"]=0.37229999999999996}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:110",["text"]="Nipsy",["detail"]="Ride the tram to Stormwind: Nipsy waits on the Stormwind platform. Furen Longbeard stands in the Dwarven District, just outside the tram."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:111:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1646,["npcName"]="Baros Alexston",["x"]=0.5774,["title"]="Humble Beginnings",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=15,["quest"]=399,["y"]=0.47859999999999997}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:111",["text"]="Baros Alexston",["detail"]="From the Dwarven District south-west to Cathedral Square: Baros Alexston's compass is in his old house in Westfall, on the way. The flight master and the Trade District are south of the square."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:112",["text"]="Stormwind flight master",["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["x"]=0.6629999999999999,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:112:1",["text"]="Stormwind flight master",["y"]=0.627,["t"]="goto"},{["map"]=1453,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:112:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=352,["npcName"]="Dungar Longdrink",["x"]=0.7129000000000001,["location"]="Stormwind",["node"]=2,["y"]=0.7223}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true