nvilmar on the way to the tunnel: Grund Drokda stands by Felix Whindlebolt at its door. Gozwin's camp is in the hills just north-west; the Snow Leopard Prowler (level 6) prowls around it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["note"]="Branstock Khalder, inside Anvilmar",["endNpcs"]={1226},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:16:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=837,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="Branstock Khalder",["x"]=0.28600000000000003,["qlvl"]=4,["minLevel"]=5,["y"]=0.6639,["title"]="In Favor of the Light",["quest"]=5626,["xp"]=90}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:16",["text"]="Branstock Khalder",["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["detail"]="Anvilmar is on the way north from Grelin Whitebeard's camp to the tunnel: Branstock Khalder, the priest trainer inside, sends priests of level 5 to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["itemName"]="Earth Sapta",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:17:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.624,["x"]=0.25,["item"]=6635,["note"]="Earth Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:17",["text"]="Call of Earth",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Back to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar. He gives you the Earth Sapta: take the rubble-marked path that climbs west from the south of the valley to the Spirit Stone on the ridge, drink the Sapta beside it and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then bring its Rough Quartz back to Teo."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1965,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Thalos",["x"]=0.3348,["title"]="Senir's Observations",["quest"]=282,["y"]=0.7184},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:18:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1965,["y"]=0.7184,["x"]=0.3348,["title"]="Senir's Observations",["minLevel"]=1,["pre"]={282},["qlvl"]=5,["quest"]=420,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Thalos"},{["map"]=1426,["endNpcs"]={265813},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:18:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=410,["minLevel"]=4,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Thalos",["x"]=0.3348,["qlvl"]=6,["y"]=0.7184,["pre"]={282},["title"]="The Adventurer",["quest"]=96628,["npc"]=1965},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:18:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6782,["npcName"]="Hands Springsprocket",["x"]=0.3385,["title"]="Supplies to Tannok",["minLevel"]=1,["qlvl"]=5,["quest"]=2160,["y"]=0.7223999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:18",["text"]="The tunnel",["detail"]="Mountaineer Thalos guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of Anvilmar; Hands Springsprocket stands beside him at its mouth."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["note"]="Eric Brighthammer: The Adventurer",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=265813,["npcName"]="Eric Brighthammer",["x"]=0.46649999999999997,["title"]="The Adventurer",["quest"]=96628,["y"]=0.5388000000000001},{["map"]=1426,["endNpcs"]={265813},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:19:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=410,["minLevel"]=4,["npcName"]="Eric Brighthammer",["x"]=0.46649999999999997,["qlvl"]=6,["y"]=0.5388000000000001,["pre"]={96628},["title"]="The Great Outdoors",["quest"]=96608,["npc"]=265813},{["title"]="The Great Outdoors",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:19:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Sit near the campfire (Optional)"},{["count"]=1,["text"]="Gain the Boosted Rest buff"}},["quest"]=96608},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpe