king Jetsteam",["from"]="Young Black Bear",["fromAlso"]="Black Bear",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=1129},{["map"]=1426,["itemName"]="Crag Boar Rib",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:35:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6543000000000001,["x"]=0.4236,["title"]="Beer Basted Boar Ribs",["lvl"]=8,["item"]=2886,["quest"]=384,["spread"]=true,["count"]=6},{["map"]=1426,["itemName"]="Chunk of Boar Meat",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:35:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6543000000000001,["x"]=0.4236,["title"]="Stocking Jetsteam",["lvl"]=8,["item"]=769,["quest"]=317,["spread"]=true,["count"]=4}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:33",["text"]="Dun Morogh: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Crag Boars and Young Black Bears roam the fields from Rumbleshot's camp north-east to Kharanos and the depot: kill them on the walk back."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:36:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12427,["y"]=0.5457,["x"]=0.4581,["title"]="Garments of the Light",["target"]="Mountaineer Dolf",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5625,["text"]="Heal and fortify Mountaineer Dolf"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:36",["text"]="Mountaineer Dolf",["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["detail"]="Mountaineer Dolf kneels wounded on the ridge between two low walls just south of Kharanos, across the road from the hunter pet trainer, on the walk back from Rumbleshot's camp. Cast Lesser Heal (Rank 2) on him, then Power Word: Fortitude: Rank 1 of Lesser Heal does not count."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["itemName"]="Rhapsody Malt",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:38:1",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=1247,["npcName"]="Innkeeper Belm",["x"]=0.4738,["item"]=2894,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.5252,["note"]="Rhap