ron Spies sneak around the lake shore east of the quarry; one of them drops the Dark Iron Map."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Pristine Leopard Pelt",["item"]=267414,["quest"]=95212,["map"]=1426,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=260157,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:69:1",["y"]=0.595,["x"]=0.7797,["title"]="Never Saddle on Quality",["lvl"]=10,["count"]=6,["from"]="Elder Snow Leopard",["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:69",["text"]="Dun Morogh: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Snow Leopards and boars roam the snow between the ranch and the quarry. Blacksmiths: Copper Bars come from smelting Copper Ore or the trade vendors."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:70:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1256,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95214}}},["npcName"]="Quarrymaster Thesten",["x"]=0.6916,["title"]="Stolen Blasting Powder",["quest"]=95214,["y"]=0.5479999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:70",["text"]="Gol'Bolar Quarry",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95214}}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:71",["text"]="Gol'Bolar Quarry",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=95217}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:74",["text"]="Protecting the Herd",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Vagash is a level 12 elite: take him on with a group. Alone, skip it: the Loch Modan quests ahead make up the experience."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:73:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1265,["npcName"]="Rudra Amberstill",["x"]=