m north-west of the South Gate Outpost; the path up starts behind the farm."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["x"]=0.322,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:78:1",["text"]="Braldir Ashmantle",["y"]=0.66,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:78",["text"]="Loch Modan",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}}},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:79",["text"]="Braldir Ashmantle",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Go through the tunnel into Loch Modan. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to Braldir Ashmantle's camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1960,["npcName"]="Pilot Hammerfoot",["x"]=0.8389,["title"]="The Lost Pilot",["minLevel"]=8,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=419,["y"]=0.39189999999999997},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.3617,["x"]=0.7967,["title"]="The Lost Pilot",["objName"]="A Dwarven Corpse",["quest"]=419,["object"]=2059},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83:3",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=11,["y"]=0.3617,["x"]=0.7967,["title"]="A Pilot's Revenge",["objName"]="A Dwarven Corpse",["pre"]={419},["minLevel"]=8,["quest"]=417,["object"]=2059},{["map"]=1426,["itemName"]="Mangy Claw",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1961,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83:4",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.3776,["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="A Pilot's Revenge",["from"]="Mangeclaw",["item"]=3183,["note"]="Mangy Claw: Mangeclaw",["quest"]=417,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1426,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1960,["npcName"]="Pilot Hammerfoot",["x"]=0.8389,["title"]="A Pilot's Revenge",["quest"]=417,["y"]=0.39189999999999997}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:83",["text"]="North Gate Outpost",["detail"]="Pilot Hammerfoot waits at the North Gate Outpost, north of the South Gate; the dwarven corpse lies up the pass to the west of him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:84:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1089,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Cobbleflint",["x"]=0.2207,["title"]="In Defense of the King's Lands",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=224,["y"]=0.7313},{["map"]=1432,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:84:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1092,["npcName"]="Captain Rugelfuss",["x"]=0.2323,["title"]="The Trogg Threat",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=267,["y"]=0.7368000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:84",["text"]="The tunnel post",["detail"]="East through the South Gate tunnel into Loch Modan. Mountaineer Cobbleflint and Captain Rugelfuss stand at the dwarven post just past it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:85:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1161,["y"]=0.7254,["x"]=0.2963,["title"]="In Defense of the King's Lands",["lvl"]=12,["target"]="Stonesplinter Trogg",["count"]=10,["quest"]=224,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1432,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:85:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1162,["y"]=0.7289,["x"]=0.2957,["title"]="In Defense of the King's Lands",["lvl"]=12,["target"]="Stonesplinter Scout",["count"]=10,["quest"]=224,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1432,["itemName"]="Trogg Stone Tooth",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:82:3",["t"]="collect",["item"]=2536,["y"]=0.7289,["x"]=0.2957,["title"]="The Trogg Threat",["lvl"]=14,["spread"]=tru