kes it",["crumbs"]={1339},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:85:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1343,["y"]=0.184,["x"]=0.24760000000000001,["title"]="Stormpike's Order",["minLevel"]=9,["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=1338,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Stormpike"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:85",["text"]="The west hills and the Algaz Station",["detail"]="North through the hills west of the road to Mountaineer Stormpike at the Algaz Station. The Tunnel Rat kobolds dig in the hills on the way; Elder Black Bears, Mountain Boars and Forest Lurkers roam the same ground."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["itemName"]="Miners' Gear",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=271,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:89:1",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.23440000000000003,["x"]=0.349,["title"]="Filthy Paws",["from"]="Miners' League Crates",["item"]=2640,["note"]="Miners' Gear, from the crates",["quest"]=307,["count"]=4}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:89",["text"]="Silver Stream Mine",["detail"]="East along the hills to the mine at the north end of the loch: the Miners' League crates sit in its tunnels, among more Tunnel Rats. Shamans: the Tunnel Rat Geomancers (level 12-13) here carry the Fire Tar.\nCareful: the Tunnel Rat Geomancers (12-13) cast from range in the narrow tunnels: pull them one at a time."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:90",["text"]="Back to the Algaz Station",["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:90:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1343,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Stormpike",["x"]=0.24760000000000001,["title"]="Filthy Paws",["quest"]=307,["y"]=0.184}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:91:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1340,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Kadrell",["x"]=0.33799999999999997,["title"]="Rat Catching",["quest"]=416,["y"]=0.483},{["map"]=1432,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:91:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1963,["npcName"]="Vidra Hearthstove",["x"]=0.3483,["title"]="Thelsamar Blood Sausages",["quest"]=418,["y"]=0.4928},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:88:3",["node"]=6,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Ironforge",["t"]="fly",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK","DRUID"}},["area"]=1537}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:88",["text"]="Thelsamar",["detail"]="South down the road to Thelsamar, finishing the ears, meat and ichor on the way. Mountaineer Kadrell walks the road through town."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:89",["text"]="The Reagent Pouch",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="South down the road past the tunnel post into Stonesplinter Valley: the Stonesplinter Seers (level 13-14) stand among the troggs in its middle. Stay out of the far south end, where Shamans and Bonesnappers (level 15-16) camp, and keep clear of Headsplitter (15) on his walk. The Seers come with other troggs and cast from range: pull one at a time."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:90",["text"]="The Fire Spirit Stone",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Back north to Braldir Ashmantle's camp above the tunnel. Braldir Ashmantle gives you the Fire Sapta. Climb to the peak above his camp, drink the Sapta beside the Spirit Stone and defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, then place its Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:91",["text"]="Back to Bruegs Kindleborn",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Back through the tunnel to Bruegs Kindleborn' cave above the farm, then west along the road to Ironforge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Golnir Bouldertoe, in the Great Forge",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:92:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4256,["npcName"]="Golnir Bouldertoe",["x"]=0.5152,["title"]="Ride to Ironforge",["quest"]=6391,["y"]=0.2631},{["map"]=1455,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:92:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4256,["y"]=0.2631,["x"]=0.5152,["title"]="Gryth Thurden",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={6391},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=6388,["npcName"]="Golnir Bouldertoe"},{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the Great Forge",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:92:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1573,["npcName"]="Gryth Thurden",["x"]=0.555,["title"]="Gryth Thurden",["quest"]=6388,["y"]=0.47740000000000005},{["map"]=1455,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:92:4",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=1573,["npcName"]="Gryth Thurden",["x"]=0.555,["location"]="Ironforge",["y"]=0.47740000000000005,["node"]=6,["area"]=1537}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:92",["text"]="Golnir Bouldertoe",["detail"]="Golnir Bouldertoe works at the Great Forge's north end, and Gryth Thurden keeps the gryphons in the Great Forge, where the flight from Thelsamar lands."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:93:1",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Your Package Has Arrived",["y"]=0.4861,["x"]=0.723,["object"]=660964,["objName"]="Misplaced Packages",["qlvl"]=2,["minLevel"]=1,["quest"]=97263,["note"]="Misplaced Packages, by the mailbox in Tinker Town"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:93",["text"]="Tinker Town",["detail"]="East from the Great Forge into Tinker Town: the Misplaced Packages lie by its mailbox. From here the guide goes once round the city: north to the Forlorn Cavern, west to the Mystic Ward, south through the Commons to the High Seat, east through the Military Ward and back to Tinker Town for the tram."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:94:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258098,["npcName"]="Eldrun Stormbreaker",["x"]=0.47100000000000003,["title"]="Your Package Has Arrived",["quest"]=97263,["y"]=0.1379},{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Lago Blackwrench: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it",["endNpcs"]={6122},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:94:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=420,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["npcName"]="Lago Blackwrench",["x"]=0.4763,["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=10,["y"]=0.0926,["title"]="The Slaughtered Lamb",["quest"]=1715,["npc"]=6120},{["zone"]=1455,["locations"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.5008,["y"]=0.0745,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["npc"]=5173,["npcName"]="Alexander Calder"},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.47100000000000003,["y"]=0.1379,["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["npc"]=258098,["npcName"]="Eldrun Stormbreaker"},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.515,["y"]=0.1533,["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE"}},["npc"]=5167,["npcName"]="Fenthwick"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:94:3",["t"]="train",["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE","SHAMAN","WARLOCK"}},["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:94",["text"]="Forlorn Cavern",["detail"]="North of the Great Forge: Eldrun Stormbreaker, the shaman trainer, stands at the south end of the Forlorn Cavern, the rogue and warlock trainers and Lago Blackwrench just north of him."},{["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:95:1",["t"]="level",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["level"]=12}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:95",["text"]="The Tome of Divinity",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="West from the Forlorn Cavern into the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries, Tiza and Muiredon on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of Brandur Ironhammer. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it."},{["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:96:1",["t"]="level",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["level"]=12}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:96",["text"]="Narm Faulk",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="Head back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script."},{["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:97:1",["t"]="level",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["level"]=12}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:97",["text"]="Muiredon Battleforge",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash, her own copy of the letter",["endNpcs"]={258785},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:98:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258785,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["x"]=0.2459,["title"]="Confounding Flash",["quest"]=94817,["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=10,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["races"]={"Gnome"}},["y"]=0.1},{["map"]=1455,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:98:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258785,["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["x"]=0.2459,["title"]="Confounding Flash",["y"]=0.1,["quest"]=94817,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["races"]={"Gnome"}}},{["zone"]=1455,["locations"]={{["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["x"]=0.2459,["y"]=0.1,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["npc"]=258785,["map"]=1455},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.2716,["y"]=0.0857,["only"]={["classes"]={"MAGE"}},["npc"]=7312,["npcName"]="Dink"},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.23129999999999998,["y"]=0.061399999999999996,["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["npc"]=5149,["npcName"]="Brandur Ironhammer"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:98:3",["t"]="train",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN","PRIEST","MAGE"}},["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:98",["text"]="Mystic Ward",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN","PRIEST","MAGE"}},["detail"]="The paladin, priest and mage trainers are in the Hall of Mysteries, in the Mystic Ward."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Senator Barin Redstone, in the High Seat with King Magni",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:99:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1274,["npcName"]="Senator Barin Redstone",["x"]=0.39549999999999996,["title"]="The Reports",["quest"]=291,["y"]=0.5749}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:99",["text"]="High Seat",["detail"]="South through the Commons: Senator Barin Redstone stands in the High Seat with King Magni."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:100",["text"]="Buliwyf Stonehand",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest."},{["goals"]={{["zone"]=1455,["locations"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.659,["y"]=0.8841,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["npc"]=5114,["npcName"]="Bilban Tosslespanner"},{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.6987000000000001,["y"]=0.8290000000000001,["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["npc"]=5117,["npcName"]="Regnus Thundergranite"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:101:1",["t"]="train",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER"}},["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:101",["text"]="Military Ward",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER"}},["detail"]="East to the Military Ward: the warrior trainers and Buliwyf Stonehand in the Hall of Arms, the hunter trainers beside it."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:102",["text"]="Buliwyf Stonehand",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:103",["text"]="Buliwyf Stonehand",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Maces from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."},{["goals"]={{["zone"]=1455,["note"]="Theridran in Stormwind; Dun Morogh has no druid trainer",["locations"]={{["npcName"]="Theridran",["x"]=0.3611,["map"]=1453,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["npc"]=5505,["y"]=0.6439},{["map"]=1416,["x"]=0.11789999999999999,["y"]=0.5661,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["npc"]=270459,["npcName"]="Alfina Nightgaze"},{["map"]=1438,["x"]=0.5863,["y"]=0.4029,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["