s roam the woods between the lake and the Tower of Azora; Prowlers further east give pelts too.\nCareful: Elder Finseer, a level 11 rare murloc, walks the river by Guard Thomas' bridge, east of the Prowlers' woods: leave him be."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:59:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=248248,["npcName"]="Blixie Fitzwink",["x"]=0.632,["title"]="Stolen Enchanting Supplies",["minLevel"]=7,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=91725,["y"]=0.726},{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:59:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=248242,["npcName"]="Hamish Bergwort",["x"]=0.6509999999999999,["title"]="Delicate Instruments",["minLevel"]=6,["qlvl"]=8,["quest"]=91723,["y"]=0.6984}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:59",["text"]="The Tower of Azora",["detail"]="Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:60:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=261,["npcName"]="Guard Thomas",["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Further Concerns",["quest"]=35,["y"]=0.7218000000000001},{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:60:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261,["y"]=0.7218000000000001,["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Find the Lost Guards",["minLevel"]=7,["pre"]={35},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=37,["npcName"]="Guard Thomas"},{["map"]=1429,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:60:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261,["npcName"]="Guard Thomas",["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Protect the Frontier",["minLevel"]=7,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=52,["y"]=0.7218000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:60",["text"]="The bridge",["detail"]="Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:61:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=822,["y"]=0.804,["x"]=0.7340000000000001,["title"]="Protect the Frontier",["target"]="Young Forest Bear",["count"]=5,["quest"]=52,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Brass Collar",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=330,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:61:4",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.7925,["x"]=0.6966,["title"]="Princess Must Die!",["from"]="Princess",["item"]=1006,["note"]="Brass Collar: Princess",["quest"]=88,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:61",["text"]="Downstream and Princess",["detail"]="The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Young Forest Bears on the way; the Prowlers (level 9-10) wait for the walk back to Guard Thomas, after the logging camp and the mine. Careful: Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore. Only go for his head with a group; otherwise leave him: it's optional."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:62",["text"]="Croaky",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore south of the bridge: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Croaky's Head needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back. Right-click the head for its quest."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:63",["text"]="Ridgepoint Tower",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["x"]=0.6509999999999999,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]