="The moonwell sits north of Aldrassil."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3514,["npcName"]="Tenaron Stormgrip",["x"]=0.5906,["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["quest"]=921,["y"]=0.3945},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3514,["y"]=0.3945,["x"]=0.5906,["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["minLevel"]=1,["pre"]={921},["qlvl"]=5,["quest"]=928,["npcName"]="Tenaron Stormgrip"},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Lost Journal, upstairs",["endNpcs"]={265811},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:12:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=410,["object"]=654846,["y"]=0.39549999999999996,["x"]=0.5907,["title"]="The Adventurer",["objName"]="Lost Journal",["pre"]={921},["minLevel"]=4,["quest"]=96630,["qlvl"]=6},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Shanda, the priest trainer, on the second level of Aldrassil on the way down: Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar takes it",["endNpcs"]={3600},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:12:4",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=90,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["npcName"]="Shanda",["x"]=0.5917,["minLevel"]=5,["qlvl"]=4,["y"]=0.4044,["title"]="In Favor of Elune",["quest"]=5622,["npc"]=3595}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:12",["text"]="Tenaron Stormgrip",["detail"]="Back to the top of Aldrassil. The Lost Journal lies beside him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:12:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8583,["limit"]=300,["npcName"]="Dirania Silvershine",["x"]=0.609,["minLevel"]=2,["title"]="Iverron's Antidote",["pre"]={3521},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=3522,["y"]=0.41960000000000003},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:12:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8584,["npcName"]="Iverron",["x"]=0.5459,["title"]="Iverron's Antidote",["quest"]=3522,["y"]=0.3299}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:12",["text"]="Iverron's Antidote",["detail"]="Take the antidote from Dirania Silvershine at the foot of Aldrassil only now, on the way down: it lasts five minutes. Iverron waits north-west, by the cave: go straight on to him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:13:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6780,["npcName"]="Porthannius",["x"]=0.6115999999999999,["title"]="Dolanaar Delivery",["minLevel"]=1,["qlvl"]=5,["quest"]=2159,["y"]=0.4764}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:13",["text"]="Porthannius",["detail"]="Leave Shadowglen by the path south-east of Aldrassil: Porthannius stands beside it, where it goes down towards the road to Dolanaar."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:14:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2150,["npcName"]="Zenn Foulhoof",["x"]=0.6035,["title"]="Zenn's Bidding",["minLevel"]=4,["qlvl"]=5,["quest"]=488,["y"]=0.5616}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:14",["text"]="Zenn Foulhoof",["detail"]="Follow the road south-west out of Shadowglen. Zenn Foulhoof sits beside it just east of Dolanaar."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:16",["text"]="Dolanaar",["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Lyreena Duskblade, by the campfire",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=265811,["npcName"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["x"]=0.5758,["title"]="The Adventurer",["quest"]=96630,["y"]=0.5664},{["map"]=1438,["endNpcs"]={265811},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:16:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=265811,["minLevel"]=4,["y"]=0.5664,["x"]=0.5758,["title"]="The Great Outdoors",["npcName"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["pre"]={96630},["qlvl"]=6,["quest"]=96606,["xp"]=410}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="/sit by Lyreena Duskblade's campfire until you get Boosted Rest",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:16:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Sit near the campfire (Optional)"},{["count"]=1,["text"]="Gain the Boosted Rest buff"}},["y"]=0.5670000000000001,["x"]=0.5770000000000001,["title"]="The Great Outdoors",["quest"]=96606},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:16:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=265811,["npcName"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["x"]=0.5758,["title"]="The Great Outdoors",["quest"]=96606,["y"]=0.5664},{["map"]=1438,["endNpcs"]={6286},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:17:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=265811,["minLevel"]=4,["y"]=0.5664,["x"]=0.5758,["title"]="Camping 101: Cooking",["npcName"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["pre"]={95998,96101,96604,96605,96606,96607,96608},["qlvl"]=6,["quest"]=96634,["xp"]=270}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:17",["text"]="The Great Outdoors",["detail"]="With a profession learned, Lyreena Duskblade also offers its Camping 101, which its trainer takes: alchemy and herbalism beside Zarrin, First Aid with Byancie in the inn, skinning and leatherworking at the Maneweavers' camp on the road west."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:17",["text"]="Camping 101: Alchemy",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Cyndra Kindwhisper takes it once your Alchemy skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:18",["text"]="Camping 101: Herbalism",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Malorne Bladeleaf takes it once your Herbalism skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:19",["text"]="Camping 101: First Aid",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Byancie takes it once your First Aid skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:20",["text"]="Camping 101: Skinning",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Radnaal Maneweaver takes it once your Skinning skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:21",["text"]="Camping 101: Leatherworking",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Nadyia Maneweaver takes it once your Leatherworking skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:22",["text"]="Zarrin",["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:22:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Zarrin"}},["y"]=0.613,["x"]=0.5710000000000001,["title"]="Camping 101: Cooking",["quest"]=96634},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:22:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6286,["npcName"]="Zarrin",["x"]=0.5711999999999999,["title"]="Camping 101: Cooking",["quest"]=96634,["y"]=0.613}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:24",["text"]="Cyndra Kindwhisper",["superseded"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={97938}},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=97938}}},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c