Gnarlpine Shamans",["lvl"]=8,["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:42:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7317,["npcName"]="Oben Rageclaw",["x"]=0.44939999999999997,["title"]="The Sleeping Druid",["quest"]=2541,["y"]=0.6159},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:42:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7317,["y"]=0.6159,["x"]=0.44939999999999997,["title"]="Druid of the Claw",["minLevel"]=3,["pre"]={2541},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2561,["npcName"]="Oben Rageclaw"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:43",["text"]="Ban'ethil Barrow Den",["detail"]="The barrow is south of the road. Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom is held inside, Oben Rageclaw sleeps in its depths, and the four relic chests sit in the lower rooms. Its furbolgs drop Shayla's fangs.\nCareful: the barrow's Gnarlpine Defenders, Augurs and Shamans (7-9) stand in threes in the narrow tunnels: pull each group back toward the entrance before you go deeper."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Rageclaw, in the den; walks around Ban'ethil Hollow: look inside the circle on the map",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:42:10",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7318,["y"]=0.5858,["x"]=0.45530000000000004,["title"]="Druid of the Claw",["target"]="Rageclaw",["quest"]=2561,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Voodoo Charm",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:42:11",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.586,["x"]=0.455,["title"]="Druid of the Claw",["quest"]=2561,["item"]=8149},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:42:12",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7317,["npcName"]="Oben Rageclaw",["x"]=0.44939999999999997,["title"]="Druid of the Claw",["quest"]=2561,["y"]=0.6159}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:44",["text"]="Rageclaw",["detail"]="Rageclaw (level 10), Oben Rageclaw's soulless body, walks around Ban'ethil Hollow in the den: kill him, then use Oben Rageclaw's Voodoo Charm."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:45:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=275744,["npcName"]="Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom",["x"]=0.44659999999999994,["escort"]=true,["minLevel"]=4,["y"]=0.5892000000000001,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=99053,["title"]="Escaping Ban'ethil"},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Walk Lynessa out and keep her alive",["r"]=25,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:43:2",["text"]="Ban'ethil Hollow, outside the barrow",["y"]=0.573,["x"]=0.46399999999999997,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["t"]="goto"},{["title"]="Escaping Ban'ethil",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:43:3",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=99053,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Lynessa Duskblossom out of Ban'ethil"}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:45",["text"]="Escaping Ban'ethil",["detail"]="Escort Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom out of the barrow; Sentinel Kyra Starsong in Dolanaar takes the report."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Tourmaline Phial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:44:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.6709999999999999,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["quest"]=933,["item"]=5621},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Filled Tourmaline Phial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=19551,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:44:2",["quest"]=933,["y"]=0.6709999999999999,["x"]=0.424,["item"]=5645,["from"]="Pools of Arlithrien Moonwell",["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Use the Tourmaline Phial at the moonwell"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:44",["text"]="The Pools of Arlithrien",["detail"]="South-west of the barrow. The moonwell sits by the pools."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:45:1",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=10,["y"]=0.7619,["x"]=0.4261,["title"]="The Glowing Fruit",["objName"]="Strange Fruited Plant",["pre"]={918},["minLevel"]=4,["quest"]=930,["object"]=6751},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Gnarlpine Fang",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:47:2",["t"]="collect",["item"]=5220,["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.7701,["x"]=0.413,["count"]=15,["lvl"]=7,["note"]="Gnarlpine Fang: any Gnarlpine furbolg",["title"]="Bounty: Gnarlpine Furbolg",["quest"]=490,["fromNpcsAt"]="9,1;1,9,13;9,11,1;7;6,5;5,6,7;7,5,6;5,7,6;6,5,7;8;8;8;4,6,5;5,6;5,6,7;3,2,4;2,4,12;4,10;9,1;5,6,7;4,6,5;4,2,3;4,3,2;4,3;10,4;4,10"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:47",["text"]="Gnarlpine Hold",["detail"]="South of the pools. The Strange Fruited Plant grows by the Hold; the furbolgs around it drop the rest of the fangs.\nCareful: the Gnarlpine Avengers (9-10) and Augurs here stand close together and many players died at the Hold: pull them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2151,["npcName"]="Moon Priestess Amara",["x"]=0.5291,["title"]="The Road to Darnassus",["quest"]=487,["y"]=0.5720000000000001},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot, upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3567,["npcName"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["x"]=0.5557,["title"]="Twisted Hatred",["quest"]=932,["y"]=0.5695},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2078,["npcName"]="Athridas Bearmantle",["x"]=0.5596,["title"]="The Relics of Wakening",["quest"]=483,["y"]=0.5727},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2078,["y"]=0.5727,["x"]=0.5596,["title"]="Ursal the Mauler",["minLevel"]=4,["pre"]={483},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=486,["npcName"]="Athridas Bearmantle"},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2081,["npcName"]="Sentinel Kyra Starsong",["x"]=0.56,["title"]="Escaping Ban'ethil",["quest"]=99053,["y"]=0.5952000000000001},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:46:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3515,["npcName"]="Corithras Moonrage",["x"]=0.5614,["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["quest"]=933,["y"]=0.6171},{["map"]=1438,["endNpcs"]={3515},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:48:7",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=650,["minLevel"]=1,["npcName"]="Corithras Moonrage",["x"]=0.5614,["qlvl"]=11,["y"]=0.6171,["pre"]={933},["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["quest"]=7383,["npc"]=3515}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:48",["text"]="Dolanaar",["detail"]="Moon Priestess Amara patrols the road west of the village: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the road until you meet her."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Fel Cone",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1673,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:47:1",["y"]=0.534,["x"]=0.616,["count"]=3,["from"]="Fel Cone",["quest"]=489,["item"]=3418,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Seek Redemption!"},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:47:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2150,["npcName"]="Zenn Foulhoof",["x"]=0.6035,["title"]="Seek Redemption!",["quest"]=489,["y"]=0.5616}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:47",["text"]="Seek Redemption!",["detail"]="Fel Cones lie under the trees all around Dolanaar and Zenn Foulhoof: pick them up on the road east and hand them to Zenn Foulhoof on the way to Ferocitas the Dream Eater."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:48:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7235,["y"]=0.5218,["x"]=0.6827,["title"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["lvl"]=7,["target"]="Gnarlpine Mystic",["quest"]=2459,["count"]=7},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Gnarlpine Necklace",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=7234,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5341,["x"]=0.6937000000000001,["item"]=8049,["from"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:48:2",["fromKind"]="npc",["note"]="Gnarlpine Necklace, from Ferocitas the Dream Eater"},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Tallonkai's Jewel",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:48:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.534,["x"]=0.6940000000000001,["title"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["item"]=8050,["quest"]=2459,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:48",["text"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["detail"]="Gnarlpine Mystics and Ferocitas the Dream Eater camp north-east of Starbreeze Village. Ferocitas the Dream Eater drops the Gnarlpine Necklace: open it for the jewel.\nCareful: Ferocitas the Dream Eater waits near the camp fire with mystics around him, so pulling him without adds is hard."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot, upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:49:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3567,["npcName"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["x"]=0.5557,["title"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["quest"]=2459,["y"]=0.5695}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:49",["text"]="Dolanaar",["detail"]="The road west to the Oracle Glade runs through Dolanaar: hand Tallonkai Swiftroot the jewel on the way."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:50",["text"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:85",["text"]="Befouled Webwoods",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="North-west of Dolanaar, on the way to the Oracle Glade, Befouled Webwoods creep through the woods; Xethorr the Wicked prowls at their east edge and carries the Mature Fel Moss.\nXethorr the Wicked is elite (level 12): grouping up is advised. Clear the webwoods around him first and pull him on his own."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Mossy Tumor",["item"]=5170,["quest"]=923,["map"]=1438,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2029,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:51:1",["count"]=5,["y"]=0.4269,["x"]=0.4391,["title"]="Tumors",["from"]="Timberling Mire Beast",["note"]="Mossy Tumor: timberlings",["lvl"]=9,["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:51",["text"]="The Wellspring River",["detail"]="West from the webwoods to the Wellspring River, then north along it to the glade: the timberlings along its banks drop the Mossy Tumors.\nCareful: Xethorr the Wicked, a level 12 elite, prowls the east edge of the Befouled Webwoods north-west of Dolanaar: if you are alone, keep clear of the webwoods and go round him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak, by the moonwell",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:52:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3519,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="The Enchanted Glade",["minLevel"]=6,["qlvl"]=11,["quest"]=937,["y"]=0.3436},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Amethyst Phial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:52:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.341,["x"]=0.384,["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["quest"]=7383,["item"]=18152},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Filled Amethyst Phial",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=19552,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:52:3",["quest"]=7383,["y"]=0.341,["x"]=0.384,["item"]=18151,["from"]="Oracle Glade Moonwell",["title"]="Crown of the Earth",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Use the Amethyst Phial at the moonwell"},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:52:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=275683,["npcName"]="Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow",["x"]=0.3754,["title"]="The Lost Runner",["quest"]=99046,["y"]=0.36810000000000004},{["map"]=1438,["crumbs"]={99046},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:55:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=275683,["npcName"]="Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow",["x"]=0.3754,["title"]="Not Dead Yet",["minLevel"]=4,["qlvl"]=9,["quest"]=99047,["y"]=0.36810000000000004}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:55",["text"]="Oracle Glade",["detail"]="The moonwell is in the middle of the glade. The Strange Fronded Plant grows at its north end."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Bloodfeather Belt",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:56:1",["t"]="collect",["item"]=5204,["y"]=0.3779,["x"]=0.3732,["title"]="The Enchanted Glade",["lvl"]=9,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="1,2;1,3,2;1,2,3,7;6,5;5,4,6;5,4,6;2;1,2;2,1,3",["quest"]=937,["count"]=6},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Mist, by the west wall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:53:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3568,["escort"]=true,["npcName"]="Mist",["x"]=0.3154,["minLevel"]=7,["title"]="Mist",["qlvl"]=12,["limit"]=540,["quest"]=938,["y"]=0.3161},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Lead Mist to the moonwell",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:53:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Lead Mist safely to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak"}},["y"]=0.344,["x"]=0.38299999999999995,["title"]="Mist",["quest"]=938,["escort"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:56",["text"]="Bloodfeather harpies",["detail"]="The Bloodfeather harpies nest on the slopes west and north of the glade. Mist, an injured sabercat, lies by the glade's west wall among them: lead her back to Sentinel Arynia at the moonwell before her time runs out.\nCareful: The harpies stand packed together, so extra ones often join a fight. Casters are mixed in among them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:54:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3519,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="The Enchanted Glade",["quest"]=937,["y"]=0.3436},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:54:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3519,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="Mist",["quest"]=938,["y"]=0.3436},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:54:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3519,["y"]=0.3436,["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="Darkness in the Glade",["minLevel"]=6,["pre"]={937},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=98392,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:54",["text"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["detail"]="Back to the moonwell."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Hatescreech's Amulet",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=272034,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:55:1",["y"]=0.39289999999999997,["x"]=0.3505,["count"]=1,["from"]="Hatescreech",["quest"]=98392,["item"]=280831,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Darkness in the Glade"},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Windmistress Gaedress' Amulet",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=272044,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:55:2",["y"]=0.3613,["x"]=0.3318,["count"]=1,["from"]="Windmistress Gaedress",["quest"]=98392,["item"]=280832,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Darkness in the Glade"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:58",["text"]="Hatescreech and Windmistress Gaedress",["detail"]="Hatescreech and Windmistress Gaedress (level 10) fly just west of the moonwell. Witchmother Arysa (12) waits further north for the walk back from Lady Sathrah."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:56:1",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=10,["y"]=0.2876,["x"]=0.3461,["title"]="The Shimmering Frond",["objName"]="Strange Fronded Plant",["pre"]={918},["minLevel"]=4,["quest"]=931,["object"]=6752},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Silvery Spinnerets",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=7319,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:59:2",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.254,["x"]=0.39399999999999996,["title"]="Tears of the Moon",["from"]="Lady Sathrah",["item"]=8344,["note"]="Silvery Spinnerets: Lady Sathrah",["quest"]=2518,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:59",["text"]="Lady Sathrah",["detail"]="The Strange Fronded Plant grows at the glade's north end, on the way: then north along the island's northern edge by Wellspring Lake, Lady Sathrah, a level 12 spider, lurks."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Witchmother Arysa's Amulet",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=272046,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:55:3",["y"]=0.27940000000000004,["x"]=0.3422,["count"]=1,["from"]="Witchmother Arysa",["quest"]=98392,["item"]=280834,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Darkness in the Glade"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:step:60",["text"]="Witchmother Arysa",["detail"]="On the way back south to the glade: Witchmother Arysa (level 12) flies on the slopes north-west of the moonwell, among Bloodfeather Matriarchs (11). Pull the harpies around her first."},{["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:57",["text"]="Sentinel Arynia again",["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:57:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3519,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="Darkness in the Glade",["quest"]=98392,["y"]=0.3436},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:57:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3519,["y"]=0.3436,["x"]=0.3832,["title"]="The Oracle Tree",["minLevel"]=6,["pre"]={98392},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=98398,["npcName"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak"},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Oracle Tree Bark, just west of the moonwell",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:57:3",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.3404,["x"]=0.3697,["title"]="The Oracle Tree",["objName"]="Oracle Tree Bark",["quest"]=98398,["object"]=673378},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="the same Oracle Tree Bark: Fandral in Darnassus takes it",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:57:4",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=11,["y"]=0.3404,["x"]=0.3697,["title"]="Teldrassil",["objName"]="Oracle Tree Bark",["pre"]={98398},["minLevel"]=6,["quest"]=940,["object"]=673378}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:58:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2155,["npcName"]="Sentinel Shayla Nightbreeze",["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="Bounty: Gnarlpine Furbolg",["quest"]=490,["y"]=0.5127}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:58",["text"]="Sentinel Shayla Nightbreeze",["detail"]="South from the glade to the road: Shayla walks the road west of Dolanaar, from where the path down from the glade meets it south-west to the bend at about 38,54 and back."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Byancie, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:60:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6094,["npcName"]="Byancie",["x"]=0.5529,["title"]="Not Dead Yet",["quest"]=99047,["y"]=0.5682},{["map"]=1438,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:60:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6094,["y"]=0.5682,["x"]=0.5529,["title"]="The Great Tree Provides",["minLevel"]=4,["pre"]={99047},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=99050,["npcName"]="Byancie"},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Empty Vial",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:60:3",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=3614,["npcName"]="Narret Shadowgrove",["x"]=0.5527000000000001,["item"]=3371,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.5715,["note"]="Empty Vial from Narret Shadowgrove, beside Byancie"},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Laurna Morninglight: Priestess Alathea in Darnassus takes it",["endNpcs"]={11401},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:goal:63:4",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=210,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["npcName"]="Laurna Morninglight",["x"]=0.5556,["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=10,["y"]=0.5675,["title"]="Returning Home",["quest"]=5629,["npc"]=3600},{["locations"]={{["map"]=1438,["x"]=0.5556,["y"]=0.5675,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["npc"]=3600,["npcName"]="Laurna Morninglight"},{["map"]=1438,["x"]=0.5622,["y"]=0.5920000000000001,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["npc"]=3598,["npcName"]="Kyra Windblade"},{["map"]=1438,["x"]=0.5668,["y"]=0.5949,["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["npc"]=3601,["npcName"]="Dazalar"},{["map"]=14