ites; they stand in the camp's north-east, beside the supply crates: pull the quilboar away from them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.385,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:7:1",["text"]="Telf Joolam",["y"]=0.59,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1525}}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:8",["text"]="Durotar",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Tauren"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1525}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5900,["npcName"]="Telf Joolam",["x"]=0.38549999999999995,["title"]="Call of Fire",["quest"]=1525,["y"]=0.5896},{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5900,["y"]=0.5896,["x"]=0.38549999999999995,["title"]="Call of Fire",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={1525},["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1526,["npcName"]="Telf Joolam"},{["map"]=1411,["itemName"]="Glowing Ember",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=5893,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:8:3",["y"]=0.5829,["x"]=0.3872,["count"]=1,["from"]="Minor Manifestation of Fire",["quest"]=1526,["item"]=6655,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Call of Fire"},{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:8:4",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.5821999999999999,["x"]=0.3896,["title"]="Call of Fire",["objName"]="Brazier of the Dormant Flame",["quest"]=1526,["object"]=61934},{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:8:5",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=13,["y"]=0.5821999999999999,["x"]=0.3896,["title"]="Call of Fire",["objName"]="Brazier of the Dormant Flame",["pre"]={1526},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=1527,["object"]=61934}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:9",["text"]="Telf Joolam",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Tauren"}},["detail"]="Back east over the bridge and up the trail to Telf Joolam's shrine again. Telf Joolam makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.56,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:46:1",["text"]="Kranal Fiss",["y"]=0.19899999999999998,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:10",["text"]="The Barrens",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Tauren"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Kranal Fiss: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5907,["npcName"]="Kranal Fiss",["x"]=0.5603,["title"]="Call of Fire",["y"]=0.1989,["quest"]=1527,["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5176,["itemName"]="Fire Totem"},{["item"]=263412,["itemName"]="Totem of Charged Flames"}}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:11",["text"]="Kranal Fiss",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Tauren"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5878,["npcName"]="Thun'grim Firegaze",["x"]=0.5722999999999999,["title"]="Forged Steel",["quest"]=1503,["y"]=0.3034}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:12",["text"]="Thun'grim Firegaze",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"},["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Tauren"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["crumbs"]={860},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:13:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3338,["y"]=0.310100000