Crossroads. Chol'aruk the Ravener is a group quest: Chol'aruk is a level 20 elite boar in the Razormane's Thorn Hill cave, east of the town, where the route goes back for Kreenig Snarlsnout later."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:38:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3389,["npcName"]="Regthar Deathgate",["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Centaur Bracers",["minLevel"]=9,["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=855,["y"]=0.2841},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:38:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3389,["npcName"]="Regthar Deathgate",["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Kolkar Leaders",["minLevel"]=11,["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=850,["y"]=0.2841}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:38",["text"]="Regthar Deathgate",["detail"]="West to Regthar Deathgate's watch post on the Kolkar border."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Centaur Bracers",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:27:1",["t"]="collect",["item"]=5030,["y"]=0.254,["x"]=0.45880000000000004,["title"]="Centaur Bracers",["lvl"]=14,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1,2;2,1;1;1,2;1,2;1;2,1;1,2;2,1,7;1,2;1,2;2,1;1,2;2;1,2;1,2,5;1,2;1;3;4,3,5;3,4;5;4,3,5;2,3,5;1,2;1,2;5,2,3;5,3,4;3,4,5;1,2;1,2;1,2,6;2,3;1,2;2;1;1,2;3;4,5;4,5;5,4;4,5;4",["quest"]=855,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:39:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Explore the waters of the Forgotten Pools"}},["y"]=0.228,["x"]=0.45299999999999996,["title"]="The Forgotten Pools",["quest"]=870},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Fungal Spores",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3640,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:39:3",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.22469999999999998,["x"]=0.4556,["title"]="Fungal Spores",["from"]="Laden Mushroom",["item"]=5012,["spread"]=true,["quest"]=848,["count"]=4},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Kodobane's Head",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3394,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:39:4",["y"]=0.2352,["x"]=0.428,["count"]=1,["from"]="Barak Kodobane",["quest"]=850,["item"]=5022,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Kolkar Leaders"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:27",["text"]="The Barrens: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="The pools lie just north of Regthar Deathgate. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers. Barak Kodobane stands in the Kolkar camp west of the pools."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:40",["text"]="Regthar Deathgate",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:40:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3389,["npcName"]="Regthar Deathgate",["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Centaur Bracers",["quest"]=855,["y"]=0.2841},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:40:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3389,["npcName"]="Regthar Deathgate",["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Kolkar Leaders",["quest"]=850,["y"]=0.2841},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Regthar Deathgate: Verog the Dervish comes out when you kill the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis, later",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:40:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3389,["y"]=0.2841,["x"]=0.4534,["title"]="Verog the Dervish",["minLevel"]=11,["pre"]={850},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=851,["npcName"]="Regthar Deathgate"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Prowler Claws",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3425,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:29:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.3121,["x"]=0.44229999999999997,["title"]="Prowlers of the Barrens",["from"]="Savannah Prowler",["item"]=5096,["spread"]=true,["quest"]=903,["count"]=7},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Witchwing Talon",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:29:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,2,4,3;1,2,3;4,2,1;4;1,2,3;1,2;1,2;2;1,2;4;4,3;4,5,3;4,3;4,3;4,5,3;4,3;4,3;3,4,6;4,3",["y"]=0.168,["x"]=0.406,["title"]="Harpy Raiders",["lvl"]=18,["item"]=5064,["count"]=8,["quest"]=867,["t"]="collect"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:29",["text"]="Dry Hills",["detail"]="West to the Dry Hills. Any Witchwing harpy drops a talon: keep to the eastern slopes, where the Witchwing Harpies and Roguefeathers (14-15) nest; the Slayers and Windcallers (16-17) hold the western hills. Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between Regthar Deathgate and the hills: take their claws on the way.\nCareful: There are 2 Witchwing Ambushers (level 17-18). They stay stealthed with Sneak while out of combat."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["quest"]=894,["object"]=4141},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:2",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=14,["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["pre"]={894},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=900,["object"]=4141},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:3",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.11599999999999999,["x"]=0.523,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Main Control Valve",["quest"]=900,["object"]=4072},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:4",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.114,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Fuel Control Valve",["quest"]=900,["object"]=61936},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:5",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.114,["x"]=0.523,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Regulator Valve",["quest"]=900,["object"]=61935},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:6",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["quest"]=900,["object"]=4141},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:7",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=14,["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["pre"]={900},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=901,["object"]=4141},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Console Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3471,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:8",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.10400000000000001,["x"]=0.528,["title"]="Samophlange",["from"]="Tinkerer Sniggles",["item"]=5089,["note"]="Inside",["quest"]=901,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:9",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["quest"]=901,["object"]=4141},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Sputtervalve in Ratchet: on the next Ratchet stop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42:10",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=16,["y"]=0.1165,["x"]=0.524,["title"]="Samophlange",["objName"]="Control Console",["pre"]={901},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=902,["object"]=4141}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:42",["text"]="Samophlange",["detail"]="The Control Console stands at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles beside it.\nCareful: Several guards stand within aggro range of the valves, respawn in under about 3 minutes, and run at low health to bring back help; nearby mobs also join if you use a valve while they are close."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:43:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3266,["y"]=0.2457,["x"]=0.5670000000000001,["title"]="The Disruption Ends",["lvl"]=13,["target"]="Razormane Defender",["quest"]=872,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:43:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3269,["y"]=0.24539999999999998,["x"]=0.57,["title"]="The Disruption Ends",["lvl"]=13,["target"]="Razormane Geomancer",["quest"]=872,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3438,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:43:3",["y"]=0.27,["x"]=0.585,["count"]=1,["from"]="Kreenig Snarlsnout",["quest"]=872,["item"]=5063,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="The Disruption Ends"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:31",["text"]="The Disruption Ends",["detail"]="Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them. Careful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near Kreenig Snarlsnout and the supply crates, and Chol'aruk (20, elite) lies in the cave under Thorn Hill beside them: pull Kreenig Snarlsnout and the quilboar away from them one at a time, and leave the cave alone unless you are in a group."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:66",["text"]="Chol'aruk",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chol'aruk (level 20 elite) needs a group of 3 and sits deep in the cave under Thorn Hill, past the Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19, elite). Skip it if you are alone."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3338,["npcName"]="Sergra Darkthorn",["x"]=0.5223,["title"]="Prowlers of the Barrens",["quest"]=903,["y"]=0.31010000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3338,["y"]=0.31010000000000004,["x"]=0.5223,["title"]="Echeyakee",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={903},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=881,["npcName"]="Sergra Darkthorn"},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3390,["npcName"]="Apothecary Helbrim",["x"]=0.5144,["title"]="Fungal Spores",["quest"]=848,["y"]=0.3015},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3429,["npcName"]="Thork",["x"]=0.515,["title"]="The Disruption Ends",["quest"]=872,["y"]=0.30870000000000003},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3449,["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger",["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Harpy Raiders",["quest"]=867,["y"]=0.309},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3449,["y"]=0.309,["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Harpy Lieutenants",["minLevel"]=12,["pre"]={867},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=875,["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger"},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Mankrik: his wife lies at the north edge of the Bristleback camps, later",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3432,["npcName"]="Mankrik",["x"]=0.5195000000000001,["title"]="Lost in Battle",["minLevel"]=14,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=4921,["y"]=0.31579999999999997},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3432,["npcName"]="Mankrik",["x"]=0.5195000000000001,["title"]="Consumed by Hatred",["minLevel"]=14,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=899,["y"]=0.31579999999999997},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:10",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3448,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="The Forgotten Pools",["quest"]=870,["y"]=0.3193},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Tonga Runetotem: the bubbling fissure at the Stagnant Oasis, on the Verog the Dervish pass",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:48:11",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["y"]=0.3193,["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="The Stagnant Oasis",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={870},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=877,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:33",["text"]="The Crossroads",["detail"]="Sergra Darkthorn by the inn first, then Helbrim by the north gate, Thork and Darsok Swiftdagger on the tower platform, Mankrik by the inn, and Tonga Runetotem at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the Verog the Dervish pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills. After the spores Helbrim offers Apothecary Zamah, a delivery to Thunder Bluff within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to Thunder Bluff)."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:67",["text"]="Gur'ak",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Harpy Lieutenant Ring",["item"]=5065,["quest"]=875,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3278,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:35:1",["y"]=0.1597,["x"]=0.4017,["title"]="Harpy Lieutenants",["from"]="Witchwing Slayer",["count"]=6,["lvl"]=17,["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:35",["text"]="Harpy Lieutenants",["detail"]="North-west to the Dry Hills: the Witchwing Slayers hold their western end; they wear the rings.\nCareful: Some stealthed harpy ambushers wait in the area and stay hidden until you get close. A level 19 elite harpy also patrols there."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:51",["text"]="Dry Hills",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Chen's Empty Keg",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3238,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.162,["x"]=0.379,["item"]=4926,["from"]="Chen's Empty Keg",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:51:1"},{["itemName"]="Chen's Empty Keg",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:51:2",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Chen's Empty Keg",["item"]=4926,["minLevel"]=11,["quest"]=819,["qlvl"]=15}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:81:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3682,["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["title"]="Bruised Pride and Lion Hides",["minLevel"]=14,["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=95494,["y"]=0.12210000000000001},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:81:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3682,["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["title"]="Vrang's Game",["minLevel"]=14,["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=95507,["y"]=0.12210000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:81",["text"]="Vrang Wildgore",["detail"]="East from the keg toward Echeyakee: Vrang Wildgore camps below the hills, and his errands lie in the plains beside his camp."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Savannah Lion Hide",["item"]=269715,["quest"]=95494,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3241,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:38:1",["y"]=0.145,["x"]=0.45,["title"]="Bruised Pride and Lion Hides",["from"]="Savannah Patriarch",["count"]=6,["fromAlso"]="Savannah Matriarch",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3416},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Trapped Game",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=640104,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:38:2",["y"]=0.14,["x"]=0.45299999999999996,["count"]=8,["from"]="Sprung Trap",["quest"]=95507,["item"]=269719,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Vrang's Game"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:38",["text"]="Savannah lions",["detail"]="Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of Vrang Wildgore's camp, and the Sprung Traps lie among them."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:83",["text"]="Vrang Wildgore",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:83:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3682,["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["title"]="Bruised Pride and Lion Hides",["quest"]=95494,["y"]=0.12210000000000001},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:83:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3682,["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["title"]="Vrang's Game",["quest"]=95507,["y"]=0.12210000000000001},{["map"]=1413,["preAll"]={95494,95507},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:83:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3682,["y"]=0.12210000000000001,["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["title"]="The Hermit Tanner",["minLevel"]=14,["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=95495,["note"]="Walton, the hermit on the ridge behind Vrang Wildgore: on the next Dry Hills visit, with Serena Bloodfeather"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Horn of Echeyakee",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:53:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.171,["x"]=0.5579999999999999,["title"]="Echeyakee",["quest"]=881,["item"]=10327},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Echeyakee's Hide",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3475,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:53:2",["y"]=0.17190000000000003,["x"]=0.5586,["count"]=1,["from"]="Echeyakee",["quest"]=881,["item"]=5100,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Echeyakee"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:53",["text"]="Echeyakee",["detail"]="South-east on the way back to the Crossroads: Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp.\nCareful: Savannah Huntresses roam around the lair. They respawn quickly and often join the fight alongside Echeyakee, so clear them out before you blow the horn.\nSunscale raptors here count toward the heads."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Raptor Head",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="has",["item"]=5062,["n"]=12}},["item"]=5062,["quest"]=869,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3254,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:41:1",["y"]=0.235,["x"]=0.55,["title"]="Raptor Thieves",["from"]="Sunscale Lashtail",["count"]=12,["fromAlso"]="Sunscale Screecher",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3255}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:41",["text"]="Finish the Raptor Heads",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="has",["item"]=5062,["n"]=12}},["detail"]="Still short of twelve? Sunscale Lashtails and Screechers roam the plains north-east of the Crossroads, on the way back south from Echeyakee's lair."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Raptor Head",["item"]=5062,["quest"]=869,["map"]=1413,["note"]="Sunscale raptors roam the plains north and east of the Crossroads, and about three in four drop a head: kill the ones you pass on the way. Careful: Sunscale Screechers call nearby allies within 30 yd once below 30% health. Collect these while following the outdoor loop; finish before this hand-in.",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3254,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:42:1",["title"]="Raptor Thieves",["y"]=0.33039999999999997,["x"]=0.5293,["count"]=12,["from"]="Sunscale Lashtail",["fromAlso"]="Sunscale Screecher",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3255},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:55:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3464,["npcName"]="Gazrog",["x"]=0.5193,["title"]="Raptor Thieves",["quest"]=869,["y"]=0.3032},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Gazrog: the Stolen 