 north from the Crossroads to Dreadmist Peak and fill the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler at the Dreadmist Peak Pool, then back to Tonga Runetotem in the Crossroads. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi beside him sells Earthroot, three at a time until he restocks."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Kodo Horn",["item"]=15852,["quest"]=6128,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3234,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:63:1",["count"]=5,["y"]=0.40130000000000005,["x"]=0.5482,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["from"]="Lost Barrens Kodo",["fromAlso"]="Barrens Kodo",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3236},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Earthroot",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:80:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.41259999999999997,["x"]=0.6086,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["item"]=2449,["quest"]=6128,["spread"]=true,["count"]=5}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:63",["text"]="Kolkar camp",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Lost Barrens Kodos roam the plains around the Kolkar camp north-west of Regthar Deathgate; herbalists pick Earthroot there too."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Intact Raptor Horn",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:82:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.14300000000000002,["x"]=0.447,["title"]="Raptor Horns",["lvl"]=18,["item"]=5055,["count"]=5,["quest"]=865,["note"]="Raptor Horns, if still open: Sunscale Scytheclaws prowl among the lions below Vrang Wildgore's camp"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Serena's Head",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3452,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:82:4",["y"]=0.1217,["x"]=0.39159999999999995,["count"]=1,["from"]="Serena Bloodfeather",["quest"]=876,["item"]=5067,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Serena Bloodfeather"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:64",["text"]="The Barrens: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="North to the Dry Hills: Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the hills to the west.\nCareful: The route in passes stealthed Harpy Ambushers and an elite harpy that patrols."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:84:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=261366,["npcName"]="Walton",["x"]=0.4202,["title"]="The Hermit Tanner",["quest"]=95495,["y"]=0.11449999999999999},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:84:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261366,["y"]=0.11449999999999999,["x"]=0.4202,["title"]="Trouble in the Valley",["minLevel"]=14,["pre"]={95495},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=95621,["npcName"]="Walton"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:84",["text"]="Walton",["detail"]="Walton, the hermit, stands on the ridge behind Vrang Wildgore's camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Benedict's Orders",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=262119,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:85:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.156,["x"]=0.418,["title"]="Trouble in the Valley",["lvl"]=18,["item"]=270151,["from"]="Corporal Adamore",["quest"]=95621,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:85",["text"]="Trouble in the Valley",["detail"]="Corporal Adamore and his marines hold the wrecked caravan south of Walton. The marines are linked: pulling one calls the rest. Pull from the edge and run; they leash short, so you can thin the camp one at a time before tackling the Corporal."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:86",["text"]="Walton",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:86:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=261366,["npcName"]="Walton",["x"]=0.4202,["title"]="Trouble in the Valley",["quest"]=95621,["y"]=0.11449999999999999},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:86:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261366,["y"]=0.11449999999999999,["x"]=0.4202,["title"]="Unwelcome Guests",["minLevel"]=14,["pre"]={95621},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=95508,["npcName"]="Walton"},{["note"]="Assist Walton: stay by him when Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines come up the ridge",["title"]="Unwelcome Guests",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:86:3",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=95508,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Assist Walton"}}},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:86:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=261366,["npcName"]="Walton",["x"]=0.4202,["title"]="Unwelcome Guests",["quest"]=95508,["y"]=0.11449999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:87:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9316,["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["x"]=0.4905,["title"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["quest"]=3921,["y"]=0.1117},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:87:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9316,["y"]=0.1117,["x"]=0.4905,["title"]="Nugget Slugs",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={3921},["qlvl"]=15,["quest"]=3922,["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:87",["text"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["detail"]="East from Walton toward the Sludge Fen: Wenikee Boltbucket stands at the camp on the road north of the Crossroads."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:88:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3439,["npcName"]="Wizzlecrank's Shredder",["x"]=0.5652,["title"]="Ignition",["minLevel"]=13,["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=858,["y"]=0.0745},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Ignition Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3445,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:88:2",["y"]=0.086,["x"]=0.563,["count"]=1,["from"]="Supervisor Lugwizzle",["quest"]=858,["item"]=5050,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Ignition"},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:88:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3439,["npcName"]="Wizzlecrank's Shredder",["x"]=0.5652,["title"]="Ignition",["quest"]=858,["y"]=0.0745},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:88:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3439,["escort"]=true,["npcName"]="Wizzlecrank's Shredder",["x"]=0.5652,["minLevel"]=13,["title"]="The Escape",["pre"]={858},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=863,["y"]=0.0745}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:88",["text"]="Ignition",["detail"]="Wizzlecrank's Shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp in the Sludge Fen; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=177794,["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["y"]=0.0832,["x"]=0.5667,["item"]=15883,["from"]="Strange Lockbox",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:70:1"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:70",["text"]="Strange Lockbox",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility for Trial of the Sea Lion."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.5539999999999999,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:90:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.077},{["title"]="The Escape",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:90:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=863,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Wizzlecrank out of the Venture Co. drill site"}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:90",["text"]="The Escape",["detail"]="Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet.\nCareful: The route leads west and climbs a ramp. Once you reach the top, two Venture Company mobs ambush you."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Nugget Slug",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=161752,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:91:1",["y"]=0.0799,["x"]=0.555,["count"]=15,["from"]="Tool Bucket",["quest"]=3922,["item"]=11143,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Nugget Slugs"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:91",["text"]="Nugget Slugs",["detail"]="The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Cats Eye Emerald",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:92:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0378,["x"]=0.5963,["title"]="Miner's Fortune",["lvl"]=18,["item"]=5097,["quest"]=896,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:92",["text"]="Boulder Lode Mine",["detail"]="The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:93:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9316,["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["x"]=0.4905,["title"]="Nugget Slugs",["quest"]=3922,["y"]=0.1117},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Keep it: Rilli Greasygob is in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, on the Orgrimmar trip at 20",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:74:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9316,["title"]="Rilli Greasygob",["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["x"]=0.4905,["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=3923,["pre"]={3922},["qlvl"]=18,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["y"]=0.1117}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:74",["text"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["detail"]="West from the mine to Wenikee Boltbucket's camp, then south down the road to the Crossroads."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:94:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3449,["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger",["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Serena Bloodfeather",["quest"]=876,["y"]=0.309},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:94:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3449,["y"]=0.309,["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Letter to Jin'Zil",["minLevel"]=15,["pre"]={876},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1060,["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger"},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3448,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["y"]=0.3193,["quest"]=6128,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}}},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="He gives you the Curative Animal Salve",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["minLevel"]=14,["quest"]=6129,["pre"]={6128},["qlvl"]=14,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["y"]=0.3193}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:75",["text"]="the Crossroads",["detail"]="South down the road to the Crossroads: Darsok Swiftdagger stands on the tower platform, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Verog's Head",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3395,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:95:1",["y"]=0.4174,["x"]=0.5306000000000001,["count"]=1,["from"]="Verog the Dervish",["quest"]=851,["item"]=5023,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Verog the Dervish"},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Underwater",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:49:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.4275,["x"]=0.5561,["title"]="The Stagnant Oasis",["objName"]="Bubbling Fissure",["quest"]=877,["object"]=3737},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Sickly Gazelle: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam the plains all around the Crossroads",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:76:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12296,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["y"]=0.3897,["x"]=0.5693,["count"]=10,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["target"]="Sickly Gazelle",["spread"]=true,["quest"]=6129,["text"]="Cure Sickly Gazelle"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:76",["text"]="Verog the Dervish",["detail"]="Verog the Dervish doesn't wander on his own: he comes out when you kill the Kolkar centaurs at the Stagnant Oasis, south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing them around the oasis until he appears. Test Tonga Runetotem's seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank while you are there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:96:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=10668,["npcName"]="Beaten Corpse",["x"]=0.493,["title"]="Lost in Battle",["quest"]=4921,["y"]=0.503}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:96",["text"]="Bristleback camps",["detail"]="The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Mankrik's wife lies at their north edge, on your way south. Leave the quilboar for now: Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo wants the same camps cleared. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo (level 22), sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest. Leave him alone below level 21."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Mangletooth, in the cage",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:97:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3430,["npcName"]="Mangletooth",["x"]=0.44549999999999995,["title"]="Tribes at War",["minLevel"]=14,["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=878,["y"]=0.5926},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:97:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=10378,["npcName"]="Omusa Thunderhorn",["x"]=0.4445,["location"]="Camp Taurajo",["y"]=0.5915,["node"]=77,["area"]=378},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:97:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3387,["npcName"]="Jorn Skyseer",["x"]=0.4486,["title"]="Jorn Skyseer",["quest"]=3261,["y"]=0.5914},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:97:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3387,["y"]=0.5914,["x"]=0.4486,["title"]="Ishamuhale",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={3261},["qlvl"]=19,["quest"]=882,["npcName"]="Jorn Skyseer"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:97",["text"]="Camp Taurajo",["detail"]="Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:98:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3260,["y"]=0.5526,["x"]=0.4509,["title"]="Tribes at War",["lvl"]=17,["target"]="Bristleback Water Seeker",["count"]=6,["quest"]=878,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:98:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3261,["y"]=0.5162,["x"]=0.4548,["title"]="Tribes at War",["lvl"]=19,["target"]="Bristleback Thornweaver",["count"]=12,["quest"]=878,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:98:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3263,["y"]=0.4817,["x"]=0.43810000000000004,["title"]="Tribes at War",["lvl"]=20,["target"]="Bristleback Geomancer",["count"]=12,["quest"]=878,["spread"]=true},{["itemName"]="Bristleback Quilboar Tusk",["item"]=5085,["quest"]=899,["map"]=1413,["fromId"]=3258,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:98:4",["fromAlso"]="Bristleback Water Seeker",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Consumed by Hatred",["y"]=0.4817,["x"]=0.43810000000000004,["count"]=60,["from"]="Bristleback Hunter",["lvl"]=20,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3260}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:98",["text"]="Bramblescar",["detail"]="Back north into the Bristleback camps. Any Bristleback can drop a tusk for Mankrik, so collect them while you kill these for Mangletooth. Keep one Blood Shard."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:99",["text"]="Camp Taurajo",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:99:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3430,["npcName"]="Mangletooth",["x"]=0.44549999999999995,["title"]="Tribes at War",["quest"]=878,["y"]=0.5926},{["map"]=1413,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:99:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3430,["y"]=0.5926,["x"]=0.44549999999999995,["title"]="Blood Shards of Agamaggan",["minLevel"]=14,["pre"]={878},["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=5052,["npcName"]="Mangletooth"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:100",["text"]="Agama'gor",["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Blood Shard",["item"]=5075,["quest"]=5052,["map"]=1413,["fromId"]=3263,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:100:1",["fromAlso"]="Bristleback Thornweaver",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Blood Shards of Agamaggan",["y"]=0.5526,["x"]=0.4509,["count"]=1,["from"]="Bristleback Geomancer",["lvl"]=20,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=3261},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Hoof of Lakota'mani",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3474,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:100:2",["y"]=0.5274,["x"]=0.45130000000000003,["item"]=5099,["from"]="Lakota'mani",["spread"]=true,["lvl"]=22,["fromKind"]="npc",["optional"]=true},{["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:100:3",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Lakota'mani"