rne Cat Spirit",["y"]=0.7343999999999999,["pre"]={98404},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=98738,["npc"]=272054}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:99",["text"]="The Stormrage Barrow Dens",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["detail"]="Tauren: the Great Cat Spirit waits on the southern hill above the bridge. Skyborne: the Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of the twin bridges. Then the dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue. Careful: the spirits are Territorial Terrans (level 60) that kill whoever they see: stay off their paths, and click the statue again before the stealth runs out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["note"]="Dendrite Starblaze, Nighthaven",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:146:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit",["y"]=0.3064,["quest"]=98739,["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}}},{["map"]=1450,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:146:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["y"]=0.3064,["quest"]=98738,["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}}},{["map"]=1450,["endNpcs"]={3033},["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne","Tauren"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:100:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=160,["qlvl"]=20,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="To Thunder Bluff",["y"]=0.3064,["pre"]={98739,98738},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=98362,["npc"]=11802}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:100",["text"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}