["npc"]=5875,["npcName"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye",["x"]=0.4825,["title"]="The Binding",["quest"]=1513,["y"]=0.45280000000000004}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:21",["text"]="The Binding",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=2478}},["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:20",["text"]="Shenthul",["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE"}},["detail"]="If you did Mission: Possible But Not Probable with a group, Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow takes it now."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:21",["text"]="Zeppelin to Undercity",["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.508,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:21:1",["text"]="Zeppelin to Undercity",["y"]=0.135,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["locations"]={{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.31010000000000004,["y"]=0.6624,["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["npc"]=244808,["npcName"]="Aramis Hammerhand"},{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.6022,["y"]=0.5266,["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["npc"]=246152,["npcName"]="Shari Stilwell"},{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.21960000000000002,["y"]=0.4725,["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["npc"]=246389,["npcName"]="Hilda the Breaker"}},["zone"]=1420,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:24:1",["t"]="train",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:24",["text"]="Brill",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:25",["text"]="Morbin Lightbane",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="For your Ruins of Lordaeron run: the zeppelin lands beside the ruins. Walk into the Undercity through them and down to the Royal Quarter: Morbin Lightbane stands there, near Lady Sylvanas Windrunner."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:26",["text"]="Ruins of Lordaeron",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Ruins of Lordaeron is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 15 to 22, in the ruined city above the Undercity: its portal is in the ruins you walked through.\nInside: every undead can drop Intact Limbs for Morbin Lightbane, so clear as you go. The Baron can drop an Abominable Head, which starts a quest for Master Apothecary Faranell, and a Crest of Lordaeron found inside starts one for Oran Snakewrithe: both are in the Undercity, on this route's next stop there."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:27",["text"]="The Sepulcher",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Out of the ruins, take the road south through Tirisfal into Silverpine Forest and on to the The Sepulcher."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=177844,["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["y"]=0.292,["x"]=0.2956,["item"]=15882,["from"]="Strange Lockbox",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:28:1",["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance, from the Strange Lockbox"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:28",["text"]="Strange Lockbox",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="From the zeppelin towers, run south into Silverpine and west past the Dead Field to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies at the bottom of very deep water there, beside an air fissure where you can breathe. Watch your breath on the way down. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion. Then on to the The Sepulcher."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Apothecary Renferrel: Lydon in Tarren Mill, next guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:24:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1937,["npcName"]="Apothecary Renferrel",["x"]=0.428,["title"]="Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills",["minLevel"]=19,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=493,["y"]=0.4086},{["map"]=1421,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:24:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2121,["y"]=0.4093,["x"]=0.43979999999999997,["title"]="Watching the Roads",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={482},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=95981,["npcName"]="Shadow Priest Allister"},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Shadow Priest Allister: Beren's Peril, south-east of Ambermill",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:24:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2121,["npcName"]="Shadow Priest Allister",["x"]=0.43979999999999997,["title"]="Beren's Peril",["minLevel"]=16,["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=516,["y"]=0.4093},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Shadow Priest Allister: Ambermill's pendants, on the same roads",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:29:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2121,["y"]=0.4093,["x"]=0.43979999999999997,["title"]="Ambermill Investigations",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={482},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=479,["npcName"]="Shadow Priest Allister"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:29",["text"]="The Sepulcher",["detail"]="Down the road through Silverpine to the The Sepulcher: from the zeppelin towers, south through Tirisfal; from the Strange Lockbox, south-east from the coast to the road. Shadow Priest Allister and Apothecary Renferrel stand by the crypt entrance."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6324}}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:25:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6389,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6324}}},["npcName"]="Deathguard Podrig",["x"]=0.43420000000000003,["title"]="Return to Podrig",["quest"]=6324,["y"]=0.4168}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:25",["text"]="Deathguard Podrig",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Deathguard Podrig stands just west of the crypt entrance: hand him Gordon's Crate from the Undercity."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:31",["text"]="High Executor Hadrec",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="For your Shadowfang Keep run, at the end of the Hillsbrad guide: High Executor Hadrec stands below ground in the crypt."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:32:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1889,["y"]=0.4982,["x"]=0.6485,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills",["count"]=8,["target"]="Dalaran Wizard",["quest"]=95981,["spread"]=true,["title"]="Watching the Roads"},{["map"]=1421,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:32:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1888,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills",["y"]=0.5632,["x"]=0.6517000000000001,["title"]="Watching the Roads",["lvl"]=19,["target"]="Dalaran Watcher",["quest"]=95981,["spread"]=true,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Below ground",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:32:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1973,["y"]=0.6988,["x"]=0.5966,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills",["lvl"]=21,["target"]="Ravenclaw Guardian",["count"]=6,["quest"]=516,["title"]="Beren's Peril"},{["map"]=1421,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:32:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1974,["y"]=0.7076,["x"]=0.5964,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills",["lvl"]=20,["target"]="Ravenclaw Drudger",["count"]=6,["quest"]=516,["title"]="Beren's Peril"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:32",["text"]="Silverpine Forest: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="South down the road past Pyrewood: Dalaran Watchers and Wizards patrol the roads around Ambermill, and south-west of the town the Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril in the south-east of the forest. Careful: High Order Mages (30) walk the same roads among the Watchers and Wizards: leave them."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Dalaran Pendant",["fromFaction"]="A",["item"]=3354,["quest"]=479,["map"]=1421,["fromId"]=1912,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:33:1",["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=1914,["title"]="Ambermill Investigations",["y"]=0.6905,["x"]=0.6162,["count"]=8,["lvl"]=15,["from"]="Dalaran Protector",["fromAlso"]="Dalaran Mage",["fromKind"]="npc",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:33",["text"]="Ambermill",["detail"]="On the roads around Ambermill, step into the town's outskirts: Protectors guard them and Mages the town; both drop pendants. Careful: each Mage (15) fights with a Dalaran Serpent (15) beside it: pull one Mage at a time from the outskirts. Stay out of the middle, where Archmage Ataeric (22) stands."},{["goals"]={{["note"]="Note Scrap, from a Ravenclaw Guardian",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27:1",["t"]="accept",["title"]="The Offering Stone",["item"]=271343,["qlvl"]=23,["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=95884,["itemName"]="Note Scrap"},{["map"]=1421,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.698,["x"]=0.581,["title"]="The Offering Stone",["objName"]="Offering Stone",["quest"]=95884,["object"]=645153},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="the Offering Stone offers The Tortured Soul once the Note Scrap is in; below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27:3",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=23,["y"]=0.6977,["x"]=0.5811999999999999,["title"]="The Tortured Soul",["objName"]="Offering Stone",["pre"]={95884},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=95883,["object"]=645153},{["itemName"]="Tortured Soul",["item"]=271350,["quest"]=95883,["map"]=1421,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1973,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27:4",["y"]=0.6990000000000001,["x"]=0.581,["title"]="The Tortured Soul",["from"]="Ravenclaw Guardian",["count"]=1,["note"]="Tortured Soul, from the Tortured Souls among the ruins; below ground",["fromKind"]="npc",["lvl"]=21},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27:5",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6977,["x"]=0.5811999999999999,["title"]="The Tortured Soul",["objName"]="Offering Stone",["quest"]=95883,["object"]=645153}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:27",["text"]="Beren's Peril",["detail"]="The Ravenclaw undead haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril, east of the road in the south-east of the forest; a Ravenclaw Guardian drops the Note Scrap that leads to the Offering Stone.\nAn elite spirit (20) often stands beside the Offering Stone: pull the Ravenclaws away from the stone before you fight them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["x"]=0.581,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:35:1",["text"]="Offering Stone",["y"]=0.698,["t"]="goto"},{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Tortured Soul",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:35:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.698,["x"]=0.581,["item"]=210713,["optional"]=true,["note"]="Tortured Soul, beside the Offering Stone: summons the elite spirit"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:35",["text"]="The Offering of Blood",["detail"]="The quest hands you a Tortured Soul: use it beside the Offering Stone to offer your blood, then kill the elite spirit that answers.\nThe Tortured Soul is elite: grouping up is advised."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:29",["text"]="Into Hillsbrad",["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["x"]=0.20800000000000002,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:29:1",["text"]="The road east to Southpoint Tower",["y"]=0.474,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Deathstalker Lesh: Darthalia in Tarren Mill",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:30:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2214,["npcName"]="Deathstalker Lesh",["x"]=0.2079,["title"]="Time To Strike",["minLevel"]=19,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=494,["y"]=0.474}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:30",["text"]="Southpoint Tower",["detail"]="Back on the road south. Where it turns east into Hillsbrad, Deathstalker Lesh waits at Southpoint Tower."}},["max"]=23,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=22,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Ashenvale & Silverpine Forest (solo 22-23)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Ashenvale",["faction"]="Horde",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills"} end},
