ter, just past the Apothecarium."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:step:21",["text"]="Oran Snakewrithe",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Crest of Lordaeron from your Ruins of Lordaeron run: Oran Snakewrithe takes it."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:24",["text"]="Archibald",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:25",["text"]="Archibald",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:26",["text"]="Archibald",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:27",["text"]="Archibald",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:28",["text"]="Archibald",["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE"}},["detail"]="While you're here: learn Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Pendant of the Sea Lion",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["item"]=15885,["quest"]=30,["map"]=1450,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=15885,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4142,["x"]=0.36,["title"]="Trial of the Sea Lion",["from"]="Shrine Of Remulos",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:29:1",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Pendant of the Sea Lion: use a half at the Shrine of Remulos"},{["map"]=1450,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:29:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}},["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Trial of the Sea Lion",["quest"]=30,["y"]=0.3064}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:step:27",["text"]="Trial of the Sea Lion",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=30},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:30:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=30},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}},["y"]=0.3064,["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Aquatic Form",["minLevel"]=16,["pre"]={30},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=31,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze"},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=30},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}},["note"]="Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:30:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638},{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:30:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3033,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=30},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}},["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Aquatic Form",["quest"]=31,["y"]=0.2722}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:step:28",["text"]="Aquatic Form",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Take Aquatic Form from Dendrite Starblaze, who stands upstairs in his building. Then Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}},["goals"]={{["class"]=true,["locations"]={{["map"]=1456,["x"]=0.7648,["y"]=0.2722,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem"}},["zone"]=1456,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:31:1",["t"]="train",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}}},{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Apothecary Zamah, Pools of Vision",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:29:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3419,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}},["npcName"]="Apothecary Zamah",["x"]=0.2281,["title"]="Return to Thunder Bluff",["quest"]=1067,["y"]=0.2089},{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Apothecary Zamah: the Toxic Fogger, for Windshear Crag in the next guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:29:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3419,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}},["y"]=0.2089,["x"]=0.2281,["title"]="The Flying Machine Airport",["minLevel"]=13,["pre"]={1067},["qlvl"]=23,["quest"]=1086,["npcName"]="Apothecary Zamah"},{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Tah Winterhoof: Pigments for Paints, the Mirkweed in Mirkfallon Lake by Sun Rock",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:31:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3024,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}},["npcName"]="Tah Winterhoof",["x"]=0.5414,["title"]="Pigments for Paints",["minLevel"]=20,["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=97538,["y"]=0.4705},{["map"]=1456,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:31:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4721,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}},["npcName"]="Zangen Stonehoof",["x"]=0.5497,["title"]="The Sacred Flame",["minLevel"]=20,["y"]=0.5141,["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=1195,["note"]="Zangen Stonehoof: The Sacred Flame, the phial from Ashenvale's Laughing Sisters"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:31:4",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Crossroads",["t"]="fly",["node"]=25,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="zone",["name"]="Thunder Bluff",["area"]=1638}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:step:29",["text"]="Back to the Crossroads",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Train with Turak Runetotem. Apothecary Zamah, in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise, takes Lydon's toxin if you carry it. Before you fly on, Tah Winterhoof and Zangen Stonehoof, a short walk east of the wind rider master, give two quests worked on the next guides' walks; then fly on to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.607,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:32:1",["text"]="Zeppelin to Orgrimmar",["y"]=0.589,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:32",["text"]="Zeppelin to Orgrimmar",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.515,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:33:1",["text"]="The middle of Orgrimmar",["y"]=0.456,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:33",["text"]="Orgrimmar",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=31}}},{["goals"]={{["locations"]={{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.38799999999999996,["y"]=0.36369999999999997,["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["npc"]=3344,["npcName"]="Kardris Dreamseeker"},{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.6724,["y"]=0.20199999999999999,["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["npc"]=3406,["npcName"]="Xor'juul"}},["zone"]=1454,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:34:1",["t"]="train",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills:34",["text"]="Orgrimmar",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER","SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Train before you fly on: the next guide flies from here."}},["max"]=25,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=22,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Hillsbrad Foothills (solo 22-25)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Hillsbrad Foothills",["faction"]="Horde",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/horde/04-the-barrens"} end},
{id="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale",faction="Horde",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=1440,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.515,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:1:1",["text"]="Crossroads flight master",["y"]=0.304,["t"]="goto"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:1:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Zoram'gar Outpost",["t"]="fly",["node"]=58,["area"]=2897}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:1",["text"]="Fly to Zoram'gar Outpost",["detail"]="East along the road from Seereth's camp to the Crossroads' wind rider master, and fly to Zoram'gar Outpost. If your hearthstone is ready, hearth to Camp Taurajo and fly from there instead."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:3",["text"]="Zoram'gar Outpost",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Je'neu Sancrea, Karang Amakkar and Mitsuwa stand in the outpost."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:4",["text"]="Je'neu Sancrea",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="For your Blackfathom Deeps run, in the same tunnels as the Sapphires: Je'neu Sancrea's ruins errand. Look for a group now if you have none yet."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["x"]=0.145,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:4:1",["text"]="Blackfathom Deeps ruins",["y"]=0.142,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:4",["text"]="Blackfathom Deeps ruins",["detail"]="The way to the Sapphires is through the sunken ruins at the north end of the strand: go down the stairs into the pit."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:36",["text"]="Sapphires of Aku'Mai",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Sapphires are blue crystals on the walls of the tunnels leading to the Blackfathom Deeps portal, underground and outside the instance: swim down from the pit, under the wall, into the cave. The satyrs and naga in the tunnels are elite: grouping up is advised. The crystals respawn quickly, so there is no need to go deep."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:37",["text"]="Blackfathom Deeps",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Blackfathom Deeps is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 22 to 30, and a full run takes about an hour. Its portal is a little further along the tunnels you are in, past the Sapphires.\nInside: the Fathom Stone lies under the water of the Moonshrine Ruins' pool, beneath the walkway (clear the crabs first): open it for the Fathom Core, and Baron Aquanis comes; open the Strange Water Globe he drops for a quest for Je'neu Sancrea. The Tide Priestesses sometimes drop a Damp Note: open it for another quest for Je'neu Sancrea. Argent Guard Thaelrid, by a campfire in an underwater side room off Ghamoo-ra's room, offers Blackfathom Villainy (Twilight Lord Kelris' head, for Bashana Runetotem on Thunder Bluff's Elder Rise)."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:38",["text"]="Thistlefur Village",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold.\nCareful: A Shaman at 15% health or lower runs off to find help, which can pull extra furbolgs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Ruul Snowhoof, below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:8:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12818,["npcName"]="Ruul Snowhoof",["x"]=0.4153,["escort"]=true,["minLevel"]=19,["y"]=0.34490000000000004,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=6482,["title"]="Freedom to Ruul"},{["title"]="Freedom to Ruul",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:8:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=6482,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Ruul from the Thistlefurs."}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:8",["text"]="Thistlefur Hold",["detail"]="Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run.\nCareful: Two scripted ambushes occur, each made up of three Thistlefurs (a Shaman, a Pathfinder and an Avenger, Ursa or Den Watcher): the first when you come back to the tunnel's fork inside the cave, the second just beyond the gate where Dal Bloodclaw roams."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:64",["text"]="Zoram'gar Outpost",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Back west to Zoram'gar from Thistlefur before heading east for good."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:65",["text"]="Je'neu Sancrea",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:68",["text"]="Je'neu Sancrea",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:73",["text"]="Je'neu Sancrea",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Je'neu Sancrea then offers the next part, Allegiance to the Old Gods: it is for a second run, so leave it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Filled Blue Waterskin",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=107047,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:6:1",["y"]=0.6747,["x"]=0.33549999999999996,["count"]=1,["from"]="Ruins of Stardust Fountain",["quest"]=1534,["item"]=7770,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Call of Water"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:6",["text"]="Ruins of Stardust fountain",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust, where Ursangous roams: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Ursangous's Paw",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=12678,["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["y"]=0.6520999999999999,["x"]=0.39759999999999995,["item"]=16303,["from"]="Ursangous",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:14:1",["lvl"]=25,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromFaction"]="A"},{["itemName"]="Ursangous's Paw",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:7:2",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["title"]="Ursangous's Paw",["item"]=16303,["pre"]={6383},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=23,["qlvl"]=24}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:14",["text"]="Ursangous",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["detail"]="Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:15",["text"]="King of the Foulweald",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:10:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12858,["npcName"]="Torek",["x"]=0.6834,["escort"]=true,["minLevel"]=20,["y"]=0.753,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=6544,["title"]="Torek's Assault"},{["title"]="Torek's Assault",["escort"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:10:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=6544,["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Take Silverwing Outpost."}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:10",["text"]="Torek's Assault",["detail"]="Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:17:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12867,["npcName"]="Kuray'bin",["x"]=0.7111,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["minLevel"]=19,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=6503,["y"]=0.6812}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:17",["text"]="Warsong lumber camp",["detail"]="From the Silverwing Outpost head north-east to the Warsong lumber camp on the road: Kuray'bin stands there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:18:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12856,["y"]=0.695,["x"]=0.725,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Ashenvale Outrunner",["quest"]=6503,["count"]=9}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:18",["text"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["detail"]="The night elf Ashenvale Outrunners (23-24) stalk the woods south and south-east of the lumber camp; they stealth, so watch for them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12867,["npcName"]="Kuray'bin",["x"]=0.7111,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["quest"]=6503,["y"]=0.6812}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:19",["text"]="Warsong lumber camp",["detail"]="Back to Kuray'bin at the lumber camp, on the road north to Splintertree."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:12",["text"]="Splintertree Post",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12877,["npcName"]="Ertog Ragetusk",["x"]=0.7303000000000001,["title"]="Torek's Assault",["quest"]=6544,["y"]=0.6247},{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:12:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12724,["npcName"]="Pixel",["x"]=0.7306,["title"]="Satyr Horns",["minLevel"]=21,["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=6441,["y"]=0.6148}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12696,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["y"]=0.6146,["x"]=0.7378,["title"]="The Ashenvale Hunt",["minLevel"]=20,["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=6383,["npcName"]="Senani Thunderheart"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:21",["text"]="Senani Thunderheart",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["detail"]="Senani Thunderheart keeps the hunt board at Night Run, by the flight master: take The Ashenvale Hunt and hand it straight back. Ursangous, Sharptalon and Shadumbra drop their trophies only after it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12696,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={23}}},["npcName"]="Senani Thunderheart",["x"]=0.7378,["title"]="Ursangous's Paw",["quest"]=23,["y"]=0.6146}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:14",["text"]="Splintertree Post",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={23}}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:23",["text"]="Splintertree Post",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:15:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12737,["npcName"]="Mastok Wrilehiss",["x"]=0.7367,["title"]="Stonetalon Standstill",