/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:18",["text"]="Fly to Tarren Mill",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK","DRUID"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Dangerous!, the poster by the inn",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:18:1",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.1966,["x"]=0.6256,["title"]="Dangerous!",["objName"]="Dangerous!",["object"]=2008,["minLevel"]=19,["quest"]=567,["qlvl"]=28},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Apothecary Lydon, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:18:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2216,["npcName"]="Apothecary Lydon",["x"]=0.6144,["title"]="Elixir of Agony",["minLevel"]=24,["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=509,["y"]=0.1906},{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Soothing Spices",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:18:3",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=2393,["npcName"]="Christoph Jeffcoat",["x"]=0.6229,["item"]=3713,["y"]=0.19039999999999999,["note"]="Soothing Spices, from Christoph Jeffcoat"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:18",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["detail"]="The Dangerous! poster hangs by the inn; Apothecary Lydon stands inside it. Christoph Jeffcoat, the cook by the inn, wants turtle meat and sells the spices for it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:19:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2215,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["minLevel"]=19,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=527,["y"]=0.2045}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:19",["text"]="High Executor Darthalia",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["detail"]="You missed Darthalia's first errands, from the 22-25 Hillsbrad guide: they come first now. They are a few levels below you and quick, and they open the rest of the Battle of Hillsbrad in this guide."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Krusk, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:20:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2229,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["npcName"]="Krusk",["x"]=0.6324000000000001,["title"]="The Rescue",["minLevel"]=17,["qlvl"]=22,["quest"]=498,["y"]=0.2066}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:20",["text"]="Krusk",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["detail"]="Krusk wants his two scouts freed from Durnholde Keep."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:21:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2266,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.39770000000000005,["x"]=0.3638,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Hillsbrad Farmer",["quest"]=527,["count"]=6},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:21:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2360,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.3958,["x"]=0.3682,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=23,["target"]="Hillsbrad Farmhand",["quest"]=527,["count"]=6},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:21:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=232,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.34759999999999996,["x"]=0.3322,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["target"]="Farmer Ray",["quest"]=527,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=4,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:21:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2403,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.38,["x"]=0.35200000000000004,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Farmer Getz",["quest"]=527,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:21",["text"]="Hillsbrad Fields",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["detail"]="West past the hills to the farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere.\nCareful: Kirin Tor Guards (55) patrol Hillsbrad's fields and roads and attack the Horde: keep an eye out for them and stay out of their way."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:22:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["quest"]=527,["y"]=0.2045},{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:22:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2215,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.2045,["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["minLevel"]=19,["pre"]={527},["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=528,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:22",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["detail"]="Back east to Tarren Mill."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:23:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2267,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["y"]=0.4201,["x"]=0.35409999999999997,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Hillsbrad Peasant",["quest"]=528,["count"]=15}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:23",["text"]="Hillsbrad Peasants",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["detail"]="Back to the fields: the Peasants work south of the farmhouses. Careful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back adds; snares or roots keep them from escaping."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:24:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}},["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["quest"]=528,["y"]=0.2045}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:24",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=528}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:25:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2215,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["y"]=0.2045,["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["minLevel"]=19,["pre"]={528},["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=529,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:25",["text"]="High Executor Darthalia",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Drull's ball and chain",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:26:1",["t"]="interact",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["y"]=0.415,["x"]=0.7533,["title"]="The Rescue",["objName"]="Locked ball and chain",["quest"]=498,["object"]=1721},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Tog'thar's ball and chain",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:26:2",["t"]="interact",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["y"]=0.39649999999999996,["x"]=0.7979,["title"]="The Rescue",["objName"]="Locked ball and chain",["quest"]=498,["object"]=1722}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:26",["text"]="Durnholde Keep",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["detail"]="South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and Tog'thar are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings: Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key and Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key, both in the keep. Kill them, then open both locks."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Krusk, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2229,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["npcName"]="Krusk",["x"]=0.6324000000000001,["title"]="The Rescue",["quest"]=498,["y"]=0.2066}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:27",["text"]="Krusk",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=498}},["detail"]="Back to Tarren Mill."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:37",["text"]="The river south of Tarren Mill: kill these as you meet them",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="South from Tarren Mill along the river: Snapjaws (29) sun themselves on its banks all the way down to the hills above Southshore. Some of them carry Turtle Meat."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Mudsnout Blossoms",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1723,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:29:1",["y"]=0.614,["x"]=0.642,["count"]=6,["from"]="Mudsnout Blossom",["quest"]=509,["item"]=3502,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Elixir of Agony"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:29",["text"]="Mudsnout Blossoms",["detail"]="South of the river's bend, the Mudsnout gnolls (26-28) camp in the hills above Dun Garok; the blossoms grow among their tents. The Shamans heal and call their friends: pull them first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["x"]=0.6,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:30:1",["text"]="North of Southshore",["y"]=0.42,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:30",["text"]="North of Southshore",["detail"]="From the blossoms, back north along the river and then west to Hillsbrad town, well north of Southshore (its guards are 55)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:31:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2404,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["y"]=0.44420000000000004,["x"]=0.3211,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["target"]="Blacksmith Verringtan",["quest"]=529,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:31:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2265,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["y"]=0.4448,["x"]=0.3161,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Hillsbrad Apprentice Blacksmith",["quest"]=529,["count"]=4},{["itemName"]="Shipment of Iron",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["item"]=3564,["quest"]=529,["map"]=1424,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1736,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4545,["x"]=0.3201,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["from"]="Shipment of Iron",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:31:3",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Inside"},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Citizen Wilkes, on the west side of the town",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:31:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2449,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["y"]=0.405,["x"]=0.306,["title"]="Dangerous!",["target"]="Citizen Wilkes",["quest"]=567,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=4,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:31:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2451,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["y"]=0.4657,["x"]=0.3588,["title"]="Dangerous!",["target"]="Farmer Kalaba",["quest"]=567,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:31",["text"]="The smithy",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=529}},["detail"]="West across the foothills to Hillsbrad town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the west side of the town; Farmer Kalaba works the field south-east of the town."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:32:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["quest"]=529,["y"]=0.2045},{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:19:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2215,["y"]=0.2045,["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["minLevel"]=19,["pre"]={529},["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=532,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia"},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Apothecary Lydon, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:32:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2216,["npcName"]="Apothecary Lydon",["x"]=0.6144,["title"]="Elixir of Agony",["quest"]=509,["y"]=0.1906},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="for Master Apothecary Faranell, on the Undercity stop at the end of this guide",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:32:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2216,["y"]=0.1906,["x"]=0.6144,["title"]="Elixir of Agony",["minLevel"]=24,["pre"]={509},["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=513,["npcName"]="Apothecary Lydon"},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Novice Thaivand, in the town: Helcular's Rod, from the yetis on the way to the town hall",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:19:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2429,["npcName"]="Novice Thaivand",["x"]=0.6388,["title"]="Helcular's Revenge",["minLevel"]=29,["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=552,["y"]=0.1966}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:32",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["detail"]="Back east to Tarren Mill."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Helcular's Rod",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:33:1",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,2;3",["y"]=0.294,["x"]=0.445,["title"]="Helcular's Revenge",["lvl"]=32,["item"]=3708,["count"]=1,["quest"]=552,["t"]="collect"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:33",["text"]="Helcular's Rod",["detail"]="West of Tarren Mill, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the Foothill Caverns in the hills; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but they hit hard and come in pairs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2387,["y"]=0.4243,["x"]=0.3206,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=26,["target"]="Hillsbrad Councilman",["quest"]=532,["count"]=5},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Hillsbrad Proclamation, inside",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25:2",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.4175,["x"]=0.2973,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["objName"]="Hillsbrad Proclamation",["quest"]=532,["object"]=1761},{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Hillsbrad Town Registry",["oi"]=4,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1759,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25:3",["quest"]=532,["y"]=0.4153,["x"]=0.2952,["item"]=3657,["from"]="Hillsbrad Town Registry",["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["note"]="Inside"},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Inside",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2448,["y"]=0.4241,["x"]=0.29510000000000003,["title"]="Dangerous!",["target"]="Clerk Horrace Whitesteed",["quest"]=567,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Inside",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2335,["y"]=0.4164,["x"]=0.2967,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["target"]="Magistrate Burnside",["quest"]=532,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:25",["text"]="Town hall",["detail"]="On to Hillsbrad town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:26:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["quest"]=532,["y"]=0.2045},{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:26:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2215,["y"]=0.2045,["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["minLevel"]=19,["pre"]={532},["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=539,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia"},{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:26:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2429,["npcName"]="Novice Thaivand",["x"]=0.6388,["title"]="Helcular's Revenge",["quest"]=552,["y"]=0.1966},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:35:4",["text"]="Thaivand's next errand, the flames, sends you among the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) and to Helcular's grave inside Southshore: leave it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:35",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["detail"]="Back east to Tarren Mill."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:38",["text"]="Melisara",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="For your City of Dalaran run, later in this guide: Melisara stands in Tarren Mill, a short walk east of Magus Wordeen Voidglare."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:39",["text"]="City of Dalaran",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The City of Dalaran is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 28 to 33, under the violet dome. Without the Dalaran Sewer Key, go in through the sewer pipe north-west of the crater: the arrow leads there.\nInside: Atrexis the Grave Knight is Melisara's. Rexxie Copperclutch, in the sewer, gives Opportunistic Education and takes it back there."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:31",["text"]="Hillsbrad Foothills",["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["x"]=0.285,["y"]=0.55,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:31:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Azurelode Mine",["area"]=288}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:32:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2269,["y"]=0.5479999999999999,["x"]=0.28300000000000003,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["lvl"]=27,["target"]="Hillsbrad Miner",["quest"]=539,["count"]=10},{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:32:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2450,["y"]=0.527,["x"]=0.318,["title"]="Dangerous!",["target"]="Miner Hackett",["quest"]=567,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Inside Azurelode Mine",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:32:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2305,["y"]=0.5600999999999999,["x"]=0.3121,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["target"]="Foreman Bonds",["quest"]=539,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:32",["text"]="Azurelode Mine",["detail"]="Head south-west past Hillsbrad town to the Azurelode Mine. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["x"]=0.295,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:40:1",["text"]="Torn Fin murlocs",["y"]=0.715,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}}},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="grind on Torn Fin Coastrunner",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:40:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["npcName"]="Torn Fin Coastrunner",["x"]=0.298,["lvl"]=30,["level"]=30,["y"]=0.7277,["grind"]=2375}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:40",["text"]="Level 30",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["detail"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare's quests on the next Tarren Mill stop and Alliance Relations in Orgrimmar, the next guide's first stop, are offered from level 30. Short of 30? The Torn Fin Muckdwellers and Coastrunners (28-30) crowd the coast south of the Azurelode Mine, a short walk: kill them until level 30. Their Oracles (30-31) cast from the shore further east."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={7321}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="has",["item"]=3712,["n"]=10}},["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["superseded"]=true,["text"]="Finish the Turtle Meat",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:41",["detail"]="Still short of ten Turtle Meat? The Snapjaws line the river east of Tarren Mill, on your way back from the mine."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="High Executor Darthalia: her next Battle of Hillsbrad, and Deathguard Humbert's sword, are elite group quests at Dun Garok: take them only with a group",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:36:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Battle of Hillsbrad",["quest"]=539,["y"]=0.2045},{["map"]=1424,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:36:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2215,["npcName"]="High Executor Darthalia",["x"]=0.6233,["title"]="Dangerous!",["quest"]=567,["y"]=0.2045},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Krusk, inside: Infiltration, worked on the 38-39 visit (its Syndicate are 32-35)",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:19:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2229,["y"]=0.2066,["x"]=0.6324000000000001,["title"]="Infiltration",["minLevel"]=29,["pre"]={498},["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=533,["npcName"]="Krusk"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:42:4",["text"]="Keep Infiltration in your log: its Syndicate (32-35) are over you now, and the 38-39 guide (Alterac and Arathi) works it on its first Tarren Mill loop.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:42",["text"]="Tarren Mill",["detail"]="North-east back to Tarren Mill, passing well north of Southshore (its guards are 55)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside: Prison Break In, for the 38-39 visit (the Dalaran crater's traitors are 33-35)",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:43:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2410,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["npcName"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare",["x"]=0.616,["title"]="Prison Break In",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=544,["y"]=0.20850000000000002},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare: Key to the City, with Prison Break In on the 38-39 visit",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:43:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2410,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["npcName"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare",["x"]=0.616,["title"]="Key to the City",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=93680,["y"]=0.20850000000000002},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Keeper Bel'varil, inside: Stone Tokens, with the crater on the 38-39 visit",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:43:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2437,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["npcName"]="Keeper Bel'varil",["x"]=0.615,["title"]="Stone Tokens",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=556,["y"]=0.20929999999999999},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Tallow, outside the inn: the Boulderfist ogres (32-34) on the 38-39 Arathi visit",["endNpcs"]={2771},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:43:4",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=2550,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["npcName"]="Tallow",["x"]=0.6187,["qlvl"]=32,["minLevel"]=30,["y"]=0.1957,["title"]="The Hammer May Fall",["quest"]=676,["npc"]=2770},{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:goal:43:5",["text"]="Keep these in your log: their camps are two to four levels over you now, and the 38-39 guide works them on its first Tarren Mill loop and in Hammerfall.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:43",["text"]="Voidglare, Bel'varil and Tallow",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=30}},["detail"]="Magus Wordeen Voidglare and Keeper Bel'varil are inside the inn, Tallow just outside it. Their quests are offered from level 30; below it, the 38-39 guide's first Tarren Mill stop takes them."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:44",["text"]="Melisara",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The Grave Knight from your City of Dalaran run: Melisara, a short walk east of Magus Wordeen Voidglare."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills:step:45",["text"]="Battle of Hillsbrad with a group",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Darthalia's last battle is at Dun Garok, the dwarven keep south-east of Southshore: every dwarf there is elite (28-32), Captain Ironhill too. Great XP if you have a group for it."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbr