r",["x"]=0.5383,["map"]=2521,["npc"]=265756,["y"]=0.8133}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:31",["text"]="Back to Hammerfall",["detail"]="Back north-east to Hammerfall."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:28",["text"]="Boulderfist quests for a group",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Drum Fel's next Call to Arms and Korin Fel's The Real Threat are the elite ogres (38-40) in Stromgarde's ogre quarter, on the same group trip as the Sigil."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:33",["text"]="The Stone of Outer Binding",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Head west; the outer circle stands in the middle of the highlands."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:34",["text"]="Circle of West Binding",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The western circle is near Thoradin's Wall, north-west of the outer one."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:31:2",["text"]="The stone's next task needs Fozruk, a level 42 elite who roams west of Hammerfall: leave it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:35",["text"]="The Stone of Inner Binding",["detail"]="The inner circle lies south of the western circle, east of Stromgarde."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={639,679,680}}},["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["superseded"]=true,["text"]="Stromgarde",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:36",["detail"]="West of the inner circle, Stromgarde's ruins: the Syndicate hold the east half (the Sigil drops from their Conjurors, Prowlers and Magi), the Boulderfist the west half by the Tower of Arathor (Or'Kalar waits in one of the roofless houses beside it)."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:37",["text"]="Faldir's Cove",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Head south to the goblins' cove on the southern coast. Lolo the Lookout keeps watch on the cliff above it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["x"]=0.33899999999999997,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:34:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.8059999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:38",["text"]="Professor Phizzlethorpe",["detail"]="Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:39",["text"]="Doctor Draxlegauge",["superseded"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:40",["text"]="The Drowned Reef: kill these as you meet them",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:41",["text"]="Faldir's Cove",["goals"]={{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:37:7",["text"]="The next guide crosses the Thandol Span into the Wetlands and heads for the Badlands.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={639,679,680}}},["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["superseded"]=true,["text"]="Back to Hammerfall",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:42",["detail"]="Only if you ran Stromgarde with a group: back to Hammerfall for its hand-ins, then on to the Thandol Span."}},["max"]=39,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=37,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Alterac Mountains & Arathi Highlands (solo 37-39)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Arathi Highlands",["faction"]="Horde",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands"} end},
{id="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands",faction="Horde",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=1418,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["x"]=0.423,["y"]=0.528,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:1:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Valley of Fangs",["area"]=1877}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:1",["text"]="Into the Badlands",["detail"]="Head for the Thandol Span, the great bridge at Arathi's southern edge, cross it and follow the road south through the Wetlands to the Dun Algaz tunnel into Loch Modan. Thelsamar, the dwarf town on the road in the middle of Loch Modan, has guards who attack the Horde: leave the road before it and pass the town on the hills to its west. The road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands; follow it to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:2",["text"]="Valley of Fangs",["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["note"]="Martek the Exiled: Fizzle's letter from the Shimmering Flats",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4618,["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled",["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="Martek the Exiled",["quest"]=1106,["y"]=0.5268999999999999},{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4618,["y"]=0.5268999999999999,["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="Indurium",["minLevel"]=28,["pre"]={1106},["qlvl"]=39,["quest"]=1108,["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled"},{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2817,["npcName"]="Rigglefuzz",["x"]=0.4239,["title"]="Barbecued Buzzard Wings",["minLevel"]=33,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=703,["y"]=0.5293}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,[