ake the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Small Stone Shard",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2735,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:5:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.392,["x"]=0.13140000000000002,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["lvl"]=39,["item"]=4626,["from"]="Lesser Rock Elemental",["quest"]=710,["count"]=10},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Rock Elemental Shard",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:goal:5:2",["t"]="collect",["item"]=7848,["y"]=0.392,["x"]=0.13140000000000002,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["lvl"]=40,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="4,1;1;1;6;4;4;4;4;3;2,5;2;2,5;2,5;2;2,5;4",["quest"]=2258,["count"]=5}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:5",["text"]="Lesser Rock Elementals",["detail"]="The small elementals drift across the flats between Kargath and Lotwil Veriatus's camp, on the road back east. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop Jarkal Mossmeld's Rock Elemental Shards."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:6",["text"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2921,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["quest"]=710,["y"]=0.4487},{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2921,["y"]=0.4487,["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["minLevel"]=35,["pre"]={710},["qlvl"]=39,["quest"]=711,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Coyote Jawbone",["item"]=6166,["quest"]=1419,["map"]=1418,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2727,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:goal:7:1",["count"]=30,["y"]=0.47600000000000003,["x"]=0.2825,["title"]="Coyote Thieves",["from"]="Crag Coyote",["fromAlso"]="Feral Crag Coyote",["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=2728},{["itemName"]="Crag Coyote Fang",["item"]=7846,["quest"]=2258,["map"]=1418,["fromId"]=2727,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:7:2",["fromAlso"]="Feral Crag Coyote",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["y"]=0.47600000000000003,["x"]=0.2825,["count"]=10,["from"]="Crag Coyote",["lvl"]=40,["spread"]=true,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=2728},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Buzzard Gizzard",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:7:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5981000000000001,["x"]=0.3342,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["lvl"]=41,["item"]=7847,["quest"]=2258,["spread"]=true,["count"]=5}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:7",["text"]="Badlands: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the The Dustbowl. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; the Giant Buzzards drop the gizzards. Careful: Malevolent Mirages (42, elite) drift across the Badlands: give them a wide berth.\nCareful: the Giant Buzzards are 39-41, and the 41s are two over you at 39: pick the 39s and 40s and pull them one at a time. The Buzzards (37) you kill later for Rigglefuzz's wings drop gizzards too, more rarely."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Large Stone Slab",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=92,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:8:1",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.7709999999999999,["x"]=0.40399999999999997,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["lvl"]=40,["item"]=4627,["from"]="Rock Elemental",["quest"]=711,["count"]=3},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Rock Elemental Shard",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:goal:8:2",["t"]="collect",["item"]=7848,["y"]=0.7576,["x"]=0.4044,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["lvl"]=40,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;1;1;4;3;3;3,5;2;2;6;1,2;1;3,5;3,5;3,5",["quest"]=2258,["count"]=5}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:8",["text"]="Rock Elementals",["detail"]="South-east across the basin, the bigger Rock Elementals (39) stand on the slopes west of Agmond's End; each one drops a slab. Every rock elemental can drop Jarkal Mossmeld's Rock Elemental Shards. Careful: Malevolent Mirages (42, elite) drift across these slopes too."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:9",["text"]="Agmond's End",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at Agmond's End, just east of the elementals. His tablet lies just inside Uldaman's cave mouth, beside level 38 elites: a quest for a group."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Indurium Flake",["item"]=5797,["quest"]=1108,["map"]=1418,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=2893,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:10:1",["count"]=10,["y"]=0.7165,["x"]=0.5118,["title"]="Indurium",["lvl"]=41,["fromAlso"]="Stonevault Shaman",["from"]="Stonevault Bonesnapper",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=2894},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Buzzard Wing",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.7787000000000001,["x"]=0.5013000000000001,["title"]="Barbecued Buzzard Wings",["item"]=3404,["quest"]=703,["spread"]=true,["count"]=4}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:10",["text"]="Stonevault troggs",["detail"]="The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the Valley of Fangs, on the way north from Agmond's End; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes. The Buzzards for Rigglefuzz's wings circle the hills between the Valley of Fangs and Agmond's End."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2817,["npcName"]="Rigglefuzz",["x"]=0.4239,["title"]="Barbecued Buzzard Wings",["quest"]=703,["y"]=0.5293},{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4618,["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled",["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="Indurium",["quest"]=1108,["y"]=0.5268999999999999},{["map"]=1418,["note"]="for Fizzle at the Mirage Raceway, on the way from Freewind Post to Tanaris around level 43",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4618,["y"]=0.5268999999999999,["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="News for Fizzle",["minLevel"]=28,["pre"]={1108},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=1137,["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:11",["text"]="Valley of Fangs",["detail"]="The road north to Uldaman runs through the Valley of Fangs: Rigglefuzz and Martek the Exiled take the wings and the flakes on the way."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:12",["text"]="Ancient Chest",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Keep north on the road to Uldaman's entrance, in the north of the Badlands: the chest lies just inside the cave mouth. Magregan Deepshadow and the Obsidian Golems (38) stand beside it and Shadowforge Diggers (35-36) work the tunnel, all elite: keep your group together."},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:13",["text"]="Agmond's End",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Head back south down the road, past the Valley of Fangs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2921,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["quest"]=711,["y"]=0.4487},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:14:2",["text"]="Lotwil Veriatus's next study wants bracers from the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) in the south-western gulches, well above you: leave it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Rock Elemental Shard",["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:goal:14:3",["fromNpcsAt"]="1;2;2;5,2;3;3,6;3;5;5;5;5;4;3,6;5;3,6;3,6",["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["y"]=0.4578,["x"]=0.2601,["item"]=7848,["lvl"]=40,["quest"]=2258,["count"]=5,["spread"]=true,["t"]="collect"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:step:14",["text"]="The Dustbowl",["detail"]="North-west across the basin to Lotwil Veriatus's camp. Short of Jarkal's shards? The Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of the camp drop them about one kill in five."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5394,["npcName"]="Neeka Bloodscar",["x"]=0.0649,["title"]="Coyote Thieves",["quest"]=1419,["y"]=0.47200000000000003},{["map"]=1418,["note"]="Jarkal Mossmeld, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:15:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6868,["npcName"]="Jarkal Mossmeld",["x"]=0.0242,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["quest"]=2258,["y"]=0.4606},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:15:3",["text"]="The next guide flies from Kargath to Grom'gol.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands:15",["text"]="Kargath",["detail"]="Head west back to Kargath. Neeka Bloodscar stands on Kargath's upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."}},["max"]=40,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["min"]=38,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Badlands (solo 38-40)",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Badlands",["faction"]="Horde",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"} end},
{id="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",faction="Horde",races=nil,build=function()return {["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["zone"]=1434,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["x"]=0.040999999999999995,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:1:1",["text"]="Kargath flight master",["y"]=0.449,["t"]="goto"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:1:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Undercity",["t"]="fly",["node"]=11,["area"]=1497}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:1",["text"]="Fly to the Undercity",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="Your level 40 training is in the Undercity: fly there from Kargath, train, and take the zeppelin from the towers outside the city to Grom'gol."},{["goals"]={{["zone"]=1458,["locations"]={{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.8488,["y"]=0.7353000000000001,["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE"}},["npc"]=4584,["npcName"]="Gregory Charles"},{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.8891,["y"]=0.1586,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["npc"]=4565,["npcName"]="Richard Kerwin"},{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.8502,["y"]=0.1402,["only"]={["classes"]={"MAGE"}},["npc"]=4566,["npcName"]="Kaelystia Hatebringer"},{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.4757,["y"]=0.18899999999999997,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["npc"]=4608,["npcName"]="Father Lazarus"},{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.474,["y"]=0.1729,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["npc"]=4595,["npcName"]="Baltus Fowler"},{["map"]=1458,["x"]=0.4752,["y"]=0.1501,["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["npc"]=260093,["npcName"]="Garen Largo"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:2:1",["t"]="train",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:2",["text"]="Undercity trainers",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}}},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:3:1",["t"]="train",["npc"]=4773,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["npcName"]="Velma Warnam",["x"]=0.6008,["y"]=0.5257000000000001,["note"]="Velma Warnam, riding trainer"},{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:3:2",["text"]="Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:3",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE"},["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the Grom'gol zeppelin."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.618,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:4:1",["text"]="Zeppelin to Grom'gol",["y"]=0.5920000000000001,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:4",["text"]="Zeppelin to Grom'gol",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["x"]=0.040999999999999995,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:5:1",["text"]="Kargath flight master",["y"]=0.449,["t"]="goto"},{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Grom'gol",["t"]="fly",["node"]=20,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:1:2"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:5",["text"]="Fly to Grom'gol",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER","SHAMAN","DRUID"}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:6",["text"]="Grom'gol Base Camp",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2519,["npcName"]="Kin'weelay",["x"]=0.32270000000000004,["title"]="The Troll Witchdoctor",["quest"]=1240,["y"]=0.2771}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Jungle Stalker Feather",["item"]=3863,["quest"]=572,["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=687,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:3:1",["y"]=0.3654,["x"]=0.3295,["title"]="Mok'thardin's Enchantment",["from"]="Jungle Stalker",["count"]=10,["lvl"]=41,["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:3",["text"]="Jungle Stalkers",["detail"]="The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of Grom'gol. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights.\nCareful: Tethis, a level 43 elite raptor, roams among the stalkers: leave him for Raptor Mastery's group step."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:4",["text"]="Far Seer Mok'thardin",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2465,["npcName"]="Far Seer Mok'thardin",["x"]=0.3212,["title"]="Mok'thardin's Enchantmen