,["title"]="The Green Hills of Stranglethorn",["quest"]=338,["y"]=0.10529999999999999}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:28",["text"]="The Green Hills of Stranglethorn",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={338}},{["k"]="has",["item"]=2756,["n"]=1},{["k"]="has",["item"]=2757,["n"]=1},{["k"]="has",["item"]=2758,["n"]=1},{["k"]="has",["item"]=2759,["n"]=1}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Gan'zulah's Head",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1061,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:20:1",["y"]=0.0812,["x"]=0.23440000000000003,["count"]=1,["from"]="Gan'zulah",["quest"]=584,["item"]=3904,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Bloodscalp Clan Heads"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Nezzliok's Head",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1062,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:20:3",["y"]=0.0953,["x"]=0.2352,["count"]=1,["from"]="Nezzliok the Dire",["quest"]=584,["item"]=3905,["fromKind"]="npc",["title"]="Bloodscalp Clan Heads"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:29",["text"]="Zul'Kunda",["detail"]="West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok the Dire stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them.\nOn the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk (level 38 elite) shares the spawns of the ordinary crocolisks: kill it if it is up and take its skin for Drizzlik."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:30",["text"]="Grom'gol",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["note"]="the Bubbling Cauldron, beside Nimboya",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.276,["x"]=0.3222,["title"]="Bloodscalp Clan Heads",["objName"]="Bubbling Cauldron",["quest"]=584,["object"]=2076},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:4",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=40,["y"]=0.276,["x"]=0.3222,["title"]="Speaking with Nezzliok",["objName"]="Bubbling Cauldron",["pre"]={584},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=585,["object"]=2076},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Nimboya: for the Hinterlands, around level 48",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2497,["npcName"]="Nimboya",["x"]=0.32159999999999994,["title"]="Grim Message",["minLevel"]=35,["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=2932,["y"]=0.2772}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:31",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"},["races"]={"Orc"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to Orgrimmar: Kildar teaches Orcs in the Valley of Honor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel (wolves 20 gold each). Then the zeppelin back to Grom'gol. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Feralas guide passes Orgrimmar again at about 45."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:32",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"},["races"]={"Troll"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to Orgrimmar and go south down the Durotar road to Sen'jin Village: Xar'Ti teaches Trolls there, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each). Then back to the zeppelin for Grom'gol. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Feralas guide passes Orgrimmar again at about 45."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:33",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to Orgrimmar, fly to Thunder Bluff and ride down to Bloodhoof Village: Kar Stormsinger teaches Tauren there, with Harb Clawhoof's kodos (20 gold each). Then fly back to Orgrimmar for the Grom'gol zeppelin. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Feralas guide passes Thunder Bluff again at about 45."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:34",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"},["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a Galestrider, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to Orgrimmar and fly to Thunder Bluff: the skyboat to Zephras Isle leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes, and Genn Fairweather teaches Skyborne at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar. Then back to Orgrimmar for the Grom'gol zeppelin. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Feralas guide passes Orgrimmar again at about 45."},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:35",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"},["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to the Undercity's towers: Velma Warnam teaches the Forsaken in Brill, a short ride north, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each). Then the zeppelin back to Grom'gol. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Swamp of Sorrows guide passes the Undercity again at about 47."},{["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}},["goals"]={{["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:36:1",["text"]="Felsteed: Zevrost in Orgrimmar, then Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, on the Feralas guide's Orgrimmar stop.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:36",["text"]="Your mount at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="Warlocks don't buy riding: your mount is the Felsteed, from your class quest. Zevrost in Orgrimmar's Cleft of Shadow starts it and Strahad Farsan in Ratchet teaches it, both on the Feralas guide's Orgrimmar stop at about 45."},{["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95770}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="complete",["q"]=95770}},["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["superseded"]=true,["text"]="The Vile Reef",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:37",["detail"]="Locating the Lost City: west of Grom'gol, swim out over the Vile Reef and dive to the cavern entrance in the reef; the quest completes as you find it. Leave the cavern for now: the jungle stalkers are south along the coast."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:23:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=687,["y"]=0.4338,["x"]=0.2731,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["lvl"]=41,["target"]="Jungle Stalker",["count"]=10,["quest"]=196,["spread"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:38:2",["text"]="The naga explorers on the coast south of here (43-44) are for Bloads and Mok'thardin: keep both quests for your Stranglethorn stop at about 45.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:38",["text"]="Jungle stalkers",["detail"]="The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out towards the west coast.\nCareful: the Jungle Stalkers (40-41) are thick here: pull one at a time and rest between fights."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:25:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2502,["npcName"]="\"Shaky\" Phillipe",["x"]=0.26899999999999996,["title"]="Scaring Shaky",["quest"]=606,["y"]=0.7359},{["map"]=1434,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:25:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2502,["y"]=0.7359,["x"]=0.26899999999999996,["title"]="Return to MacKinley",["minLevel"]=30,["pre"]={606},["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=607,["npcName"]="\"Shaky\" Phillipe"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Whiskey Slim, in the inn: his bottles wash up on the Hinterlands coast, around level 48",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:25:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2491,["npcName"]="Whiskey Slim",["x"]=0.27140000000000003,["title"]="Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog",["minLevel"]=40,["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=580,["y"]=0.7745000000000001},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Fin Fizracket: Stranglethorn Fever (offered from 40), Unbagwa's part on the Feralas guide's Grom'gol stop",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:10:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2486,["npcName"]="Fin Fizracket",["x"]=0.2761,["title"]="Stranglethorn Fever",["minLevel"]=40,["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=348,["y"]=0.7674},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,