nor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, with a Galestrider: the skyboat to the isle leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:step:19",["text"]="Belgrom Rockmaul",["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["endNpcs"]={7777},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:goal:19:1",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=900,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["y"]=0.34240000000000004,["x"]=0.7523000000000001,["title"]="A Threat in Feralas",["minLevel"]=38,["npcName"]="Belgrom Rockmaul",["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=2981,["npc"]=4485}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["superseded"]=true,["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:step:20",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","DRUID"},["races"]={"Troll"}},["detail"]="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village, a short ride south of Orgrimmar down the Durotar road, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Ride back to Orgrimmar's flight master afterwards."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.45299999999999996,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:9:1",["text"]="Orgrimmar flight master",["y"]=0.637,["t"]="goto"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:9:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas:9",["text"]="Fly to Thunder Bluff",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN","DRUID"}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever