omes from Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later in this guide.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:3",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["detail"]="Ride south from the tunnel: Donova Snowden camps among the steaming pools of Frostfire Hot Springs, in the west of the valley."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:4:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7442,["y"]=0.3772,["x"]=0.3336,["title"]="Threat of the Winterfall",["lvl"]=54,["target"]="Winterfall Pathfinder",["count"]=8,["quest"]=5082,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:4:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7441,["y"]=0.36829999999999996,["x"]=0.33030000000000004,["title"]="Threat of the Winterfall",["target"]="Winterfall Totemic",["count"]=8,["quest"]=5082,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:4:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7440,["y"]=0.36920000000000003,["x"]=0.305,["title"]="Threat of the Winterfall",["target"]="Winterfall Den Watcher",["count"]=8,["quest"]=5082,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:4:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7450,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands",["y"]=0.3933,["x"]=0.33020000000000005,["title"]="Wild Guardians",["lvl"]=55,["target"]="Ragged Owlbeast",["quest"]=4521,["spread"]=true,["count"]=15},{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Empty Firewater Flask",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:4:5",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3772,["x"]=0.3336,["item"]=12771,["lvl"]=54,["note"]="Empty Firewater Flask: about one Winterfall furbolg in ten carries one; keep killing them until it drops",["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="5,1;1;4,5,1;6;5,1;1,4,5;1;2;2,3;3;4;4;1,5;1;1;1;4,2,3;2,3"},{["itemName"]="Empty Firewater Flask",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:4:7",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Winterfall Firewater",["item"]=12771,["minLevel"]=52,["quest"]=5083,["qlvl"]=56},{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:4:7",["fromNpcsAt"]="2,1;1;2,4,1;3;2,1;1,2,4;1;6;6,5;5;4;4;1,2;1;1;1;4,5,6;6,5",["y"]=0.3772,["x"]=0.3336,["item"]=20742,["lvl"]=54,["note"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs",["optional"]=true,["spread"]=true,["t"]="collect"},{["optional"]=true,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:4:9",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem",["item"]=20742,["qlvl"]=56,["minLevel"]=50,["quest"]=8471,["itemName"]="Winterfall Ritual Totem"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:4",["text"]="Frostfire Hot Springs: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics share the furbolg camps around the hot springs; Ragged Owlbeasts roam the slopes between them. Kill Totemics first. Save every Runecloth you loot for Meilosh.\nCareful: the Den Watchers reach 56: pull one at a time and keep clear of the camps' totems."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:5",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Threat of the Winterfall",["quest"]=5082,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Winterfall Firewater",["quest"]=5083,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9298,["y"]=0.45159999999999995,["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Falling to Corruption",["minLevel"]=52,["pre"]={5083},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=5084,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:5:4",["text"]="Falling to Corruption is turned in at the Deadwood Cauldron in Felwood, on a later trip.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:6:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7451,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands",["y"]=0.3383,["x"]=0.5132,["title"]="Wild Guardians",["lvl"]=56,["target"]="Raging Owlbeast",["quest"]=4521,["spread"]=true,["count"]=15}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:6",["text"]="Raging Owlbeasts",["detail"]="Raging Owlbeasts roam the hills north of Lake Kel'Theril, by the road between Frostfire Hot Springs and Everlook. Careful: the biggest are level 56: pull them one at a time."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:7",["text"]="Winterspring",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.607,["y"]=0.382,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:7:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Everlook",["area"]=2255}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=11139,["npcName"]="Yugrek",["x"]=0.6047,["location"]="Everlook",["y"]=0.363,["node"]=53,["area"]=2255},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:2",["text"]="Gregor's quests lead to other zones: keep them.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10305,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker",["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["minLevel"]=52,["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=3783,["y"]=0.3762},{["map"]=1452,["note"]="Gregor Greystone, inside",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10431,["npcName"]="Gregor Greystone",["x"]=0.6135,["title"]="The Everlook Report",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=6029,["y"]=0.3897},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10431,["npcName"]="Gregor Greystone",["x"]=0.6135,["title"]="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=6030,["y"]=0.3897},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10468,["npcName"]="Felnok Steelspring",["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Felnok Steelspring",["quest"]=4808,["y"]=0.3861},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:8:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10468,["y"]=0.3861,["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Chillwind Horns",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={4808},["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=4809,["npcName"]="Felnok Steelspring"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:8",["text"]="Everlook",["detail"]="Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley, past the owlbeast hills."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Thick Yeti Fur",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:9:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3983,["x"]=0.6405,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["lvl"]=55,["item"]=12366,["quest"]=3783,["spread"]=true,["count"]=10}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:9",["text"]="Ice Thistle yetis",["detail"]="The yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Every yeti drops fur: work the Ice Thistle Yetis (55-56) and leave the Matriarchs and Patriarchs (56-58), whose horns come on a later visit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Uncracked Chillwind Horn",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:10:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.41700000000000004,["x"]=0.6119,["title"]="Chillwind Horns",["lvl"]=59,["item"]=12444,["quest"]=4809,["spread"]=true,["count"]=8}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:10",["text"]="Chillwind chimaeras",["detail"]="The chimaeras roam the snowfields south and west of Everlook. Stay clear of Mazthoril's cave: its blue dragonkin are elite."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:11",["text"]="Everlook",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10305,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker",["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["quest"]=3783,["y"]=0.3762},{["map"]=1452,["note"]="Umi: keep it, the Pristine Yeti Horns come on the Eastern Plaguelands guide's Everlook stop at about 57",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10305,["y"]=0.3762,["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["minLevel"]=52,["pre"]={3783},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=977,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker"},{["map"]=1452,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:14:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10468,["npcName"]="Felnok Steelspring",["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Chillwind Horns",["quest"]=4809,["y"]=0.3861},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:11:4",["text"]="The Matriarchs and Patriarchs that carry Umi's horns are 56-58: leave them for that later stop.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:16",["text"]="Fly to Camp Mojache",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.605,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:16:1",["text"]="Everlook flight master",["y"]=0.363,["t"]="goto"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:16:2",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["location"]="Camp Mojache",["t"]="fly",["node"]=42,["area"]=1099}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:17",["text"]="Talo Thornhoof",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7776,["npcName"]="Talo Thornhoof",["x"]=0.7618,["title"]="The Strength of Corruption",["quest"]=4120,["y"]=0.43829999999999997}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Evoroot",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=164798,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.102,["x"]=0.445,["item"]=11242,["from"]="Evoroot",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:14:1"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:step:14",["text"]="Evoroot",["detail"]="The Evoroot grows inside a ruined building north of Gregan Brewspewer's camp, east of the harpies' Ruins of Ravenwind: climb in through the broken part of its wall."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["parent"]=3909,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7775,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="has",["item"]=11242,["n"]=1}},["npcName"]="Gregan Brewspewer",["x"]=0.4512,["title"]="The Videre Elixir",["minLevel"]=47,["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=4041,["y"]=0.2557},{["itemName"]="Videre Elixir",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="has",["item"]=11242,["n"]=1}},["fromFaction"]="AH",["item"]=11243,["quest"]=3909,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=7775,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring:goal:15:2",["y"]=0.2557,["x"]=0.