rde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:52:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8737,["y"]=0.081,["x"]=0.44659999999999994,["title"]="A Gnome's Assistance",["minLevel"]=47,["pre"]={3914},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=3941,["npcName"]="Linken"},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:52:4",["text"]="A Gnome's Assistance goes to J.D. Collie in the cave here, on the next guide's return to Marshal's Refuge: keep it.",["t"]="note",["soloSpeedrun"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:52",["text"]="Marshal's Refuge",["detail"]="The flight lands at Marshal's Refuge: Spraggle Frock stands beside the flight master, and Linken by the cave a few steps away. Spraggle Frock's work is in Un'Goro on the next guide's way back north."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:53:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13220,["npcName"]="Layo Starstrike",["x"]=0.8187000000000001,["title"]="Wasteland",["quest"]=1124,["y"]=0.1893},{["map"]=1451,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:53:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=13220,["y"]=0.1893,["x"]=0.8187000000000001,["title"]="The Spirits of Southwind",["minLevel"]=54,["pre"]={1124},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=1125,["npcName"]="Layo Starstrike"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:53",["text"]="Layo Starstrike",["detail"]="The pass from Un'Goro comes out at Valor's Rest, the graveyard in north-east Silithus. Layo Starstrike stands among the graves."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:54:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12178,["y"]=0.47200000000000003,["x"]=0.6492,["title"]="The Spirits of Southwind",["lvl"]=56,["target"]="Tortured Druid",["quest"]=1125,["count"]=8},{["map"]=1451,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:54:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12179,["y"]=0.4849,["x"]=0.