vel 57",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=57}},["detail"]="The Dredge Crushers (57-58) of the south-east are two over you below 57. First top up to 57 on the Dredge Strikers (55-56) on the sands east of Cenarion Hold, where Sand Skitterers and Stonelash Scorpids (54-56) roam among them, away from the Silithid Darters of the northern sands."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["x"]=0.507,["t"]="goto",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:8:1",["text"]="Dredge Crusher",["y"]=0.591,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=58}}},{["map"]=1451,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:8:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11741,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=58}},["y"]=0.5908,["x"]=0.5065999999999999,["title"]="Stepping Up Security",["lvl"]=58,["target"]="Dredge Crusher",["count"]=20,["quest"]=8281,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1451,["note"]="grind on Dredge Crusher",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:8:3",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=58}},["npcName"]="Dredge Crusher",["x"]=0.5065999999999999,["lvl"]=58,["y"]=0.5908,["level"]=58,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=11741}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:8",["text"]="Level 58",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=58}},["detail"]="Top up here to level 58 before Ortell's Rock Stalkers (57-59) and the south; Commander Mar'alith's Dearest Natalia, back at Cenarion Hold, needs level 58 too. The Dredge Crushers (57-58) on the way south-east are the ones Windcaller Proudhorn wants: leave the Twilight cultists around them be."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["note"]="Below ground",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15194,["npcName"]="Hermit Ortell",["x"]=0.