arlet Medic",["count"]=2,["quest"]=6004,["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:51:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.31989999999999996,["x"]=0.48340000000000005,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee",["objName"]="Termite Barrel",["quest"]=5902,["object"]=177491},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:51:2",["t"]="accept",["qlvl"]=55,["y"]=0.31989999999999996,["x"]=0.48340000000000005,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee",["objName"]="Termite Barrel",["pre"]={5902},["minLevel"]=48,["quest"]=6390,["object"]=177491}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:54",["text"]="Scarlet Crusade",["detail"]="Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it. Set Mickey Levine's termite barrel down in the middle of the lumber mill while you are there.\nCareful: a Fallen Hero, a level 58-59 elite, can stand at the lumber camp, as at many other spots of the Western Plaguelands: give it room."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:49",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:49:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11610,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6004,["y"]=0.28059999999999996},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:49:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11610,["y"]=0.28059999999999996,["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={6004},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=6023,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:50:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11613,["y"]=0.361,["x"]=0.5783,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["target"]="Huntsman Radley",["quest"]=6023,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:50:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11611,["y"]=0.23620000000000002,["x"]=0.5515,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["target"]="Cavalier Durgen",["quest"]=6023,["count"]=1}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:50",["text"]="Radley and Durgen",["detail"]="Huntsman Radley stands east of the lumber camp; Cavalier Durgen guards the road north-east of Kirsta Deepshadow, toward Hearthglen.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:52",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:52:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11610,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6023,["y"]=0.28059999999999996},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:52:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11610,["y"]=0.28059999999999996,["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={6023},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=6025,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:73",["text"]="Davil's Libram",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="The libram lies further north, on the way to Hearthglen."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.45799999999999996,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:54:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.183},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:54:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Overlook Hearthglen from a high vantage point"}},["y"]=0.18600000000000003,["x"]=0.455,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6025}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:54",["text"]="Hearthglen",["detail"]="Hearthglen's Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out.\nCareful: Sentinels posted at the gate can detect stealthed players. Additional sentinels are found within the town, and an elite walks a patrol route nearby."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:55",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:55:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11610,["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["quest"]=6025,["y"]=0.28059999999999996}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Chromie, upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10667,["npcName"]="Chromie",["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="A Matter of Time",["minLevel"]=53,["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=4971,["y"]=0.6676000000000001},{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Beacon Torch",["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.662,["x"]=0.423,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["quest"]=5098,["item"]=12815},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10903,["y"]=0.6624,["x"]=0.4233,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["target"]="Andorhal Tower Two",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5098,["text"]="Mark Andorhal Tower Two with the Beacon Torch"},{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Temporal Displacer",["item"]=12627,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:4",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.628,["x"]=0.452},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:61:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10717,["y"]=0.6283,["x"]=0.4521,["title"]="A Matter of Time",["lvl"]=57,["target"]="Temporal Parasite",["quest"]=4971,["count"]=10},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=3,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:6",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10904,["y"]=0.6325,["x"]=0.44299999999999995,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["target"]="Andorhal Tower Three",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5098,["text"]="Mark Andorhal Tower Three with the Beacon Torch"},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=4,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:7",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10905,["y"]=0.7105,["x"]=0.46619999999999995,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["target"]="Andorhal Tower Four",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5098,["text"]="Mark Andorhal Tower Four with the Beacon Torch"},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:56:8",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10902,["y"]=0.716,["x"]=0.40049999999999997,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["target"]="Andorhal Tower One",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5098,["text"]="Mark Andorhal Tower One with the Beacon Torch"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:61",["text"]="Andorhal watchtowers and silos",["detail"]="Ride south into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the Beacon Torch to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:57",["text"]="Chromie",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:57:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10667,["npcName"]="Chromie",["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="A Matter of Time",["quest"]=4971,["y"]=0.6676000000000001},{["map"]=1422,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:57:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10667,["y"]=0.6676000000000001,["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="Counting Out Time",["minLevel"]=53,["pre"]={4971},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=4972,["npcName"]="Chromie"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Andorhal Watch",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=175802,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:58:1",["y"]=0.682,["x"]=0.40299999999999997,["count"]=5,["from"]="Small Lockbox",["quest"]=4972,["item"]=12638,["fromKind"]="object",["title"]="Counting Out Time"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:58",["text"]="Counting Out Time",["detail"]="The lockboxes sit in Andorhal's ruined houses around Chromie's inn. Careful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:59",["text"]="Chromie",["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:59:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10667,["npcName"]="Chromie",["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="Counting Out Time",["quest"]=4972,["y"]=0.6676000000000001}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:60",["text"]="Tirisfal Glades",["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.83,["y"]=0.7190000000000001,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:60:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="The Bulwark",["area"]=152}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:66",["text"]="The Bulwark",["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11055,["npcName"]="Shadow Priestess Vandis",["x"]=0.8304,["title"]="Return to the Bulwark",["quest"]=5230,["y"]=0.7191},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11055,["y"]=0.7191,["x"]=0.8304,["title"]="Target: Dalson's Tears",["minLevel"]=50,["pre"]={5230},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=5231,["npcName"]="Shadow Priestess Vandis"},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10837,["npcName"]="High Executor Derrington",["x"]=0.8312999999999999,["title"]="All Along the Watchtowers",["quest"]=5098,["y"]=0.6894},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10837,["y"]=0.6894,["x"]=0.8312999999999999,["title"]="Scholomance",["minLevel"]=55,["pre"]={5098},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=838,["npcName"]="High Executor Derrington"},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11057,["npcName"]="Apothecary Dithers",["x"]=0.8328,["title"]="Scholomance",["quest"]=838,["y"]=0.6923},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11057,["y"]=0.6923,["x"]=0.8328,["title"]="Skeletal Fragments",["minLevel"]=55,["pre"]={838},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=964,["npcName"]="Apothecary Dithers"},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:61:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11615,["npcName"]="Mickey Levine",["x"]=0.8329000000000001,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee",["quest"]=6390,["y"]=0.7234}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:74",["text"]="High Executor Derrington",["superseded"]=true,["detail"]="Alas, Andorhal's shard lies at Araj the Summoner's feet, in the middle of Andorhal: he is a level 61 elite with elite Skeletal Warlords about him, a fight for a group."},{["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:62",["text"]="Skeletal Fragments",["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Skeletal Fragments",["item"]=14619,["quest"]=964,["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=1783,["t"]="collect",["id"]="solo:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:62:1",["count"]=15,["y"]=0.551,["x"]=0.374,["title"]="Skeletal Fragments",["lvl"]=51,["fromAlso"]="Skeletal Sorcerer",["from"]="Skeletal Flayer",["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=1784}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Dalson's Tears Cauldron Key",["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=11077,["t"]="colle