 Larders",["lvl"]=6,["item"]=5469,["quest"]=92553,["spread"]=true,["count"]=8}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle:step:30",["text"]="Shen'dar Village: kill these as you meet them",["detail"]="Prideclaws and Galestriders share the meadows around Shen'dar Village; the Galestriders graze thickest just west of it. They drop both the Small Eggs and the Strider Meat for Zerril Softbreeze."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle:31:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251905,["npcName"]="Zerril Softbreeze",["x"]=0.4385,["title"]="Restocking the Larders",["quest"]=92553,["y"]=0.4384}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle:31",["text"]="Shen'dar Village hand-ins",["detail"]="Zerril Softbreeze, Teeri Wellwind, Taleen Shimmerthread, Danarii Bellowveil and Constable Aonda all stand in Shen'dar Village. If you are still short of Strider Meat, the Galestriders graze just west of the village; the Al'Aketh camps south and south-east of it are a level or two higher."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Prideclaw Pelt",["item"]=252670,["quest"]=92515,["map"]=2521,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=251245,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle:goal:32:1",["y"]=0.4447,["x"]=0.4257,["title"]="The Problem With Prideclaws",["lvl"]=6,["count"]=10,["from"]="Prideclaw",["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true},{["map"]=2521,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle:goal:32:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257521,["y"]=0.43270000000000003,["x"]=0.4432,["title"]="Meddlesome Mages",["lvl"]=6,["target"]="High Order Apprentice",["quest"]=94411,["count"]=6},{["itemName"]="Pilfered Windstone",["item"]=257945,["quest"]=93319,["map"]=2521,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=251918,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:fore