nkin Stone",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["detail"]="The stone stands in the pass out of Mulgore, on your way east. Use the Cenarion Lunardust there and defeat Lunaclaw."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["x"]=0.423,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:81:1",["text"]="Into Mulgore",["y"]=0.217,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:81",["text"]="Into Mulgore",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="From Elder Rise, take Thunder Bluff's north lift down: at its foot the way runs east along the ledge, then south-east across Mulgore to the Barrens."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:82",["text"]="Into Barrens",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.419,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:82:1",["text"]="Into Barrens",["y"]=0.586,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Kirge Sternhorn: for Thork at the Crossroads",["endNpcs"]={3429},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:83:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3418,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["npcName"]="Kirge Sternhorn",["x"]=0.44880000000000003,["qlvl"]=12,["minLevel"]=9,["y"]=0.5861,["title"]="Journey to the Crossroads",["quest"]=854,["xp"]=230},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Omusa Thunderhorn, beside Kirge Sternhorn",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:83:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=10378,["npcName"]="Omusa Thunderhorn",["x"]=0.4445,["location"]="Camp Taurajo",["y"]=0.5915,["node"]=77,["area"]=378}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:83",["text"]="Kirge Sternhorn",["detail"]="Kirge Sternhorn stands 