auren/01-mulgore:step:93",["text"]="Uzzek",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="Far Watch Post sits above the Southfury River bridge on the road to Orgrimmar: Uzzek stands beside Kargal Battlescar."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:94:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5900,["npcName"]="Telf Joolam",["x"]=0.38549999999999995,["title"]="Call of Fire",["quest"]=1524,["y"]=0.5896},{["map"]=1411,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:94:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5900,["y"]=0.5896,["x"]=0.38549999999999995,["title"]="Call of Fire",["minLevel"]=10,["pre"]={1524,97243},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=1525,["npcName"]="Telf Joolam"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:94",["text"]="Telf Joolam",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Over the bridge below Far Watch Post and south along the Durotar bank of the river to where a narrow trail climbs the mountain: Telf Joolam keeps the shrine at the top. Mind the edges on the way up, and come back down the same trail."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Singed Scale",["item"]=6486,["quest"]=1498,["map"]=1411,["fromId"]=3130,["oi"]=1,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:95:1",["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=3131,["title"]="Path of Defense",["y"]=0.3131,["x"]=0.391,["count"]=5,["lvl"]=11,["from"]="Thunder Lizard",["fromAlso"]="Lightning Hide",["fromKind"]="npc",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/02-the-barrens"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:95",["text"]="Thunder lizards on the way north",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR"}},["detail"]="Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge, beside the road north to Orgrimmar; any of them can drop a Singed Scale. Uzzek takes them when the next guide passes Far Watch Post.\nCareful: Halikor, a level 12 elite, roams Thunder Ridge among the lizards: watch for him before you pull."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Reagent Pouch",["item"]=6652,["quest"]=1525,["map"]=1411,["oi"]=2,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["fromId"]=3199,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:goal:96:1",["y"]=0.2571,["x"]=0.5189,["title"]="Call of Fire",["lvl"]=11,["count"]=1,["from"]="Burning Blade Cultist",["fromKind"]="npc",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/02-the-barrens"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:step:96",["text"]="Dustwind Gulch cultists",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch, east of the road north to Orgrimmar; they drop the Reagent Pouch. The Fire Tar comes from the Razormane on the next guide's first visit to their camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.556,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:87:1",["text"]="Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength",["y"]=0.723,["t"]="goto"}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore:87",["text"]="To Orgrimmar",["detail"]="From the Crossroads follow the road north-east to Far Watch Post, cross the Southfury River into Durotar and keep north to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar and takes the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest."}},["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; adapted Forever solo leveling plan",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore",["max"]=13,["next"]="solo:forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest",["zoneName"]="Mulgore",["min"]=1,["availability"]="source-listed",["races"]={"Tauren"},["category"]="Leveling",["faction"]="Horde",["name"]="Mulgore (solo 1-13)",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["zone"]=1412} end},
