er"}},["zone"]=1420,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:59:11",["t"]="train",["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["class"]=true}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:step:59",["text"]="Brill",["detail"]="Cain Firesong (mages), Dark Cleric Beryl (priests), Rupert Boch (warlocks) and Marion Call (rogues) stand upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:59:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1738,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=10}},["npcName"]="Deathguard Terrence",["x"]=0.614,["title"]="The Argent Emissary",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=96895,["y"]=0.534}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:59",["text"]="Deathguard Terrence",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=10}},["detail"]="From level 10 Deathguard Terrence offers The Argent Emissary: Hadric Harlson waits at Linnea's camp, the next stop. Below 10 it waits for the Brill visit after Agamand Mills."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:60:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1495,["npcName"]="Deathguard Linnea",["x"]=0.6548999999999999,["title"]="Forsaken Duties",["quest"]=359,["y"]=0.6025},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:60:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1495,["y"]=0.6025,["x"]=0.6548999999999999,["title"]="Return to the Magistrate",["minLevel"]=6,["pre"]={359},["qlvl"]=9,["quest"]=360,["npcName"]="Deathguard Linnea"},{["map"]=1420,["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:60:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3549,["npcName"]="Shelene Rhobart",["x"]=0.6543000000000001,["title"]="Hides for the Forsaken",["quest"]=97558,["y"]=0.6012}},["soloSpeedrun"]=true,["id"]="solo:fo